    ["\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor, offers {quest:2872} from level 40 (under 40, this guide's last {area:35} stop offers it again)."] = "位于顶层的“海狼”马克基雷从40级起提供{quest:2872}（未满40级的话，本指南最后一次经停{area:35}时还会再次提示接取）。",
