    ["A group choice at your level: the {npc:260148} that answers {quest:92591}'s bone pile is level 59-60."] = "以你的等级，组不组队自己决定：回应{quest:92591}骨堆的{npc:260148}是 59-60 级。",
    ["A group choice at your level: the {npc:260148} that answers {quest:92592}'s bone pile is level 59-60."] = "以你的等级，组不组队自己决定：回应{quest:92592}骨堆的{npc:260148}是 59-60 级。",
    ["A group choice below level 58: the {npc:260148} that answers the burnt bone pile is level 59-60. Grouping up is advised. The hand-in waits for the ride back to {area:16848} at the end of this guide."] = "58 级以下组不组队自己决定：回应被烧骨堆的{npc:260148}是 59-60 级。建议组队。交任务等本指南最后骑回{area:16848}时再交。",
    ["A group choice below level 58: the {npc:260148} that answers the burnt bone pile is level 59-60. Grouping up is advised. {npc:244511} takes the amulet on the ride back to {area:16848} at the end of this guide."] = "58 级以下组不组队自己决定：回应被烧骨堆的{npc:260148}是 59-60 级。建议组队。{npc:244511}会在本指南最后骑回{area:16848}时收下护符。",
    ["A group choice below level 58: the {npc:260148} that answers the burnt bone pile is level 59-60. Grouping up is advised; alone, this guide comes back past the pile later."] = "58 级以下组不组队自己决定：回应被烧骨堆的{npc:260148}是 59-60 级。建议组队；单人的话，本指南之后会再经过骨堆。",
    ["A group choice: {npc:263394} and {npc:252457} are level 60 elites until {npc:263406}'s eye drains them. Drain each one first, then fight it; players in our recordings killed both once drained. Grouping up is advised."] = "组不组队自己决定：在{npc:263406}的眼睛吸干它们之前，{npc:263394}和{npc:252457}都是 60 级精英。先吸干再打；我们录像里的玩家在吸干后把两个都杀了。建议组队。",
    ["A group choice: {npc:9298} sends you after {quest:5121} (59, elite, with his guards) in the cave at the back of {area:2244}, back east past {area:2255}; Xandivious (62) shares the cave: leave him. The High Chief carries a log for {npc:9298}, and her next errand goes to {npc:10920} at the {area:2479}, this guide's last stop."] = "组队与否自己决定：{npc:9298}让你去打{area:2244}后面洞里的{quest:5121}（59 级，精英，带着护卫），往东越过{area:2255}；赞迪维厄斯（62 级）也在那个洞里：别碰他。大酋长身上带着给{npc:9298}的日志，她的下一个任务交给本指南最后一站{area:2479}的{npc:10920}。",
    ["A group stop: the Blackthorne camps north-east of the Summit hold elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier (60) as often as the Cultists and Adepts, with {npc:260674} (60, elite) in the middle and Ghansurok (61, elite) on the ridge. Grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip these if you are alone."] = "组队站：峰顶东北的黑棘营地里，精英斥候、牧师和一名信使（60 级）和教徒、学徒一样常见，{npc:260674}（60 级，精英）在中间，甘苏洛克（61 级，精英）在山脊上。鼓励组队，找人一起做。单人就跳过这些。",
    ["A {zone:1419} mob dropped a {item:8244}: Kum'isha pays for it too."] = "{zone:1419}的怪物掉落了{item:8244}：库米沙也会为此付酬。",
    ["About 100 quests in Forever's new endgame zone, 57 to 59, then on to {zone:1451}."] = "Forever 新的满级前区域，约 100 个任务，57 到 59 级，然后前往{zone:1451}。",
    ["After {npc:729}, back here: the next guide takes the zeppelin to {zone:1454} from the tower on the west side of the camp."] = "打完{npc:729}后回到这里：下一个指南从营地西侧的塔坐飞艇去{zone:1454}。",
    ["Alchemy Workstation"] = "炼金工作台",
    ["Alchemy Workstation disrupted"] = "炼金工作台已破坏",
    ["Alliance: the amulet from the second pass goes to {npc:244517}: ride west across the foothills and north up the valley to {area:16848}, about four minutes, then back up to the Summit."] = "联盟：第二次经过拿到的护符交给{npc:244517}：往西越过山麓，再沿山谷往北到{area:16848}，大约四分钟，然后再回到峰顶。",
    ["Already have all eight Tumbled Crystals? Hand them to {npc:737} now."] = "已经凑齐八块打磨过的水晶了？现在就交给{npc:737}。",
    ["Anachronos"] = "阿纳克洛斯",
    ["Anvilrage Footman"] = "铁怒步兵",
