    ["Arbington's next task goes to {area:976}, behind the route now: skip it."] = "阿宾顿的下一步任务要去{area:976}，已经偏离当前路线：跳过。",
    ["Assist Walton"] = "协助沃尔顿",
    ["At the northern end of {area:16868}: something has dug up the grave. The Fleshflay Raveners around it carry what was taken."] = "在{area:16868}北端：有什么东西把坟墓挖开了。周围的剥皮掠食者带着被拿走的东西。",
    ["Atrexis the Grave Knight"] = "墓穴骑士阿特雷克西斯",
    ["Back down the road to {area:205}: {npc:1075} wants the {object:147516} explosives under the far end of the span destroyed. Keep to the camp's east side, away from Modr (32, elite) in the ruins."] = "沿路返回{area:205}：{npc:1075}要你摧毁大桥远端下方的{object:147516}炸药。靠营地东侧走，远离废墟里的莫德尔（32级，精英）。",
    ["Back down to town: Shaky stands at the tunnel mouth; {npc:2488} and MacKinley are on the top floor."] = "回到镇上：“病鬼”菲利普站在隧道口；{npc:2488}和马克基雷在顶层。",
    ["Back east along the road from {area:413} to {area:415}: {npc:3691} in the inn, the flight master at the west end."] = "从{area:413}沿路向东返回{area:415}：{npc:3691}在旅店里，飞行管理员在西端。",
    ["Back east along the road to Theramore: {npc:4944} takes the deserters' news on the top floor of {area:514}, and the flight master stands by its gate."] = "沿路向东返回塞拉摩：{npc:4944}在{area:514}顶层接收逃兵的消息，飞行管理员就站在大门旁。",
    ["Back east along the road, past {area:75}: the Atal'ai artifacts lie in the water and on the banks of the {quest:1424}. Only Sawfin Frenzies (38-40) swim there."] = "沿大路往东回去，经过{area:75}：阿塔莱神器散落在{quest:1424}的水里和岸边。那里只有锯鳍狂鱼（38-40 级）。",
    ["Back east past {area:2237}: the {item:12732} grows on the ground among the Grimtotem camps below {area:2097}. Start with the three plants close together at the camps' north-western edge, where the arrow points, and stay on that side; the agave comes back while you work.\nCareful: the Ravaging elementals (38-40) and {npc:216463} (38, elite) hold the ground south and east of the camps, from about 36,35: don't follow the agave past them."] = "向东越过{area:2237}：{item:12732}长在{area:2097}下方恐怖图腾营地之间的地上。从营地西北边缘挨在一起的三株开始，也就是箭头指的位置，并待在那一侧；你采的时候龙舌兰会重新长出来。\n小心：营地南边和东边从大约 36,35 起是暴虐元素（38-40 级）和{npc:216463}（38 级，精英）的地盘：别追着龙舌兰过去。",
    ["Back east to {npc:11063} at the chapel."] = "向东返回礼拜堂找{npc:11063}。",
    ["Back from {zone:2482}"] = "从{zone:2482}返回",
    ["Back from {zone:2482} in {area:2255}: {npc:11118}'s mail went astray in the hills east of town, where the Ice Thistle yetis carry it off."] = "从{zone:2482}回到{area:2255}：{npc:11118}的邮件在镇东的山丘里遗失了，被冰蓟雪人叼走了。",
    ["Back from {zone:2482}: fly from {area:2255} to {area:976} for {npc:9299}, {npc:7583} and Pestlezugg, then on to {area:541} and {zone:1451}."] = "从{zone:2482}回来：从{area:2255}飞往{area:976}找{npc:9299}、{npc:7583}和佩斯特扎格，然后继续飞往{area:541}和{zone:1451}。",
    ["Back into {area:1770}: the succubus {npc:9518} (56) waits on the way to its deepest chamber, with Trey Lightforge's remains beside her.\nCareful: {npc:9518} is level 56: clear the cultists around her first and fight her at full health."] = "再次进入{area:1770}：魅魔{npc:9518}（56级）守在通往最深处密室的路上，特雷·莱特弗格的遗骸就在她身旁。\n小心：{npc:9518}是56级，先清掉她周围的邪教徒，满血再开战。",
    ["Back north into {area:1438}: Connar, then Danneth again once he is home. {npc:3546} takes his scales here too."] = "向北返回{area:1438}：先找康纳，等丹内斯回来后再找他。{npc:3546}也在这里收他的鳞片。",
    ["Back north through Menethil: {npc:1217} is in the {area:2104}, on the way to the hovels."] = "向北穿过米奈希尔：{npc:1217}在{area:2104}里，就在去棚屋区的路上。",
    ["Back north through {area:1769}'s tunnel to {npc:9298}."] = "向北穿过{area:1769}的隧道返回{npc:9298}处。",
    ["Back north to {npc:8395}'s camp at the foot of the cliff and get off your mount: he teleports you up to Xylem again."] = "向北返回悬崖脚下{npc:8395}的营地并下坐骑：他会再次把你传送到克希雷姆那里。",
    ["Back north to {npc:8509} beside {npc:8479}."] = "往北回到{npc:8479}旁边的{npc:8509}处。",
    ["Back north, just south of {area:976}, use the {item:8524} now: the two-hour timer starts. The Blisterpaw Hyenas, Glasshide Basilisks and Scorpid Hunters share the dunes here. Each can drop an untested sample: use it, and it either passes as an acceptable one or is lost. Keep killing until you have eight of each. No power source in your bags, or its two hours ran out? Abandon {quest:654} if it is in your log, then take Another Power Source? from {npc:7407}: he gives a new one for ten more Wastewander Water Pouches, from the Wastewander camps east of {area:976}."] = "往北回去，就在{area:976}南边，现在使用{item:8524}：两小时计时开始。水疱爪鬣狗、琉璃皮蜥蜴和蝎子猎手共享这片沙丘。每种都可能掉落未测试的样本：使用它，要么合格成为可用样本，要么丢失。一直杀到每种都有八个。背包里没有能量源，或者它的两小时用完了？如果日志里有{quest:654}就放弃它，然后从{npc:7407}那里接「另一个能量源？」：他会再给你一个，代价是再交十个荒野游荡者水袋，来自{area:976}东边的荒野游荡者营地。",
    ["Back north-east to the {area:192}: knights and magi work the camp, the medics and hunters camp south of it. Set {npc:11615}'s termite barrel down in the middle of the lumber mill while you are there.\nCareful: a {npc:10996}, a level 58-59 elite, can stand at the lumber camp, as at many other spots of the {zone:1422}: give it room."] = "往东北回到{area:192}：骑士和法师在营地里干活，医生和猎人在营地南边扎营。在那里时把{npc:11615}的白蚁桶放在伐木场中间。\n小心：一只{npc:10996}（58-59 级精英）可能站在伐木营地，{zone:1422}的很多地方都有它：给它留出空间。",
    ["Back north-west along the road to {area:75}: {npc:1443}, on the top floor, takes the artifacts. {quest:1430}'s crawlers and {npc:5593}'s murlocs wait for your next swamp visit."] = "沿大路向西北回到{area:75}：顶楼的{npc:1443}收下神器。{quest:1430}的爬行者和{npc:5593}的鱼人留到下次来沼泽时再做。",
    ["Back north-west to the post, on your way west."] = "向西北回到哨站，然后往西走。",
    ["Back north-west to {npc:1855}'s hut."] = "往西北回到{npc:1855}的小屋。",
    ["Back over the span and down the road to {area:205}, on the camp's east side, away from Modr (32, elite) in the ruins."] = "过桥沿路返回{area:205}，走营地东侧，远离废墟里的莫德尔（32级，精英）。",
    ["Back south to the Sanctuary: {npc:9529} takes the shards on the west side of the camp."] = "往南回到圣所：营地西侧的{npc:9529}收下碎片。",
    ["Back south-east past {npc:11863}'s tower to the Burning Blade's fortress: {npc:5644} hides inside it."] = "向东南绕过{npc:11863}的高塔，前往火刃氏族的堡垒：{npc:5644}就藏在里面。",
    ["Back south-east to the {area:228}."] = "向东南返回{area:228}。",
    ["Back through the Timbermaw tunnel and south down the {zone:1448} road to {area:1997}."] = "穿过木喉隧道回去，沿{zone:1448}的大路往南到{area:1997}。",
    ["Back through the portal to {area:702} and fly to {area:442} for the boat."] = "穿过传送门返回{area:702}，飞往{area:442}坐船。",
    ["Back through the tunnel to {zone:1448} and south past {area:1998}: the {quest:5086} (53) roam the north-eastern tip of {area:1767}."] = "穿过隧道回到{zone:1448}，向南经过{area:1998}：{quest:5086}（53级）在{area:1767}的东北角游荡。",
    ["Back to Osi, then the two elders at the back of the burrow. {npc:260661} stands beside Osi, {npc:256660} a little north-west of them, where the recording met him. {npc:260661}'s moss grows around {area:16848}, later in this guide; {npc:256660}'s amulets come from the harpies at the {area:16867}, also later in this guide, and you bring both back here then."] = "回到奥西那里，然后找巢穴深处的两位长老。{npc:260661}站在奥西旁边，{npc:256660}在他们西北一点，录像里是在那里遇到他的。{npc:260661}要的苔藓长在{area:16848}周围，本指南后面会去；{npc:256660}要的护符来自{area:16867}的鹰身人，也在本指南后面，到时候把两样都带回这里。",
    ["Back to Theramore for the boat to {area:150}."] = "返回塞拉摩坐船去{area:150}。",
    ["Back to Truesong at {area:3137}: {zone:1448}, the next guide, is a short ride west."] = "回到{area:3137}找特鲁松：下一篇指南{zone:1448}往西骑一小段路就到。",
    ["Back to the Sin'dorei Tome: hand in the seals, then use it to call {npc:8578}.\nCareful: Rimtori is level 55, and which crystal is linked to him is random: each of the other two summons a hostile infernal instead. Start at full health."] = "回到辛多雷典籍那里：交上印记，然后用它召唤{npc:8578}。\n小心：瑞姆托里是 55 级，而且哪块水晶和他相连是随机的：另外两块各会召唤一个敌对的地狱火。满血再开始。",
    ["Back to the camp: Valorfist, then {npc:11053} beside him."] = "返回营地：先找瓦罗菲斯特，再找他身旁的{npc:11053}。",
    ["Back to {area:16743}: from {area:16726} south-west down the river, or from the port, where your Hearthstone is set. {npc:256418} in the middle of the fort: {npc:255829}'s word sends him looking for {npc:258570}, his warrior in the west."] = "回到{area:16743}：从{area:16726}沿河往西南走，或者从港口走（你的炉石绑定在那里）。要塞中央的{npc:256418}：{npc:255829}的话会让他去找他在西边的战士{npc:258570}。",
    ["Back to {area:16848}"] = "返回{area:16848}",
    ["Back to {area:3197}."] = "返回{area:3197}。",
    ["Back to {area:3425}. {npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "返回{area:3425}。{npc:15189}在他所在建筑的楼上：进门上楼，箭头无法区分楼层。",
    ["Back to {area:362}: {npc:3171}'s next beast and {npc:5810}'s road to {area:379} start here. Everyone else hands {quest:99051} to {npc:3142} when the {zone:1413} guide passes {area:362} on its way out."] = "返回{area:362}：{npc:3171}的下一只野兽和{npc:5810}前往{area:379}的路线都从这里开始。其他职业等{zone:1413}指南途经{area:362}离开时，再把{quest:99051}交给{npc:3142}。",
    ["Back to {area:415} on the way to the west: {npc:3894} is inside the building beyond the inn."] = "往西途中回到{area:415}：{npc:3894}在旅店后面的建筑里。",
    ["Back to {area:442}"] = "返回{area:442}",
    ["Back to {npc:11063} at {area:2268} with your group."] = "和队伍一起返回{area:2268}找{npc:11063}。",
    ["Back to {npc:264089}, then the ghostly {npc:255009} at {area:16868}'s western edge, where the recording met him, on your way west."] = "回到{npc:264089}那里，然后往西走的路上找{area:16868}西边缘的幽灵{npc:255009}，录像里是在那里遇到他的。",
    ["Back to {npc:3293} by the road."] = "回到路边的{npc:3293}处。",
    ["Back to {npc:7775}'s camp, just south-east of {npc:7765}: the {item:11242} buys three Videre Elixirs. Keep them: {npc:9298} takes one at the start of the next guide, and Gaeriyan in {area:976} shows himself only to someone who has drunk one."] = "回到{npc:7765}东南方不远处{npc:7775}的营地：用{item:11242}可以换三瓶视灵药剂。留好它们：下一篇指南一开始{npc:9298}要收一瓶，而{area:976}的盖瑞恩也只会在你喝下一瓶后才会现身。",
    ["Back up the road to {area:159}, on the way north-west to {area:157}. The Wanted poster for {npc:1753} stands beside {npc:1515}, in front of the inn."] = "沿路返回{area:159}，顺道向西北前往{area:157}。通缉{npc:1753}的通缉令就立在旅店前{npc:1515}旁边。",
    ["Back up to the {area:16849}: {npc:260626}, at the ancients' outpost, flies there, and your Hearthstone is bound there."] = "回到{area:16849}：古树前哨的{npc:260626}可以飞过去，你的炉石也绑定在那里。",
    ["Back west along the road from {area:199} to the {area:152}: {npc:11055} takes the cauldron's report."] = "沿大路从{area:199}往西回到{area:152}：{npc:11055}收下大锅的报告。",
    ["Back west to the road and over the {area:814} bridge: {area:379} sits just above it on the {zone:1413} side. {npc:3337}, {quest:809} and {npc:5810} stand together."] = "向西回到大路，过{area:814}桥：{area:379}就在桥的{zone:1413}一侧上方。{npc:3337}、{quest:809}和{npc:5810}站在一起。",
    ["Back west to the {area:396}."] = "向西返回{area:396}。",
    ["Back west to {npc:10302} at the hot springs."] = "向西返回温泉找{npc:10302}。",
    ["Back west to {npc:260626} at the ancients' outpost and fly to {area:493}. Druids: {spell:18960} is quicker. (No flight path to {area:493} yet? The road in is {area:1769}'s tunnel, from {zone:1452} or {zone:1448}.)"] = "往西回到古树前哨的{npc:260626}，飞往{area:493}。德鲁伊：{spell:18960}更快。（还没有{area:493}的飞行路线？进去的路是{area:1769}的隧道，从{zone:1452}或{zone:1448}走。）",
    ["Back west up the hill to {npc:11863}'s tower with the sceptre, then south along the road to {area:2407}."] = "带着权杖向西上山回到{npc:11863}的高塔，然后沿路向南前往{area:2407}。",
    ["Barkskin Burrow"] = "树皮巢穴",
    ["Bazzalan"] = "巴札兰",
    ["Bear berries"] = "熊莓",
    ["Before the second wave: its raiders (44-45), bombardiers (43-44) and {quest:95124}'s ships after them (45) are more than a level over you below 44. Top up on the first camp's buccaneers and musketeers (41-43) at its south-west end, away from the port. {npc:259758}, a rare elite of level 49, roams these cliffs: if you see him, keep well away. Or, with a group, run the {area:1517} dungeon instead."] = "进入第二波之前：这里的袭击者（44-45级）、投弹手（43-44级）以及之后的{quest:95124}船队（45级）在你未满44级时都比你高出不止一级。先在第一个营地西南端远离港口处刷海盗和火枪手（41-43级）补等级。49级稀有精英{npc:259758}在这片悬崖上游荡：看到他务必远远避开。如果有队伍，也可以改为去打{area:1517}地下城。",
    ["Befouled Water Elemental"] = "被污染的水元素",
    ["Berserk Owlbeasts"] = "狂暴枭兽",
    ["Big Will"] = "大个子威尔",
    ["Blackwood Pathfinders and Windtalkers hold the camp south-east of {area:442}; Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills around it.\nCareful: the Windtalkers (13-14) cast from range and the furbolgs stand in pairs: pull them one at a time."] = "黑木探路者和黑木风语者盘踞在{area:442}东南方的营地；狂暴的蓟熊在周围山丘上游荡。\n小心：黑木风语者（13-14级）会远程施法，而且熊怪往往成对站立：一次只拉一只。",
    ["Blood Elf Reclaimer"] = "血精灵开垦者",
    ["Blood Elf Surveyor"] = "血精灵勘测员",
    ["Bloodsail tents and rowboat"] = "血帆帐篷与划艇",
    ["Boat to {area:150}"] = "乘船前往{area:150}",
    ["Bonegnaw defeated"] = "啃骨者已被击败",
    ["Bones and stolen life"] = "白骨与被窃的生命",
    ["Brazier of Eternal Flame"] = "永恒之火火盆",
    ["Brazier of Offering"] = "献祭火盆",
    ["Brinescale Explorers and Sorceresses guard the way to {npc:258924}, the second boss. The second tablet is close to him. Once he is dead, disrupt the barrier close to where he fell; you do it once more after {npc:260042}."] = "盐鳞探险者和女巫守着通往第二个首领{npc:258924}的路。第二块石板就在他附近。他死后，扰乱他倒下的地方附近的屏障；打完{npc:260042}后还要再扰乱一次。",
    ["Brinescale Skirmishers around the {area:104} drop the tridents. The cavern entrance the quest asks for is under the reef, in {area:17853}: due west of {object:3202} and south-west of the reef's tablet."] = "{area:104}周围的盐鳞散兵会掉三叉戟。任务要求的洞穴入口在礁石下面的{area:17853}：在{object:3202}正西、礁石石板的西南。",
    ["Burn the bone pile at the south-eastern end of {area:16868} with the {item:274411}: the {npc:260148} that answers carries the amulet.\nCareful: the {npc:260148} is level 59-60: burn the bone pile last, at full health, with the ruins around it cleared."] = "用{item:274411}烧掉{area:16868}东南端的骨堆：回应的{npc:260148}带着护符。\n小心：{npc:260148}是 59-60 级：最后再烧骨堆，满血，并先清掉周围废墟里的怪。",
    ["Burn the bone pile at the south-eastern end of {area:16868} with the {item:274411}: the {npc:260148} that answers carries the amulet. The hand-in waits for the ride back to {area:16848} at the end of this guide.\nCareful: the {npc:260148} is level 59-60: burn the bone pile last, at full health, with the ruins around it cleared."] = "用{item:274411}烧掉{area:16868}东南端的骨堆：回应的{npc:260148}带着护符。交任务等本指南最后骑回{area:16848}时再交。\n小心：{npc:260148}是 59-60 级：最后再烧骨堆，满血，并先清掉周围废墟里的怪。",
    ["Buzzbeak defeated"] = "嗡嗡喙已被击败",
    ["Careful: Den Watchers are level 53-54 and the Deadwood Avengers 54-55; they call nearby allies within 25 yd once below 50% health and run off for help below 15%.\nIf one drops a {quest:8470} (about one kill in thirty), right-click it; don't stay to farm one. {npc:11558} in {area:1769} takes it only from Neutral with the Timbermaw (the {area:1769} reputation guide gets you there): now if they already are, or on the last guide's pass of the cave."] = "小心：巢穴守望者是 53-54 级，死木复仇者是 54-55 级；血量低于 50% 时会呼叫 25 码内的同伴，低于 15% 时会逃跑求救。\n如果掉了{quest:8470}（大约每三十只掉一个），右键点击它；别为了刷它一直待着。{area:1769}的{npc:11558}要和木喉要塞达到中立才收（{area:1769}声望指南可以帮你达到）：已经中立就现在交，否则在最后一个指南经过洞穴时交。",
    ["Careful: Scarlet Paladins (55-56) and priests guard {item:12954} inside {area:190}'s town hall. They are elite, and a {npc:1839} (63, elite) stands near the book. Go in with your group; stay out of the Clerist's reach."] = "小心：{area:190}市政厅里的{item:12954}由血色圣骑士（55-56级）和牧师把守。他们都是精英，而且书旁边还站着一名{npc:1839}（63级，精英）。和队伍一起进去，别踏入高阶牧师的警戒范围。",
    ["Careful: Slavers can net you and call allies within 15 yards. A Taskmaster or Steamsmith may be standing beside one. Wait for a clear pull or leave the pack; don't descend into the Cauldron for this bounty."] = "小心：黑铁奴隶贩子会用网定身你并呼唤15码内的盟友，身旁可能还站着黑铁工头或黑铁锻造师。等有稳妥的单拉机会再动手，或直接避开那堆怪；别为了这个悬赏下到大熔炉里。",
    ["Careful: the Twilight Keepers are level 60: clear the cultists around each one first and fight the keeper at full health.\n{npc:11803} holds the cultists' camp in the far south-west."] = "小心：暮光守护者都是60级，先清掉周围的邪教徒，满血再与守护者交战。\n{npc:11803}盘踞在最西南方的邪教徒营地。",
    ["Careful: the Western Front is written for level 44 and up. Its Twilight Champions are 43-44 and its Thralls 44, Twilight Enforcers (elites, 45) patrol through the camps, and {npc:256881} (46, elite) is for a group only. Below 44, top up on the Eastsea pirates by the port first, or come back with a friend."] = "小心：西部前线路线是按44级及以上设计的。这里的暮光勇士为43-44级、暮光奴仆为44级，暮光执法者（45级，精英）在营地间巡逻，而{npc:256881}（46级，精英）只能组队击杀。未满44级时，先在港口旁刷东海海盗补等级，或叫上朋友再来。",
    ["Careful: the grizzlies are 55-56: pull them one at a time."] = "小心：灰熊是 55-56 级：一次拉一只。",
    ["Careful: west of the cove the Daggerspine Raiders and Sorceresses (38-40) stand close together on the shore: pull them one at a time. The two wrecks lie in the shallows off it, the charts and logs inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around the wrecks.\nCareful: the charts and logs lie deep inside the wrecks: watch your breath bar and come up between them; a water breathing potion makes it easy."] = "小心：海湾西边的海岸上，刺鳍掠夺者和女巫（38-40 级）挨得很近：一次拉一个。两艘沉船在离岸不远的浅水里，海图和航海日志在船里，宝石散落在沉船周围的海底。\n小心：海图和日志在沉船深处：留意呼吸条，在两者之间浮上来换气；喝一瓶水下呼吸药水会轻松很多。",
    ["Careful: {npc:3667} (16) is over you: pull her on her own at full health. {npc:2184}, a rare (17), also walks the ruins: leave her be."] = "小心：{npc:3667}（16级）等级比你高：满血单拉她。17级稀有怪{npc:2184}也在废墟里游荡：别去招惹她。",
    ["Carry the {object:149047} south along the rim of the Cauldron and light the four Sentry Braziers, from the south-west round to the east."] = "带着{object:149047}沿大锅边缘往南，点燃四个哨兵火盆，从西南绕到东边。",
    ["Check the hilltop on your way to the raptors. If {npc:729} isn't here or you can't pull her alone, keep moving; {npc:717} can take the paw on the later visit."] = "去打迅猛龙的路上顺便看看山顶。如果{npc:729}不在，或者没法单拉，就继续往前走；下次再来时再把爪子交给{npc:717}即可。",
    ["Check the two outdoor Matriarchs (56) on the western slope of the yetis' hills. Leave the Patriarchs (57) and the cave alone. If you don't get both horns on this pass, skip the hunt and Umi's hand-in."] = "去雪人山丘西坡看看那两只露天的冰蓟雪人女王（56级）。别去惹冰蓟雪人王（57级）和山洞里的怪。如果这一趟没打齐两根角，就跳过狩猎和乌米的交任务步骤。",
    ["Chub'chob defeated"] = "查布乔布已被击败",
    ["Claire is in the cave under the eastern edge of {area:16723}: its entrance is at 50.0,46.0."] = "克莱尔在{area:16723}东缘下方的山洞里：洞口坐标为 50.0, 46.0。",
    ["Clear the cultists around him first and come in with full health and mana."] = "先清掉他周围的教徒，满血满蓝再上。",
    ["Close enough to see the Blightcaller in front of the house"] = "靠近到能看见屋前的凋零者即可",
    ["Clubtoe"] = "棍趾",
    ["Coagulated Rot"] = "凝结的腐质",
    ["Coming from the {zone:1441} guide, you stand beside {area:378}'s flight master: this guide flies on from here."] = "如果你是从{zone:1441}指南过来的，现在就站在{area:378}的飞行管理员旁边：本指南从这里起飞。",
    ["Coming from {zone:1445}: {area:496}'s flight master flies you to {area:976}."] = "从{zone:1445}过来的话：{area:496}的飞行管理员可以带你飞到{area:976}。",
    ["Control Four Bases."] = "控制四座基地。",
    ["Cooks with 285 {skill:185} or more: {npc:15174}, the innkeeper you just bound with, wants word of the Twilight's Hammer's sandworm recipe; the cookbook lies in the outpost west of the Hold, where this guide goes later."] = "{skill:185}达到 285 或以上的厨师：你刚绑定炉石的旅店老板{npc:15174}想知道暮光之锤的沙虫食谱；食谱书在要塞西边的前哨里，本指南后面会去。",
    ["Corrupted Growth"] = "被腐化的增生",
    ["Corrupted Soul Shards from the cultists, for {npc:9529}' Salve via Hunting"] = "教徒身上的腐化灵魂碎片，用于{npc:9529}的「以狩猎换取药膏」",
    ["Cross the river south-east to the {area:2261}, the crypt in the south-west of the zone.\nCareful: About four non-elite adds come with Mercutio. They walk to the grave instead of appearing on the spot."] = "向东南过河前往地区西南方的墓穴{area:2261}。\n小心：墨丘提奥会带着大约四名非精英小怪。它们会走到坟墓那里，而不是直接刷新在原地。",
    ["Cross the river west to {npc:1855}'s hut.\nCareful: the short way from {area:2627} to {npc:1855} is the {area:2626}, whose south mouth opens by his hut: Crypt Fiends, Walkers, Horrors and Slayers (53-58) stand close together inside. Pull them one at a time, or ride round by the road outside it."] = "向西过河前往{npc:1855}的小屋。\n小心：从{area:2627}去{npc:1855}的近路是{area:2626}，南口就在他小屋旁，但里面的地穴恶魔、地穴行者、地穴恐魔和地穴杀手（53-58级）站得很密。要么一次拉一只，要么走外面的大路绕过去。",
    ["Culling the Competition"] = "清除竞争对手",
    ["Cure Completed"] = "解药完成",
    ["Dae'gun Horde Tower scouted"] = "已侦察达古恩部落塔楼",
    ["Dark Iron Slavers"] = "黑铁奴隶贩子",
    ["Dark Iron Steamsmiths at the surface furnaces carry Thorium Plated Daggers as well as the {item:18959}. Pull from the outside of the camp."] = "地面熔炉旁的黑铁锻造师除了掉落{item:18959}外，也会掉落瑟银镀层匕首。从营地外围往外拉怪。",
    ["Dark Iron Taskmasters"] = "黑铁工头",
    ["Darkshore Threshers"] = "黑海岸长尾鲛",
    ["Darthalia's next {quest:528}, Samsa's Souvenirs of Death and Lydon's Elixir of Agony are for the next visit, at about 30."] = "达萨利亚的下一个{quest:528}、萨姆萨的「死亡纪念品」和莱顿的「痛苦药剂」留到下次来时再做，约 30 级。",
    ["Deadwood Den Guardians"] = "死木巢穴守卫",
    ["Decide What to do with Felflick"] = "决定如何处置邪舌",
    ["Defeat Vorsha the Lasher"] = "击败鞭笞者沃尔莎",
    ["Defend Professor Phizzlethorpe"] = "保护菲兹尔索普教授",
    ["Delivery to {npc:4046}, from Jediga in {zone:1447}"] = "送给{npc:4046}的货物，来自{zone:1447}的杰迪加",
    ["Derrington's {quest:838} is offered from level 55: still under 55 here, the next {area:152} stop offers it again."] = "德灵顿的{quest:838}从 55 级起提供：这时还不到 55 级的话，下次到{area:152}时会再次提供。",
    ["Destroy the command tent and plant the Scourge banner in the camp"] = "摧毁指挥帐篷并在营地插上天灾军团的旗帜",
    ["Deviate Dreadfang"] = "变异恐牙",
    ["Deviate Ravager"] = "变异破坏者",
    ["Deviate Shambler"] = "变异蹒跚者",
    ["Deviate Viper"] = "变异毒蛇",
    ["Dig up the {quest:3161} ornaments around the {area:1938} and north of the {area:983}."] = "在{area:1938}周围和{area:983}北边挖出{quest:3161}要的饰品。",
    ["Discover Darkwhisper Gorge"] = "发现暗语峡谷",
    ["Discover the Brood of Nozdormu."] = "发现诺兹多姆的子嗣。",
    ["Disease Workstation"] = "疾病工作台",
    ["Divino-matic Rod"] = "占卜魔杖",
    ["Dizzywig's next errand goes back to the {area:2240}, which the route next visits at 45: leave it."] = "迪兹维格的下一步差事要回{area:2240}，路线45级才会再去：先别接。",
    ["Down the {area:485} into {zone:1441}. Careful: wait on the platform until the lift is level with it before you step on, and stay on it until it stops; the drop beside it kills. {item:5791} lies a couple of hundred yards north-east of the lift's foot, in {area:2097}, where the Grimtotems (25-27) camp."] = "乘{area:485}下到{zone:1441}。小心：在平台上等电梯齐平了再上去，停稳后再下，旁边掉下去会摔死。{item:5791}就在电梯底部东北方向几百码处的{area:2097}，恐怖图腾（25-27级）扎营在那里。",
    ["Dredge Strikers dig in the dunes north-west of the hold; Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers roam all around.\nCareful: {npc:15185} (62, elite) guard the Caverns of Time's mouth in the south-west, around 21,82: stay out of there."] = "掘泥打击者在要塞西北的沙丘里挖掘；石鞭蝎和掠沙蜘蛛在四周游荡。\n小心：{npc:15185}（62级，精英）守在西南方时光之穴的入口处（约 21, 82）：别靠近那里。",
    ["Drive Overlord Mok'Morokk from Brackenwall Village"] = "把霸王莫克莫洛克赶出蕨墙村",
    ["Dumah's next task sets a barrel down at Northridge, behind you now: skip it."] = "杜玛的下一步任务要去北山伐木场放木桶，已经落在路线后面了：跳过。",
    ["Dustwallow's quests are 35-38, and {npc:729} (37) is next. Still below 36 after {object:3202}'s hand-ins? The Snapjaw Crocolisks (35-36) line the river just east of the camp, below the Mosh'Ogg hills: kill them until level 36. Leave the Mosh'Ogg ogres (36-37) above them alone."] = "尘泥沼泽的任务是 35-38 级，接下来是{npc:729}（37 级）。交完{object:3202}的任务还不到 36 级？钳嘴鳄鱼（35-36 级）就在营地东边莫什奥格山下的河边：杀到 36 级。别碰它们上方的莫什奥格食人魔（36-37 级）。",
    ["East across the Cradle to {npc:268168}."] = "往东穿过摇篮找{npc:268168}。",
    ["East across the foothills to the Hermit's Abode."] = "往东越过山麓回到隐士居所。",
    ["East along the road past {area:199}, {npc:11077} guards the cauldron at {area:200}: kill him for the key, then use the cauldron."] = "沿大路往东经过{area:199}，{npc:11077}守着{area:200}的大锅：杀了他拿钥匙，然后使用大锅。",
    ["East along the valley road to the eastern pylon and repair it the same way with the {item:271882}, coming in from the west and pulling the nearest {npc:252711} away first: {npc:253527} (level 43, elite) and his bodyguards hold the south side of the quilboar camp, and a Corpsefeeder (level 45, elite) walks the road."] = "沿山谷道路向东前往东侧水晶塔，用{item:271882}以同样方式修复：从西侧接近，先把最近的{npc:252711}拉开击杀。{npc:253527}（43级，精英）和他的护卫盘踞在野猪人营地南侧，还有一只食尸者（45级，精英）在路上巡逻。",
    ["East from the Cradle towards the {area:16867}, where the Wormwing harpies nest: a corrupted growth on the shrine's western slope starts a quest for {npc:260825}."] = "从摇篮往东前往{area:16867}，蠕翼鹰身人在那里筑巢：神龛西坡上一处被腐化的增生会开始{npc:260825}的任务。",
    ["East from the city gate to {area:736}"] = "从城门向东前往{area:736}",
    ["East from the fortress along the northern hills to the satyrs' ruins of {area:603}. The Shadowstalkers walk unseen.\nCareful: Hatefury Rogues use Hide when they spawn, so they are stealthed until you find them."] = "从要塞向东沿北边的山前往萨特的废墟{area:603}。暗影潜伏者是隐形的。\n小心：怒怨盗贼刷新时会潜行，你发现它们之前它们都是隐身的。",
    ["East from the fortress to {area:603}, the Hatefury satyrs' ruins in the north-east (32-33, well under you now): two of each kind."] = "从要塞向东到东北的怒怨萨特废墟{area:603}（32-33 级，现在比你低很多）：每种各杀两只。",
    ["East from the keg toward {quest:881}: {npc:3682} camps below the hills, and his errands lie in the plains beside his camp."] = "从酒桶往东前往{quest:881}：{npc:3682}在山脚下扎营，他的任务就在营地旁的平原上。",
    ["East from the ruins, hunt Lashtail Raptors around the hill south-west of Nesingwary's camp. If you have {quest:187}, are at least 36 and see {npc:729} (37) alone, you can take her paw here or leave the hunt for your next visit."] = "从废墟向东，在奈辛瓦里营地西南方的山丘周围猎杀鞭尾迅猛龙。如果你接了{quest:187}、至少36级，并且看到{npc:729}（37级）落单，可以顺手拿她的爪子，也可以留到下次再来。",
    ["East from {npc:1244}: the Crimson Whelps (25-26) nest in the hills north-east of the {area:1036}, and the Highland Razormaws (27-28) hunt the highlands north of them, towards {area:205}. The Perfect Razormaw Eggs lie in the raptors' nests.\nCareful: {quest:98283}, an elite raptor, prowls the hills north of the whelps, and Ados, an elite {npc:270892} guardian, stands at the {area:1038}: give both room. The Dragonmaw east of {npc:270637} are elite too."] = "从{npc:1244}向东：深红雏龙（25-26级）在{area:1036}东北方的山丘筑巢，高地剃刀之喉迅猛龙（27-28级）在其北面朝向{area:205}的高地上狩猎。完美的剃刀之喉蛋就在迅猛龙巢穴里。\n小心：精英迅猛龙{quest:98283}在雏龙北边的山丘游荡，精英{npc:270892}守护者阿多斯守在{area:1038}：都要绕开。{npc:270637}东边的龙喉兽人也是精英。",
    ["East past {area:16868} into the {area:17145}: {npc:255683}, the great cat, waits by the path, and {npc:267109} rests in the ruins just south of her."] = "往东越过{area:16868}进入{area:17145}：巨猫{npc:255683}在小路旁等着，{npc:267109}在她南边不远的废墟里休息。",
    ["East past {area:200} to the {area:202}: {npc:11076} guards its cauldron."] = "往东越过{area:200}到{area:202}：{npc:11076}守着那里的大锅。",
    ["East through the South Gate tunnel into {area:38}. {npc:1089} and {npc:1092} stand at the dwarven post just past it."] = "向东穿过南门隧道进入{area:38}。刚出隧道的矮人哨站里站着{npc:1089}和{npc:1092}。",
    ["East through the valley to the strange crystal on its pedestal: clicking it starts {quest:92914}. The Decrepit Pylon Protectors (levels 42-43) around it are the mana elementals that guard it. Corpsefeeders (level 45, elite) roam the valley east of here.\nCareful: click the crystal from the road on its west side and move on: the Protectors stand two and three together east and north-east of it, where Corpsefeeders and the Magram Necrokhans (elites, 45) walk too."] = "穿过山谷往东，到底座上那块奇怪的水晶：点击它开始{quest:92914}。它周围的衰败水晶塔守护者（42-43 级）是守护它的法力元素。食尸者（45 级，精英）在这里东边的山谷里游荡。\n小心：从水晶西边的路上点击它，然后继续走：守护者两三个一组站在它的东边和东北，食尸者和玛格拉姆死灵可汗（45 级精英）也在那里走动。",
    ["East up to the {area:16849}, the druids' camp. {npc:41861}, the flight master, stands at its north end; {npc:264795}, {npc:243855} and {npc:254915} along the path south; {npc:40833} indoors next to Thisalee; {npc:243815}, the innkeeper, at the south-east end."] = "往东上到德鲁伊营地{area:16849}。飞行管理员{npc:41861}站在营地北端；{npc:264795}、{npc:243855}和{npc:254915}沿着往南的小路；{npc:40833}在西萨莉旁边的室内；旅店老板{npc:243815}在东南端。",
    ["Eastern pylon found"] = "已找到东边的水晶塔",
    ["Emma's charm goes back to {npc:10778} in the {zone:1422}, behind you now: skip it."] = "艾玛的护符要送回{zone:1422}的{npc:10778}，已经落在路线后面了：跳过。",
    ["Emma's charm goes back to {npc:10778} in the {zone:1422}, out of the way now: skip it."] = "艾玛的护符要送回{zone:1422}的{npc:10778}，现在绕远路了：跳过。",
    ["Ends in {area:392}, on the next guide: keep it"] = "在下一篇指南的{area:392}交任务：先留着",
    ["Ends with {npc:9298} in {zone:1452}, later in this guide: keep it"] = "本指南稍后在{zone:1452}交给{npc:9298}：先留着",
    ["Enter the Dead Fields"] = "进入死亡农田",
    ["Entropic Beast"] = "熵能野兽",
    ["Entropic Horror"] = "熵能恐魔",
    ["Erland must reach Rane Yorick"] = "埃尔兰德必须到达雷恩·约里克处",
    ["Escort Galen out of the Fallow Sanctuary."] = "护送加伦离开休耕圣地。",
    ["Escort Gilthares Firebough back to Ratchet"] = "护送吉尔萨雷斯·火枝返回棘齿城",
    ["Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle."] = "护送拉科塔·风歌离开黑云峰。",
    ["Escort Lumina Windsinger to safety"] = "护送卢米娜·风歌者到安全的地方",
    ["Escort OOX-09/HL to the shoreline beyond Overlook Cliff"] = "护送 OOX-09/HL 到瞭望崖另一边的海岸",
    ["Escort OOX-17/TN to Steamwheedle Port"] = "护送 OOX-17/TN 到热砂港",
    ["Escort OOX-22/FE to the dock along the Forgotten Coast"] = "护送 OOX-22/FE 沿遗忘海岸到达码头",
    ["Escort Pao'ka from Highperch"] = "护送帕奥卡离开高栖地",
    ["Escort Rin'ji to safety"] = "护送林吉到安全的地方",
    ["Escort Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge"] = "护送林戈到马绍尔营地的斯普拉格·弗洛克处",
    ["Escort Ruul from the Thistlefurs."] = "护送鲁尔逃离蓟皮熊怪。",
    ["Escort Wizzlecrank out of the Venture Co. drill site"] = "护送维兹勒克兰克离开风险投资公司的钻井平台",
    ["Escort Zimmix Sputterspark to safety"] = "护送齐米克斯·火花到安全的地方",
    ["Essence of Nightlash"] = "夜鞭精华",
    ["Events Observed"] = "已观看事件",
    ["Every Bloodsail drops Snuff and one of them carries {npc:2493}'s eye: take them from the Raiders and Mages (39-41) at the Bloodsail camp on the beach just north of town, where you found the letter. Leave the {area:43} camp south of town (Warlocks and Swashbucklers 41-43) for the level-48 visit.\nCareful: Rippa (44, a rare crocolisk) swims the shore beside the camp: stay out of the water."] = "所有血帆海盗都会掉落鼻烟，其中一人身上还带着{npc:2493}的义眼：去镇子正北海滩的血帆营地（就是你捡到信的地方）打血帆袭击者和法师（39-41级）。镇子南边的{area:43}营地（41-43级术士和剑客）留到48级再来。\n小心：44级稀有鳄鱼里帕在营地旁的岸边水里游荡：别下水。",
    ["Every Darkfang spider drops them: Lurkers, Spiders, Venomspitters and the Giant Darkfang Spiders"] = "所有暗牙蜘蛛都会掉：潜伏者、蜘蛛、喷毒者和巨型暗牙蜘蛛",
    ["Every Horde quest of the {area:16550} in one run, lead-ins included."] = "一次跑完{area:16550}的所有部落任务，包括前置任务。",
    ["Every ghoul of the {area:492}'s northern half can drop a rib: Flesh Eaters and Bone Chewers (24-27) are the easier kills; Plague Spreaders and Brain Eaters (27-29) drop them too. {npc:522}, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.\nCareful: A {npc:948} casts {spell:3428} as it dies, which brings extra adds.\nCareful: {npc:503} (31) and {npc:771} (32), both rares, haunt the cemetery's north and west, and {npc:1200} (32, elite) keeps to the house at its western edge: leave them be."] = "{area:492}北半部的所有食尸鬼都有可能掉落肋骨：食肉者和啃骨者（24-27级）更好打，瘟疫传播者和食脑者（27-29级）也会掉。精英怪{npc:522}在墓地间游荡：离他远点。\n小心：{npc:948}死时会施放{spell:3428}，引来额外小怪。\n小心：稀有怪{npc:503}（31级）和{npc:771}（32级）出没在墓地北侧和西侧，精英怪{npc:1200}（32级）守在西缘的屋子里：别去招惹他们。",
    ["Explore the craters in Shatter Scar Vale"] = "探索碎痕谷的陨石坑",
    ["Explore the waters of the Forgotten Pools"] = "探索遗忘之池的水域",
    ["Eye of Kilrogg guided to the road"] = "引导基尔罗格之眼到达大路",
    ["Fandral stands at the top of the druids' building of the {area:1658}; {npc:4217}, next, is lower down inside it."] = "范达尔站在{area:1658}德鲁伊建筑的顶层；接下来要找的{npc:4217}就在同一栋建筑的下方楼层。",
    ["Fandral stands at the top of the druids' building; {npc:4217}, next, is lower down inside it."] = "范达尔站在德鲁伊建筑的顶层；接下来要找的{npc:4217}就在同一栋建筑的下方楼层。",
    ["Fathom Core"] = "深渊核心",
    ["Fel-slime crystals"] = "邪能软泥水晶",
    ["Fenwick's survival pack"] = "芬威克的求生包",
    ["Fight G45-B4G in a stress test of Sleebo's engine."] = "在斯利波引擎的压力测试中对战 G45-B4G。",
    ["Fill Cuely's four vials at the tide pools on the shore, from {area:1231} north up the coast; Spitelash naga patrol between them."] = "在海岸的潮汐池里装满库埃利的四个小瓶，从{area:1231}沿海岸往北；怒鞭纳迦在潮汐池之间巡逻。",
    ["Fill {item:11682} at the moonwell inside the Temple of the Moon."] = "在月神殿里的月亮井装满{item:11682}。",
    ["Fill {npc:267109}'s gourd at the falls beside the bridge. {npc:255685}, one of {npc:255683}'s kittens, plays just west of the falls: walk up to her."] = "在桥边的瀑布装满{npc:267109}的葫芦。{npc:255683}的一只小猫{npc:255685}在瀑布西边玩耍：走到她身边。",
    ["Find the Drowned City Entrance"] = "找到淹没之城的入口",
    ["Find the Spider God's Name"] = "找出蜘蛛神的名字",
    ["Find the hottest area of Fire Plume Ridge"] = "找到火羽山最热的地方",
    ["Find where Gol'dir is being held"] = "找到关押戈尔迪尔的地方",
    ["Finish the slime ooze"] = "补齐软泥怪任务",
    ["Fish until skill 50, about 50 catches: below 75 every catch raises the skill, so any of your faction's starting-area shores will do and the arrow leads to the nearest: Sen'jin coast ({zone:1411}), {area:223} ({zone:1412}) and {area:162} ({zone:1420}), and for Skyborne also {area:16638} shore (Zephras Isle). Cast {skill:356} from your spellbook, click the bobber when it splashes. Keep the fish: they are your first {skill:185} ingredients. Fish get away at these shores below skill 25; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap. To cook what you catch: {item:6325} for the {item:6291} of lakes and rivers ({skill:185} 1, 40c: {npc:5940} ({zone:1412}), {npc:3550} ({zone:1420}) and {npc:257006} (Zephras Isle)); {item:6326} for the {item:6303} of the coast ({skill:185} 1, 40c: {npc:5942} ({zone:1411}), {npc:3550} ({zone:1420}) and {npc:257006} (Zephras Isle))."] = "钓到技能 50，大约 50 次：75 以下每钓一次都会提升技能，所以本阵营新手区的任何岸边都可以，箭头会带你去最近的：森金海岸（{zone:1411}）、{area:223}（{zone:1412}）和{area:162}（{zone:1420}），天空族还有{area:16638}岸边（泽弗拉斯岛）。从法术书施放{skill:356}，浮标溅起水花时点击它。留着鱼：它们是你最早的{skill:185}材料。技能低于 25 时在这些岸边会脱钩；鱼竿上装鱼饵能在十分钟内提高技能，弥补差距。烹饪你钓到的鱼：{item:6325}用于湖泊和河流的{item:6291}（{skill:185} 1，40 铜：{npc:5940}（{zone:1412}）、{npc:3550}（{zone:1420}）和{npc:257006}（泽弗拉斯岛））；{item:6326}用于海岸的{item:6303}（{skill:185} 1，40 铜：{npc:5942}（{zone:1411}）、{npc:3550}（{zone:1420}）和{npc:257006}（泽弗拉斯岛））。",
    ["Fish until skill 50, about 50 catches: below 75 every catch raises the skill, so any of your faction's starting-area shores will do and the arrow leads to the nearest: {area:18} ({zone:1429}), {area:211} ({zone:1426}) and {area:702} ({zone:1438}), and for Skyborne also {area:16638} shore (Zephras Isle). Cast {skill:356} from your spellbook, click the bobber when it splashes. Keep the fish: they are your first {skill:185} ingredients. Fish get away at these shores below skill 25; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap. To cook what you catch: {item:6325} for the {item:6291} of lakes and rivers ({skill:185} 1, 40c: {npc:66} ({zone:1429}), {npc:8508} ({zone:1426}), Nyoma ({zone:1438}) and {npc:257006} (Zephras Isle)); {item:6326} for the {item:6303} of the coast ({skill:185} 1, 40c: {npc:4305} ({zone:1436}), {npc:5162} ({zone:1455}), {npc:10118} ({zone:1438}) and {npc:257006} (Zephras Isle))."] = "钓到技能 50，大约 50 次：75 以下每钓一次都会提升技能，所以本阵营新手区的任何岸边都可以，箭头会带你去最近的：{area:18}（{zone:1429}）、{area:211}（{zone:1426}）和{area:702}（{zone:1438}），天空族还有{area:16638}岸边（泽弗拉斯岛）。从法术书施放{skill:356}，浮标溅起水花时点击它。留着鱼：它们是你最早的{skill:185}材料。技能低于 25 时在这些岸边会脱钩；鱼竿上装鱼饵能在十分钟内提高技能，弥补差距。烹饪你钓到的鱼：{item:6325}用于湖泊和河流的{item:6291}（{skill:185} 1，40 铜：{npc:66}（{zone:1429}）、{npc:8508}（{zone:1426}）、尼奥玛（{zone:1438}）和{npc:257006}（泽弗拉斯岛））；{item:6326}用于海岸的{item:6303}（{skill:185} 1，40 铜：{npc:4305}（{zone:1436}）、{npc:5162}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:10118}（{zone:1438}）和{npc:257006}（泽弗拉斯岛））。",
    ["Fly down to {npc:260626} for {npc:249235} and {npc:256222}."] = "飞下去找{npc:260626}，再去找{npc:249235}和{npc:256222}。",
    ["Fly from {area:976} to {area:541}. {npc:9997}'s friend {npc:9999} has gone missing; {npc:8737} stands at the back of the refuge, with {npc:9117} in the cave behind him; {npc:9618} stands just outside, on the way out east."] = "从{area:976}飞往{area:541}。{npc:9997}的朋友{npc:9999}失踪了；{npc:8737}站在避难所后方，他身后的洞穴里是{npc:9117}；{npc:9618}就在外面，往东离开的路上。",
    ["Fly to the Crossroads: from {area:378} if you come from the {zone:1441} guide, else from the flight master nearest you."] = "飞往十字路口：从{zone:1441}指南过来的话从{area:378}飞，否则从离你最近的飞行管理员飞。",
    ["Fly to the {area:16853}"] = "飞往{area:16853}",
    ["Fly to {area:1099} (or hearth there, if your hearthstone is ready: it is still bound there from the {zone:1444} & {zone:1446} guide)."] = "飞往{area:1099}（如果炉石好了就用炉石回去：它还绑定在{zone:1444}和{zone:1446}指南时设的那里）。",
    ["Fly to {area:392} (from {area:378} if you come from the {zone:1441} guide, else from the flight master nearest you). {npc:5901} camps on the coast a short walk south of the town; fly on to the Crossroads from {area:392}."] = "飞往{area:392}（从{zone:1441}指南过来的话从{area:378}飞，否则从离你最近的飞行管理员飞）。{npc:5901}在镇子南边不远的海岸上扎营，之后从{area:392}飞往十字路口。",
    ["Fly to {area:493}"] = "飞往{area:493}",
    ["Fly to {area:493} from {area:2255}'s flight master. No flight path to {area:493} yet? The way in is the tunnel through {area:1769}, at the western end of {zone:1452}."] = "从{area:2255}的飞行管理员飞往{area:493}。还没有{area:493}的飞行路线？进去的路是穿过{area:1769}的隧道，在{zone:1452}西端。",
    ["Fly to {area:541} in {zone:1449}, the way into {zone:1451}."] = "飞往{zone:1449}的{area:541}，从那里进入{zone:1451}。",
    ["Fly to {zone:1453} for Highlord Bolvar's errand for SI:7 and {npc:10778}'s parcel, then straight back."] = "飞往{zone:1453}处理大领主伯瓦尔交给军情七处的差事和{npc:10778}的包裹，办完直接飞回。",
    ["Follow the road back to {area:1537} if you left the city. {npc:6175} walks through the Commons."] = "如果你离开了主城，就沿路返回{area:1537}。{npc:6175}在平民区里巡逻走动。",
    ["Follow the road east to the {area:419}. {npc:3916} stands by the moonwell."] = "沿路向东前往{area:419}。{npc:3916}站在月亮井旁。",
    ["Follow the road north-east from {area:131} to the depot: the whole east of {area:1} is one sweep from here."] = "从{area:131}沿路向东北前往补给站：从这里可以一趟扫清整个{area:1}东部。",
    ["Follow the road north-east to {area:1767}. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a {item:11503}; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo, and their organs are {npc:10920}'s."] = "沿大路向东北前往{area:1767}。树林东边的扭木苔藓剥皮者和撕碎者每只都带着一个{item:11503}；怒爪灰熊和魔爪掠夺者在同一片树林里游荡，为了塔罗的任务，它们的器官是{npc:10920}要的。",
    ["Follow the road north-west out of Theramore to the watchtower at {area:503}, where the road to the {area:403} turns west. Look around the tower: {npc:4967} appears at its foot, and you hand the quest in to him there."] = "从塞拉摩沿路向西北走到{area:503}的瞭望塔，通往{area:403}的道路在此向西拐。在塔周围转转：{npc:4967}会在塔底出现，直接在那里向他交任务。",
    ["Follow the road north-west out of Theramore to the watchtower at {area:503}. Mudrock Burrowers roam the marsh around it.\nIf {quest:1265} isn't done yet: {npc:4967} waits at the foot of the tower once you have looked around. Hand the quest in to him there, not in Theramore, and take his next errand on the spot."] = "从塞拉摩沿路向西北走到{area:503}的瞭望塔，泥石掘洞者在周围的沼泽里游荡。\n如果{quest:1265}还没完成：在塔周围查看后，{npc:4967}会在塔底等你。直接在那里向他交任务，别回塞拉摩交，并当场接下他的下一步任务。",
    ["Follow the road north-west. The south of {area:1763}, around its corrupted moonwell, is held by Shadow Council cultists, adepts, guardsmen and their hounds.\nCareful: the {npc:11141} (53, elite) haunts the west end of {area:1763}, around 35,60: pull the cultists and hounds away from him."] = "沿大路往西北走。{area:1763}南部、被腐化的月亮井周围，被暗影议会的教徒、学徒、卫兵和他们的猎犬占据。\n小心：{npc:11141}（53 级，精英）在{area:1763}西端约 35,60 处出没：把教徒和猎犬从他身边拉开。",
    ["Follow the road south out of the valley to {area:87}. {npc:240} stands outside the smithy on the west side of the road, {npc:241} by the road south of it, and {npc:295} and {npc:253} in the Lion's Pride Inn across the road.\nPriests: {quest:5624} counts only {spell:613} (Rank 2). {npc:377} trains priests too: learn it from her now if you have not yet."] = "沿路向南出山谷前往{area:87}。{npc:240}站在路西侧的铁匠铺外，{npc:241}在其南面的路边，{npc:295}和{npc:253}在路对面的狮王之傲旅店里。\n牧师：{quest:5624}只计入{spell:613}（等级2）。{npc:377}也是牧师训练师：如果还没学，现在就向她学习。",
    ["Follow the road south-east from Biggs to the pass into the {zone:1419}, keeping clear of {area:75}, the Horde town to the north-east.\nDown the pass, the road bends east to {area:1438}. Careful: {npc:5982} vultures (46) and Starving Snickerfangs (45) hunt in the dry hills south of the road: stay on it and keep moving."] = "从比格斯处沿路向东南前往通往{zone:1419}的隘口，避开东北方的部落城镇{area:75}。\n下隘口后，道路向东拐向{area:1438}。小心：路南干涸山丘里有{npc:5982}秃鹫（46级）和饥饿的弯牙土狼（45级）游荡：沿着大路不停往前走。",
    ["Follow the road south-east to the small Horde post on the shore: {npc:5592} and {npc:5593}."] = "沿大路向东南前往岸边的部落小哨站：{npc:5592}和{npc:5593}。",
    ["Follow the road south-east to the small Horde post on the shore: {npc:5592} takes the crocolisk flanks, and {npc:5593} stands beside him."] = "沿大路向东南前往岸边的部落小哨站：{npc:5592}收鳄鱼腹肉，{npc:5593}站在他旁边。",
    ["Follow the road south-east to {area:392} on the coast: {npc:3391} and {npc:7161} at the north end of town, {npc:3442} and {npc:16227}, {npc:3446} and the WANTED poster, then {quest:1492} on the dock on the way out south."] = "沿大路向东南前往海边的{area:392}：{npc:3391}和{npc:7161}在镇子北端，然后是{npc:3442}和{npc:16227}、{npc:3446}和通缉令，出镇往南时在码头接{quest:1492}。",
    ["Follow the road west into {area:1657} and use the {item:279378} at the inn on the {area:1659} and at the tunnel mouth below {area:3425} for the last two owls. {npc:4241} stands on the {area:1659} just inside the city. {npc:3516} is in the {area:1658} at the north end of the city, {quest:922} just south of it; {npc:4092}, {npc:7999}, {npc:7313} and {npc:8396} are in the Temple of the Moon at the south end."] = "沿路向西进入{area:1657}，在{area:1659}的旅店和{area:3425}下方的隧道口使用{item:279378}收集最后两只猫头鹰。{npc:4241}就在刚进城的{area:1659}上。{npc:3516}在城北的{area:1658}，{quest:922}在其正南；{npc:4092}、{npc:7999}、{npc:7313}和{npc:8396}在城南的月神殿里。",
    ["Follow the road west to the burned inn on the road toward the {zone:1413}: the black shield and Reethe's guard badge lie in the ashes and the hoofprints are in the mud beside the inn."] = "沿路向西前往通往{zone:1413}路上的被烧毁旅店：黑色盾牌和雷瑟的卫兵徽章就在灰烬里，蹄印在旅店旁的泥地里。",
    ["Follow the southern road east out of the {zone:1422}."] = "沿南侧大路向东离开{zone:1422}。",
    ["For Greta in {zone:1448}, later in this guide: keep it"] = "本指南稍后交给{zone:1448}的格雷塔：先留着",
    ["For your {area:1584} run, next, on the way through {area:254}: the WANTED poster in {area:340} wants the Anvilrage dwarves inside thinned out."] = "为你接下来经过{area:254}时打的{area:1584}：{area:340}的通缉令要你削减副本里铁怒矮人的数量。",
    ["For {npc:10838} at {area:3197}, the next stop"] = "下一站交给{area:3197}的{npc:10838}",
    ["For {npc:11558} in {area:1769}, later in this guide: keep it"] = "本指南稍后交给{area:1769}的{npc:11558}：先留着",
    ["For {npc:1212} in {zone:1453}'s Cathedral, on the walk north"] = "往北途经{zone:1453}大教堂时交给{npc:1212}",
    ["For {npc:1217} in {area:150} (the {zone:1437} guide)"] = "交给{area:150}的{npc:1217}（{zone:1437}指南）",
    ["For {npc:13220} in {zone:1451}, on the next guide: keep it"] = "交给下一个指南里{zone:1451}的{npc:13220}：先保留",
    ["For {npc:1416} in {zone:1453}, on this guide's {zone:1453} stop"] = "本指南经停{zone:1453}时交给{zone:1453}的{npc:1416}",
    ["For {npc:2519} at {object:3202}, in the {zone:1434} & {zone:1435} guide"] = "交给{object:3202}的{npc:2519}，在{zone:1434}和{zone:1435}指南里",
    ["For {npc:2700} at {area:320}, on your {zone:1417} visit (30-40)"] = "前往{zone:1417}（30-40级）时交给{area:320}的{npc:2700}",
    ["For {npc:34365} in Alterac, on the Western & {zone:1423} guide's ride to {area:3197}: keep it"] = "在西瘟疫与{zone:1423}指南骑往{area:3197}途中交给奥特兰克的{npc:34365}：先留着",
    ["For {npc:5594} in {area:976}, on the {zone:1446} and {zone:1452} guide: keep it"] = "在{zone:1446}和{zone:1452}指南中交给{area:976}的{npc:5594}：先留着",
    ["For {npc:7740} in {zone:1457}, on the {zone:1448} guide's {zone:1457} stop: keep it"] = "在{zone:1448}指南经停{zone:1457}时交给{zone:1457}的{npc:7740}：先留着",
    ["For {npc:9116} in {zone:1448}, later in this guide: keep it"] = "本指南稍后交给{zone:1448}的{npc:9116}：先留着",
    ["Four workstations stand in the Ashen camp: throw a pinecone at each, from the south up."] = "灰烬营地里有四个工作台：从南往北，朝每个工作台扔一个松果。",
    ["Foxes"] = "狐狸",
    ["Frankal Stonebridge"] = "弗兰卡尔·石桥",
    ["Fraxinus"] = "弗拉希努斯",
    ["Frenzied Plaguehounds share the fields around {area:2272} and {area:2271}, south of {area:2273}; Noxious Plaguebats fly over the fields of the north, and Monstrous Plaguebats around {area:2272} and {area:2271}. Careful: the hounds are 57-58 and the Monstrous Plaguebats up to 58: take the 57s one at a time and leave the 58s."] = "狂乱瘟疫猎犬分布在{area:2273}南边、{area:2272}和{area:2271}周围的田野上；有毒的瘟疫蝙蝠在北边的田野上空飞，巨型瘟疫蝙蝠在{area:2272}和{area:2271}附近。小心：猎犬是 57-58 级，巨型瘟疫蝙蝠最高 58 级：一次打一只 57 级的，别碰 58 级的。",
    ["From Krakle in Un'Goro, if you didn't bring it to her earlier"] = "来自安戈洛的克拉克尔，如果你之前没交给她",
    ["From Theramore follow the road north-west through the marsh into the {zone:1413} and up the coast to {area:392}: Stranglethorn starts at {area:35}, across the sea. {area:392}'s gryphon master stands above the dock; {npc:3391} is upstairs in the house above it; {quest:1111} waits on the dock by the boat."] = "从塞拉摩沿路向西北穿过沼泽进入{zone:1413}，再沿海岸北上前往{area:392}：跨海对面的{area:35}就是荆棘谷的起点。{area:392}的狮鹫管理员站在码头上方；{npc:3391}在上方房屋的二楼；{quest:1111}就在码头船边等候。",
    ["From a {area:2742} silithid: for {npc:15170} at Bronzebeard's Encampment"] = "由{area:2742}的异种虫掉落：交给铜须营地的{npc:15170}",
    ["From level 15 {npc:3649} also has {quest:4763}: its samples come from the northern Blackwood camp on your next {zone:1439} visit. Fill its bowl at the moonwell in the middle of the village now."] = "15级起{npc:3649}还会提供{quest:4763}：样本要在下次来{zone:1439}时从北部的黑木营地获取。现在先去村子中央的月亮井把碗装满。",
    ["From level 28: the Skeletal Raiders, Healers and Warders stand in the west part of the {area:492}, just east of {npc:311}'s camp.\nCareful: The Warders are 28-29 and the skeletons stand close together: pull one at a time.\nCareful: {npc:522}, an elite (35), wanders these graves too, and {npc:771} (32, rare) haunts the west part: keep away from both."] = "28级起：骷髅袭击者、骷髅治疗者和骷髅守卫位于{area:492}西侧，就在{npc:311}营地正东。\n小心：骷髅守卫为28-29级，且骷髅站得很密：一次只拉一只。\n小心：35级精英{npc:522}也在这片墓地游荡，32级稀有怪{npc:771}则出没在西侧：两只都要远离。",
    ["From level 29: north along the coast from Menethil to the wreck of the Intrepid. {npc:1160} (30) is aboard, and the locked strongbox sits in the wreck.\nCareful: Cursed Marines (27-28) crowd the deck around him: clear them first. {npc:270589}, a level 31-32 elite, roams the {zone:1437}: give it a wide berth."] = "29级起：从米奈希尔沿海岸向北前往无畏号残骸。{npc:1160}（30级）在船上，上锁的保险箱就在残骸里。\n小心：他周围甲板上挤满了被诅咒的水兵（27-28级）：先清掉它们。31-32级精英{npc:270589}在{zone:1437}游荡：远远避开。",
    ["From the Bloodsail camp, climb into the Mistvale hills just east of it: the Elder Mistvale Gorillas (40) there drop the giblets."] = "从血帆营地向正东爬上薄雾山谷山丘：那里的薄雾谷老年大猩猩（40级）会掉落大猩猩内脏。",
    ["From the beached creature, head east to the {quest:952}. Watch for level 16 bears and level 17 Moonstalker Sires between the beach and the grove; go around them. {npc:3616} stands beside Arbal and the sleeping {npc:11218}."] = "从搁浅的生物处向东前往{quest:952}。注意海滩和树林之间的16级熊和17级月夜猛虎首领，绕开它们。{npc:3616}站在阿尔巴尔和熟睡的{npc:11218}身旁。",
    ["From the north, take the outer shore east of the {area:35} tunnel. Work south-west through the swashbucklers (41-43) into the camp; the charts and the orders lie in their tents and in the rowboat beside the larger camp. Stay ashore."] = "从北边过来的话，走{area:35}隧道东边的外侧海岸。往西南穿过剑客（41-43 级）进入营地；海图和命令在他们的帐篷里，以及较大营地旁的小划艇里。待在岸上。",
    ["From the port, ride north-west to the river and follow it upstream towards {area:16726}: {npc:257058}'s {item:265806} grows along its banks between {area:16743} and {area:16726}."] = "从港口向西北骑到河边，沿河往上游朝{area:16726}走：{npc:257058}要的{item:265806}长在{area:16743}和{area:16726}之间的河岸上。",
    ["From the rise, north-west across the plain to the ruined tower of {area:2405}: {npc:11863} waits inside. His errand is in {area:599}, the next stop; he takes it back on the walk up the coast later in this guide."] = "从高地向西北穿过平原，前往{area:2405}的废塔：{npc:11863}在里面等着。他的任务在下一站{area:599}；本指南后面沿海岸往北走时会交还给他。",
    ["From the tram to {area:1519}"] = "从矿道地铁前往{area:1519}",
    ["From the {area:418} head north-west to the {area:417} and go in from the east side: {npc:3664} and his guards hold a hill inside it. Pull his guards first."] = "从{area:418}向西北前往{area:417}，从东侧进入：{npc:3664}和他的护卫占据着里面的山丘。先拉掉他的护卫。",
    ["From the {object:424005} walk to the camp's western edge, where the arrow points first, and drop carefully down the steep slope north to the {object:424012} on the ledge below. A missed jump only slides you down: hug the cliff and walk back up."] = "从{object:424005}走到营地西边缘，也就是箭头最先指的地方，小心地沿陡坡往北跳到下面岩架上的{object:424012}。没跳准只会滑下去：贴着悬崖走回上面。",
    ["From {area:16727}, ride into the {zone:1427} by its eastern pass, then west to the dig site. The {object:173265} stands at its southern end; the Dark Iron Geologists dig just north of it. Bring the 15 {item:4306} from {area:976}'s Auction House: the Geologists drop it only now and then."] = "从{area:16727}经东边的山口骑进{zone:1427}，然后往西到挖掘场。{object:173265}立在挖掘场南端，黑铁地质学家就在它北边挖掘。从{area:976}的拍卖行带 15 个{item:4306}：地质学家只是偶尔掉。",
    ["From {area:3137} ride west along the road past {area:2358}, then north-west into {zone:1448}: the {area:2479} is the druids' camp on the road just past the {zone:1440} border."] = "从{area:3137}沿路向西经过{area:2358}，再向西北进入{zone:1448}：刚过{zone:1440}边界的路边德鲁伊营地就是{area:2479}。",
    ["From {area:442}'s flight master, a short flight over the water to {area:702}."] = "在{area:442}的飞行管理员处跨海短途飞往{area:702}。",
    ["From {area:541} ride east to the cave in the crater's north-east corner: {npc:9622} (55) sits at its back among his gorillas, well under you now. Then south down the crater's east side to {npc:9619}."] = "从{area:541}向东骑到环形山东北角的洞穴：{npc:9622}（55 级）坐在洞穴深处的大猩猩之间，现在比你低很多。然后沿环形山东侧往南到{npc:9619}。",
    ["From {area:75}'s flight master, fly to the {area:1497} (by way of {area:340}): {npc:5204}'s errands and your {area:1497} training, then the zeppelin from the towers outside the city to {zone:1454}."] = "从{area:75}的飞行管理员飞往{area:1497}（途经{area:340}）：{npc:5204}的任务和你在{area:1497}的训练，然后从城外的塔坐飞艇去{zone:1454}。",
    ["From {npc:3293}'s camp, go on to {zone:1454}'s main gate, a few hundred yards away. The next guide starts in {zone:1454} and takes the zeppelin to {zone:1420} and {zone:1421}."] = "从{npc:3293}的营地继续前往几百码外的{zone:1454}正门。下一篇指南从{zone:1454}开始，乘飞艇前往{zone:1420}和{zone:1421}。",
    ["From {npc:3293}'s camp, go on to {zone:1454}'s main gate, a few hundred yards away. The next guide starts in {zone:1454}: Thrall takes {quest:95350}, and the zeppelin leaves for {zone:1420} and {zone:1421}."] = "从{npc:3293}的营地继续前往几百码外的{zone:1454}正门。下一篇指南从{zone:1454}开始：萨尔接收{quest:95350}，随后乘飞艇前往{zone:1420}和{zone:1421}。",
    ["Galak Assassin"] = "加拉克刺客",
    ["Gammerita need not die: target her and use the {item:9328}. She is a level 48 elite, so keep your distance.\nGammerita walks the {zone:1425} shore below the {area:307}, from the arrow south to about 75,66 and north to about 82,52: if she isn't at the arrow, follow the shore."] = "不用击杀加莫里塔：选中她并使用{item:9328}即可。她是48级精英，注意保持距离。\n加莫里塔在{area:307}下方的{zone:1425}海岸巡逻，范围从箭头处往南到约 75, 66、往北到约 82, 52：如果箭头处没看到她，就沿着海岸找找。",
    ["Gelkis Captive rescued"] = "吉尔吉斯俘虏已获救",
    ["Go through the tunnel into {area:38}. Just past it, a path marked by stones climbs the hills on the right of the road north to {npc:257808}'s camp."] = "穿过隧道进入{area:38}。刚出隧道，道路右侧有一条石块标记的小路上山向北通往{npc:257808}的营地。",
    ["Go through {area:1769} and take the {zone:1450} branch of the tunnel. {npc:11801} is in {area:2361}.\n{npc:11801} offers {quest:5527} only after you have been inside {area:2577} once: if he doesn't offer it, carry on without it."] = "穿过{area:1769}，走隧道的{zone:1450}分支。{npc:11801}在{area:2361}。\n只有你进过一次{area:2577}后，{npc:11801}才会提供{quest:5527}：如果他不提供，就不做它继续走。",
    ["Go west from {area:415} to {area:441}. Teronis lies on the shore among the Saltspittle murlocs."] = "从{area:415}向西前往{area:441}。特洛尼斯倒在岸边的盐沫鱼人中间。",
    ["Good Luck Charm"] = "幸运符",
    ["Gravelsnout kobolds and {quest:1131}"] = "碎石鼻狗头人与{quest:1131}",
    ["Greater Duskbats (6-7) fly over the fields around {area:159} and along the road north: Gretchen wants their pelts, {npc:3549} their wings. The Vampiric Duskbats (8-9) farther out drop them too, but hit harder.\nThe {quest:5482} grows in the graveyard fields just north of {area:159}, where the Rot Hide Graverobbers dig; all the Rot Hides drop the ichor.\nThe Rot Hide Mongrels hold the hills further north, around {area:164}. Leave {npc:1753} (level 11) in his hut for now: the guide comes back for him after {area:157}.\nThe Vile Fin murlocs line the north shore: they all drop the scales, and the Minor Oracles and Muckdwellers the skins for {npc:3549}. Straight north of {area:159} the shore holds Puddlejumpers and Minor Oracles (7-9) with no Muckdwellers (9-10) close by."] = "大型夜行蝙蝠（6-7级）在{area:159}周围的田野和向北的大路沿线上空飞翔：格蕾琴要它们的毛皮，{npc:3549}要它们的翅膀。更外围的吸血夜行蝙蝠（8-9级）也会掉落，但伤害更高。\n{quest:5482}长在{area:159}正北的墓地田野里，腐皮盗墓者在那里挖掘；所有腐皮豺狼人都会掉落脓液。\n腐皮劣种豺狼人盘踞在更北边{area:164}周围的山丘上。先别管小屋里的{npc:1753}（11级）：指南会在{area:157}之后回来打他。\n北海岸沿线都是邪鳍鱼人：它们全都会掉落鳞片，其中邪鳍小先知和邪鳍泥浆鱼人会掉落{npc:3549}要的鱼人皮。{area:159}正北的海岸主要是邪鳍水洼鱼人和邪鳍小先知（7-9级），附近没有邪鳍泥浆鱼人（9-10级）。",
    ["Grommash Hold stands in the {object:172957} at the end of the Drag: {npc:4949} sits on his throne, {npc:3230} stands beside the door."] = "格罗玛什要塞位于暗巷区尽头的{object:172957}：{npc:4949}坐在王座上，{npc:3230}站在门旁。",
    ["Group quest: {quest:348} ends at {npc:1449} in Mistvale. Hand him ten gorilla fangs and he calls three waves of gorillas (41-42), one after another, then {npc:1514} (44). In players' recordings, 12 of the 27 people who started it died there. Take it if you have a friend or two along."] = "小队任务：{quest:348}在雾谷的{npc:1449}处结束。交给他十颗大猩猩獠牙，他会召唤三波大猩猩（41-42 级），一波接一波，然后是{npc:1514}（44 级）。在玩家的录像里，27 个开始这个任务的人中有 12 个死在那里。有一两个朋友同行再接。",
    ["Hamuul is on {area:1639}."] = "哈缪尔在{area:1639}。",
    ["Hand the paw to {npc:717} beside Hemet."] = "把爪子交给赫米特身旁的{npc:717}。",
    ["Head north through Elwynn to {area:1519}; Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 in {object:2100}."] = "向北穿过艾尔文森林前往{area:1519}；马迪亚斯·肖尔就在{object:2100}的军情七处。",
    ["Head of Arugal"] = "阿鲁高的头颅",
    ["Head south from the compound to {area:37}. The Venture Co. Geologists in the shore camps carry the Tumbled Crystals; Venture Co. Agents (39) walk among them. Stay on the shore: stealthed Shadowmaw Panthers prowl the jungle south and east of the lake."] = "从基地向南前往{area:37}。湖岸营地里的风险投资公司地质学家带着打磨过的水晶；其间混有风险投资公司特工（39级）。贴着湖岸走：湖的南面和东面丛林里有潜行的深喉猎豹游荡。",
    ["Head south-west past {area:287} town to the {area:288}. Miners (26-27) work the tunnels; {npc:2305} (30) and {npc:2450} (29) are deep inside. Keep killing Miners until Samsa's thirty skulls are in your bags: most {area:287} humans drop one."] = "向西南越过{area:287}镇前往{area:288}。矿工（26-27 级）在隧道里干活，{npc:2305}（30 级）和{npc:2450}（29 级）在深处。一直杀矿工，直到包里攒够萨姆萨要的三十个头骨：大多数{area:287}人类都会掉。",
    ["Head to {zone:1454}'s main gate, just west of {area:817} (Warriors: north along the road from {area:379}). The next guide starts in {zone:1454}: {quest:829} takes the cultists' quest, the trainers teach your new ranks, and the zeppelin leaves from the towers outside the gate for {zone:1420} and {zone:1421}. {zone:1413} come after Silverpine."] = "前往{area:817}正西的{zone:1454}正门（战士：从{area:379}沿路向北）。下一篇指南从{zone:1454}开始：{quest:829}接取邪教徒任务，职业训练师教授新等级技能，城门外的高塔可乘飞艇前往{zone:1420}和{zone:1421}。银松森林之后再去{zone:1413}。",
    ["Head to {zone:1454}'s main gate, just west of {area:817}. {npc:3352} stands with the hunter trainers in the {object:172958}."] = "前往{area:817}正西的{zone:1454}正门。{npc:3352}和猎人训练师一起站在{object:172958}。",
    ["Head west along the road to the draenei camp at the {area:657}, near the way in from {zone:1430}."] = "沿大路向西前往{area:657}的德莱尼营地，靠近从{zone:1430}进来的路。",
    ["Head west to the troll village on the coast, keeping clear of the {area:606} on the way."] = "向西前往海边的巨魔村庄，路上避开{area:606}。",
    ["Heal 5 Injured Deathguard"] = "治疗 5 名受伤的亡灵卫兵",
    ["Hearth back to {area:150} if you bound at the {area:2104}, or walk west along the road: {npc:2104} stands on the top floor of {area:2103}, {npc:2094} by the docks."] = "如果炉石绑在{area:2104}就直接炉石回{area:150}，否则沿路向西走过去：{npc:2104}在{area:2103}顶层，{npc:2094}在码头旁。",
    ["Hearth to Shadowprey (you bound it on the way in), or walk back south along the coast."] = "用炉石回到葬影村（你来的路上绑定过），或者沿海岸走回南边。",
    ["Hearth to {area:415}, where your hearthstone is bound, or follow the road east from the {area:414}: {npc:3845} stands by the flight master, {npc:3691} in the inn, {npc:3894} inside the building beyond it."] = "炉石回绑定的{area:415}，或从{area:414}沿路向东走：{npc:3845}在飞行管理员旁，{npc:3691}在旅店里，{npc:3894}在旅店后面的建筑里。",
    ["Hearth to {zone:1454} from the {area:152}: the Hearthstone is still bound there from the previous guide's {zone:1454} stop (Mages teleport). Then the flight master."] = "从{area:152}用炉石回{zone:1454}：炉石还绑定在上一个指南的{zone:1454}站（法师可以传送）。然后去飞行管理员。",
    ["Hearth to {zone:1454} from the {area:152}: the Hearthstone is still bound there from the previous guide's {zone:1454} stop (Mages teleport). Train before the flight."] = "从{area:152}用炉石回{zone:1454}：炉石还绑定在上一个指南的{zone:1454}站（法师可以传送）。飞之前先训练。",
    ["Hearth to {zone:1454} from the {area:152}: the Hearthstone is still bound there from the previous guide's {zone:1454} stop. Then the flight master."] = "从{area:152}用炉石回{zone:1454}：炉石还绑定在上一个指南的{zone:1454}站。然后去飞行管理员。",
    ["Help Fuzzle escape Sunnyglade."] = "帮法兹尔逃离阳光林地。",
    ["Help Jom-jom reach Bolder'ok"] = "帮乔姆乔姆到达博尔德奥克",
    ["Help Stinky find Bogbean Leaves"] = "帮臭臭找沼泽豆叶",
    ["Her Scarlets wait until {npc:11615} has given you the termite barrel at the {area:152}: the barrel goes down in the same lumber mill."] = "她的血色任务要等{area:152}的{npc:11615}给你白蚁桶之后：白蚁桶也要放在同一个伐木场。",
    ["Highlord Bolvar in {zone:1453}, on the way out of this guide"] = "离开本指南时交给{zone:1453}的大领主伯瓦尔",
    ["His next errand goes to {zone:1457}, off this route: leave it."] = "他的下一步任务要去{zone:1457}，偏离当前路线：先别接。",
    ["His next hunt, the Diseased Grizzlies (55-56), waits for the Plaguelands guide's sweep at about 55."] = "他的下一个狩猎任务，病态灰熊（55-56 级），等约 55 级的瘟疫之地指南扫荡时再做。",
    ["His pack fell just north of the tree. Open it, then wait half a minute while its safety lock discharges before you open it again."] = "他的背包掉在树的北边。打开它，然后等半分钟让它的安全锁放完电，再打开一次。",
    ["Hold Five Bases."] = "守住五座基地。",
    ["Hold Four Bases."] = "守住四座基地。",
    ["Horde: ride west across the foothills and north up the valley to {area:16848}, about four minutes, for {npc:265788}'s flags, {npc:244511}'s amulet and his war paint wrap, then back up to the Summit."] = "部落：往西越过山麓，再沿山谷往北到{area:16848}，大约四分钟，交{npc:265788}的旗帜、{npc:244511}的护符和他的战纹包裹，然后再回到峰顶。",
    ["If the town rewards just brought you to 42 and you still owe pirate work, use the shore tents, not the ships."] = "如果交完镇上的任务刚好到 42 级，而你还欠着海盗的任务，就去打岸上的帐篷，别去船上。",
    ["If you didn't take {quest:2872} on the earlier stop: \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor."] = "如果前面经停时没接{quest:2872}：找顶层的“海狼”马克基雷接取。",
    ["If you have faith, leap from the planks overlooking Thousand Needles."] = "如果你有信念，就从俯瞰千针石林的木板上跳下去。",
    ["If you're short on cloth, leave {zone:1455} through the Commons and follow the road down the mountain, then east to {area:134}. Kill Rockjaw Skullthumpers on the quarry's western edge. If the missing cloth is affordable at the Auction House, you can buy it instead."] = "如果布料不够，从平民区离开{zone:1455}沿路下山，再向东前往{area:134}，在采石场西缘刷石腭碎颅者。如果拍卖行里的布价钱合适，也可以直接买。",
    ["In the river under the Arathi end of the span, a {item:4433} lies on the bottom: {npc:2695} in {zone:1455}, at the end of this guide, takes it."] = "大桥阿拉希一端的河底沉着一封{item:4433}：本指南末尾交给{zone:1455}的{npc:2695}。",
    ["In the {area:102}, on the hill north of the {area:104}. Click the tablet for the rubbing."] = "在{area:104}北边山上的{area:102}。点击石板获得拓片。",
    ["In {area:35}. Both factions take his two quests, from level 34."] = "在{area:35}。两个阵营都可以接他的两个任务，34 级起。",
    ["In {area:35}: {npc:2494} on the docks, {npc:2498} inside the inn, MacKinley, {npc:737} and {npc:773} upstairs."] = "在{area:35}：码头上的{npc:2494}，旅店里的{npc:2498}，楼上的麦金利、{npc:737}和{npc:773}。",
    ["In {zone:1454}: fly from {area:431}"] = "在{zone:1454}：从{area:431}飞",
    ["In {zone:1456}"] = "在{zone:1456}",
    ["Indoors at the Summit, next to {npc:254915}."] = "在峰顶的室内，{npc:254915}旁边。",
    ["Inside the burrow: {npc:256646} at the far end."] = "巢穴里：最里面的{npc:256646}。",
    ["Intact Limbs"] = "完整的肢体",
    ["Into the burrow for the elders, {npc:260661} and {npc:256660}."] = "进巢穴找两位长老{npc:260661}和{npc:256660}。",
    ["Into the {zone:1419}"] = "进入{zone:1419}",
    ["Into {area:1657}"] = "进入{area:1657}",
    ["Into {area:16866}, north of the Cradle: the ruins of a Horde base, now held by demons. {npc:263406} and {npc:249052} camp at its western edge; {npc:267121}, a blademaster, waits a little east of them. Doomguards (elites, levels 58-59) walk among the demons: pull carefully."] = "进入摇篮北边的{area:16866}：这是一处部落基地的废墟，现在被恶魔占据。{npc:263406}和{npc:249052}在它的西边缘扎营；剑圣{npc:267121}在他们东边一点等着。末日守卫（精英，58-59 级）在恶魔之间走动：小心拉怪。",
    ["Into {area:254}"] = "进入{area:254}",
    ["Into {area:616}"] = "进入{area:616}",
    ["Investigate the Outcast Hideaway"] = "调查流放者藏身处",
    ["Jergosh the Invoker"] = "祈求者耶戈什",
    ["Kaya Escorted to Camp Aparaje"] = "护送卡雅到达阿帕拉耶营地",
    ["Keep fangs from these same elders for Unbagwa ({quest:348}, with a group)."] = "从这些老年大猩猩身上留些獠牙给安巴瓦（{quest:348}，需组队）。",
    ["Keep it for another visit: {npc:729} (37) prowls the Lashtail hill."] = "留待下次再来：{npc:729}（37级）在鞭尾迅猛龙山丘上游荡。",
    ["Keep it: {npc:7775} in {zone:1444}, later in this guide, brews the elixir"] = "留着它：本指南稍后在{zone:1444}找{npc:7775}酿制药剂",
    ["Keep north to {area:598} for {item:15881}: any Slitherblade can drop it.\nCareful: the Myrmidons (34-35) hold the beach's northern half with the Sea Witches and Oracles (34-36, casters), up to two over you at 33: work the Naga and Sorceresses (32-33) of the southern half until the key drops, and leave the north for the second {zone:1443} visit, at about 37."] = "继续往北到{area:598}找{item:15881}：任何滑刃纳迦都可能掉落。\n小心：侍从（34-35 级）和海巫、神谕者（34-36 级，施法者）占据海滩北半部分，你 33 级时它们最多比你高两级：在南半部分打纳迦和女巫（32-33 级），直到钥匙掉落，北边留到第二次来{zone:1443}时再打，约 37 级。",
    ["Keep north to {area:598} for {item:15881}: any Slitherblade can drop it. Work the Naga, Sorceresses and Warriors (32-34) of the strand's southern half until it drops.\nCareful: the Myrmidons (34-35) hold the beach's northern half with the Sea Witches and Oracles (34-36, casters), and Tidehunters (36-37) swim off the northern tip: on the way to the chest, keep to the beach and swim straight across."] = "继续向北前往{area:598}刷{item:15881}：任意滑刃纳迦都有可能掉落。在海滩南半部刷滑刃纳迦、女巫和战士（32-34级）直到掉落。\n小心：海滩北半部盘踞着滑刃侍从（34-35级）以及远程施法的滑刃海巫和先知（34-36级），北端水里还有滑刃猎潮者（36-37级）：去开箱子时贴着海滩走到位再直接游过去。",
    ["Keep ten {item:2589} for {npc:6175} in {zone:1455}. Finish your stack here on the same Stonesplinter Troggs and Scouts; stay in the north camps."] = "留十块{item:2589}给{zone:1455}的{npc:6175}。就在这里继续打碎石怪穴居人和斥候凑齐；待在北边营地即可。",
    ["Keep the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source Bilgewhizzle gave you: it starts Tanaris Field Sampling, a two-hour timer, for the {zone:1446} guide at about 48, on the way back north from Scrimshank's hive."] = "保留比格维兹尔给你的 4711-FTZ 型能量源：它会开始「塔纳利斯野外采样」，有两小时计时，用于约 48 级的{zone:1446}指南，在从斯克林尚克的虫巢往北回去的路上。",
    ["Keep the bait for {npc:9684}'s lair, next (he is level 56)."] = "留着诱饵，接下来去{npc:9684}的巢穴（他是 56 级）。",
    ["Keep the deliveries: {npc:8659}, {npc:4485} and {npc:3326} are in {zone:1454} next, Magatha in {zone:1456} and {npc:6522} in the {zone:1458} on the next guides."] = "保留这些要送的东西：{npc:8659}、{npc:4485}和{npc:3326}在接下来的{zone:1454}，玛加萨在{zone:1456}，{npc:6522}在之后指南的{zone:1458}。",
    ["Keep the termites: {npc:11615} at the {area:152} takes them on this guide's ride back west."] = "保留白蚁：{area:152}的{npc:11615}会在本指南往西骑回去时收下。",
    ["Keep {npc:2986}'s {quest:1150}: Grenka comes with the next Freewind visit, at about 30."] = "保留{npc:2986}的{quest:1150}：格兰卡在下次去乱风岗时做，约 30 级。",
    ["Keep {quest:2864}'s {quest:3362}: its Rootshapers (49-50) come at the {area:1938}, on the way into Un'Goro at about 51."] = "保留{quest:2864}的{quest:3362}：它的塑根者（49-50 级）在{area:1938}打，约 51 级进安戈洛的路上。",
    ["Keep {quest:3128} and Improved Quality: {zone:1444}' sprites, hippogryphs, Zorbin's coast and the Rage Scar yetis come on your {zone:1444} loop at about 51, with the Muisek chain."] = "保留{quest:3128}和「改良品质」：{zone:1444}的小精灵、角鹰兽、佐宾的海岸和怒痕雪人会在约 51 级的{zone:1444}一圈里和穆伊塞克任务链一起做。",
    ["Keep {quest:3942}: {npc:9116} is at the {area:2479}, on the last guide's way through {zone:1448}."] = "保留{quest:3942}：{npc:9116}在{area:2479}，在最后一个指南穿过{zone:1448}的路上。",
    ["Keep {quest:5158}: {npc:5901} is by {area:392}, on the next guide."] = "保留{quest:5158}：{npc:5901}在{area:392}附近，在下一个指南里。",
    ["Kill and skin Worg (10), {npc:1778} (11), {npc:1766} (11), {npc:1797} (12), {npc:1923} (16) along the loop until {skill:393} 105; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 30 beasts for these 5 points."] = "沿着这一圈击杀并剥皮座狼（10 级）、{npc:1778}（11 级）、{npc:1766}（11 级）、{npc:1797}（12 级）、{npc:1923}（16 级），直到{skill:393}达到 105；先拾取每具尸体，再剥皮，并挑你技能允许的最高等级野兽剥。L 级野兽在 20 级以下需要技能 (L-10)x10，20 级以上需要 Lx5。区域等级 10-20。这 5 点大约需要 30 只野兽。",
    ["Kill and skin {npc:2351} (21), {npc:2354} (22, needs 110), {npc:2384} (23, needs 115) along the loop until {skill:393} 125; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 20-30. Expect about 30 beasts for these 20 points."] = "沿着这一圈击杀并剥皮{npc:2351}（21 级）、{npc:2354}（22 级，需要 110）、{npc:2384}（23 级，需要 115），直到{skill:393}达到 125；先拾取每具尸体，再剥皮，并挑你技能允许的最高等级野兽剥。L 级野兽在 20 级以下需要技能 (L-10)x10，20 级以上需要 Lx5。区域等级 20-30。这 20 点大约需要 30 只野兽。",
    ["Kronk defeated"] = "克朗克已被击败",
    ["Lead Tooga to Torta"] = "带图加去找托塔",
    ["Lead {npc:11018} out through the cave: she fights beside you, and the cultists you didn't clear on the way in come at you both. {npc:11019} takes her report at the {area:2479}, next."] = "带着{npc:11018}穿过洞穴出去：她会在你身边战斗，你进来时没清掉的教徒会冲你们俩来。接下来在{area:2479}由{npc:11019}收下她的报告。",
    ["Lead {npc:9999} north to {area:541}. When he faints, use {item:11804} on him to wake him."] = "带着{npc:9999}向北前往{area:541}。他晕倒时，对他使用{item:11804}唤醒他。",
    ["Leave the {zone:2548} for about level 41: its Western Front has elite patrols. After Stranglethorn, the {zone:2548} guide takes you from {zone:1455} to {area:69}, then through {area:2417}."] = "{zone:2548}留到约41级再去：西部前线有精英巡逻。结束荆棘谷后，{zone:2548}指南会带你从{zone:1455}到{area:69}，再穿过{area:2417}。",
    ["Leave {zone:1454} by the main gate and follow the road south through {zone:1411}. Before it turns west to the {area:814} bridge, step east into {area:362}: {npc:3336} stands on the west side of town, {npc:3142} in the middle."] = "从{zone:1454}正门离开，沿大路向南穿过{zone:1411}。在大路西转通往{area:814}桥之前，向东进入{area:362}：{npc:3336}站在镇子西侧，{npc:3142}在镇子中央。",
    ["Level 44 on the Eastsea pirates"] = "刷东海海盗升至44级",
    ["Level 59.7"] = "升至59.7级",
    ["Linen for {npc:6175}"] = "给{npc:6175}的亚麻布",
    ["Linen for {quest:1648}"] = "{quest:1648}所需的亚麻布",
    ["Locate the hunters' camp"] = "找到猎人营地",
    ["Look for lone level 40 elders in this same camp for the sinew and giblets. Leave level 41 gorillas alone; don't stay just for extra fangs."] = "在同一个营地找落单的 40 级老年大猩猩拿筋和内脏。别碰 41 级的大猩猩，也别为了多拿獠牙一直待在这里。",
    ["Look for the trophy skulls in the small ruins north of Zul'Mamwe's warriors.\nThe last skulls are in the ruins a short walk west, on the way back to {object:3202}."] = "战利品头骨在祖玛维战士北边的小废墟里。\n最后几个头骨在往西不远的废墟里，在回{object:3202}的路上。",
    ["Loot the horns from Ice Thistle Matriarchs"] = "从冰蓟雪人女王身上拾取雪人角",
    ["Lucien, beside {npc:2921}, wants a {item:929} and a {item:3823} ({skill:171} or the Auction House): this step shows only when you carry both."] = "{npc:2921}旁边的卢西恩要一个{item:929}和一个{item:3823}（{skill:171}或拍卖行）：只有两个都带着时才显示这一步。",
    ["Lumina Windsinger"] = "卢米娜·风歌者",
    ["MacKinley's Voodoo Dues waits for the level-48 {area:35} stop, with Zanzil's village: leave it for now."] = "马克基雷的“巫毒债”留到48级经停{area:35}时和赞吉尔营地一起做：先别接。",
    ["MacKinley, on the top floor: {quest:2872}, for Stoley in {zone:1446}"] = "顶楼的麦金利：{quest:2872}，交给{zone:1446}的斯托雷",
    ["MacKinley, on the top floor: {quest:2872}, for {npc:7881} in {zone:1446} on this guide"] = "顶楼的麦金利：{quest:2872}，交给本指南里{zone:1446}的{npc:7881}",
    ["Maethrya, the Alliance flight master"] = "联盟飞行管理员麦瑟蕾亚",
    ["Melizza Brimbuzzle escorted to safety"] = "梅利扎·硫磺嗡已护送到安全的地方",
    ["Message to the Wildhammer Delivered"] = "给蛮锤矮人的讯息已送达",
    ["Mistvale giblets"] = "薄雾谷大猩猩内脏",
    ["Mistvale gorillas at 39"] = "39级打薄雾谷大猩猩",
    ["Mog'thar defeated"] = "莫格萨尔已被击败",
    ["Moonstalker Fangs: the Moonstalkers around the river"] = "月夜猛虎的尖牙：河流周围的月夜猛虎",
    ["Moonstalkers on the way"] = "顺路击杀月夜猛虎",
    ["Moontouched Feathers lie on the ground all along the road west to {npc:9298}, where the Ragged Owlbeasts (53) roam: pick them up as you ride.\nThe same road crosses the Rogue Ice Thistles' ground (about one in three drops a {item:12366} for Umi) and the Fledgling Chillwinds' (about one in five drops an {item:12444} for {npc:10468}): work both here, around the road's middle.\nCareful: both are 53-55: pull the lower ones and take them one at a time."] = "向西前往{npc:9298}的道路沿线地上到处散落着月光羽毛，蓬毛枭兽（53级）也在那里游荡：骑马路过时顺手拾取。\n同一条路穿过游荡的冰蓟雪人领地（约三分之一掉落乌米需要的{item:12366}）和幼年冰风奇美拉领地（约五分之一掉落{npc:10468}需要的{item:12444}）：在道路中段附近把两者一起做了。\n小心：这两种怪都是53-55级，优先挑等级低的，一次只拉一只。",
    ["Morrowgrain"] = "晨光谷物",
    ["Motivate 5 Deathguards"] = "激励 5 名亡灵卫兵",
    ["Muckshell crabs"] = "泥壳蟹",
    ["New in Forever: if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.\nThe Outcast Necromancers and the Magram Necromancers of the valley drop a {quest:93644} whose writer lives in {zone:2652}: players got it within a few kills. Take it from the Outcast Necromancers and leave the Magram alone: the Magram centaurs leave you be until you attack, but once you have killed Magram the whole clan turns on you, and their Necrokhans (level 45, elites) stand around the western pylon you repair later.\nThe Gelkis and Magram centaurs have {area:2657} quest chains of their own, worth about 20,000 to 30,000 more experience, but each chain asks for Honored with its clan. The two clans are rivals, so work for one of them: the Gelkis and Magram Centaur Reputation guide, under Reputation, shows how."] = "Forever 新内容：如果某一步有误，请在 Polestar 的 Discord 或 GitHub 告诉我们，并说明是哪一步。\n山谷里的流放者死灵法师和玛格拉姆死灵法师会掉落{quest:93644}，写信人住在{zone:2652}：玩家几次击杀就拿到了。从流放者死灵法师身上拿，别碰玛格拉姆：玛格拉姆半人马在你攻击它们之前不会理你，但只要你杀了玛格拉姆，整个氏族都会与你为敌，而它们的死灵可汗（45 级精英）就站在你之后要修复的西边水晶塔周围。\n吉尔吉斯和玛格拉姆半人马在{area:2657}各有自己的任务链，大约值 20000 到 30000 经验，但每条任务链都要求和该氏族达到尊敬。两个氏族是敌对的，所以只为其中一个效力：「声望」分类下的「吉尔吉斯和玛格拉姆半人马声望」指南会告诉你怎么做。",
    ["New in Forever: this guide follows what players did on {area:616}. If a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.\n{area:616} lies south of {zone:1452}. Fly to {area:2255} (from Theramore on the Alliance route; the Horde route already ends there), bind your Hearthstone at the inn (partway through this guide {npc:256222} sends you to {area:493}, and the way there starts in {area:2255}), then ride south down the road through {area:2249} and on through {area:2256}, which leads up into {area:616}.\nCareful: elites stand along the whole way in. Frostmaul Giants and Preservers (59-60) flank the road through {area:2249}, and Hederine Slayers, Initiates and Manastalkers (57-58) line {area:2256} from its mouth to the zone line, with {npc:10201} (61) on its east side. Follow the arrows' line at full speed, never stop or fight on the way, and don't turn off it."] = "Forever 新内容：本指南按玩家在{area:616}的实际做法编写。如果某一步有误，请在 Polestar 的 Discord 或 GitHub 告诉我们，并说明是哪一步。\n{area:616}在{zone:1452}南边。飞到{area:2255}（联盟路线从塞拉摩飞；部落路线本来就在那里结束），在旅店绑定炉石（本指南中途{npc:256222}会让你去{area:493}，而去那里的路从{area:2255}开始），然后沿大路往南骑，穿过{area:2249}，再穿过通往{area:616}的{area:2256}。\n小心：一路上都有精英。霜槌巨人和保存者（59-60 级）在穿过{area:2249}的大路两侧，赫德林杀手、新信徒和法力潜伏者（57-58 级）从{area:2256}入口一直排到区域边界，{npc:10201}（61 级）在它的东侧。全速沿着箭头的路线走，路上别停也别打，不要偏离。",
    ["Nightsabers, Strigid Owls and Webwood Lurkers roam all around {area:186} and along the road east; the lurkers also drop the recipe's spider legs. The moonwell is at the west edge of {area:260}.\nCareful: the Befouled Webwoods (10-11) in the woods north-west of {area:186}, around 47-52,34-56, are over you now: take the silk from the Webwood Lurkers and leave the webwoods for {npc:3567}'s quest later. Duskstalker (9, a rare nightsaber) and Oakenscowl (9, elite) roam the woods south of {area:186}, around 54-62,73-77: leave them be."] = "夜刃豹、猫头鹰和树林伏击者在{area:186}周围及向东的大路沿线出没；伏击者也会掉落食谱需要的蜘蛛腿。月亮井位于{area:260}西缘。\n小心：{area:186}西北林地（约 47-52, 34-56）的腐化树林蜘蛛（10-11级）目前等级过高：先从树林伏击者身上刷蛛丝，等之后接了{npc:3567}的任务再来打它们。9级稀有夜刃豹暮色巡游者和9级精英橡木咆哮者在{area:186}南边树林（约 54-62, 73-77）游荡：别去招惹。",
    ["No Defias Brotherhood from Wiley (it starts with {npc:234}'s letter in {zone:1436}): skip {zone:1436}. North along the road from {area:87} to {zone:1453}: {npc:466} sits on his horse at the far end of the bridge outside the main gate. Then the gryphons in the {object:2096}, back to {area:69}.\nIf {npc:466} isn't at the arrow, he is walking his horse along the {area:1617} nearby: look along the avenue or wait a moment."] = "如果黑衣威利那里没有迪菲亚兄弟会任务（该任务线始于{zone:1436}{npc:234}的信）：跳过{zone:1436}。从{area:87}沿路向北前往{zone:1453}：{npc:466}骑马停在正门外大桥远端。然后去{object:2096}坐狮鹫回{area:69}。\n如果{npc:466}不在箭头位置，他正骑马沿着附近的{area:1617}巡逻：沿大道找找或稍等片刻。",
    ["No Muisek vessel to bring Uzer'i (you didn't take the {zone:1444} & {zone:1446} guide's chain): fly from here straight to {area:496}."] = "没有给乌泽里的穆伊塞克容器（你没做{zone:1444}和{zone:1446}指南的任务链）：从这里直接飞往{area:496}。",
    ["No flight path to {area:75} yet: ride north-east from {object:3202} through {zone:1431} and {zone:1430} into the swamp, then east along the road to {area:75}, and learn its flight path."] = "还没有{area:75}的飞行路线：从{object:3202}向东北骑，穿过{zone:1431}和{zone:1430}进入沼泽，然后沿大路往东到{area:75}，学会它的飞行路线。",
    ["No {quest:5401} yet? Pureheart gives you one here: the scourgestone quests need it."] = "还没有{quest:5401}？在这里找纯心领一个：天灾石任务需要佩戴它。",
    ["North again to the shore of {area:441}. Teronis lies among the Saltspittle murlocs; any murloc can drop the {item:5463}."] = "再次向北前往{area:441}海岸。特洛尼斯倒在盐沫鱼人中间；任意鱼人都有可能掉落{item:5463}。",
    ["North along the coast, then inland to {npc:11863}'s tower. The coast's clams and naga come next, on one walk north to {area:2406}."] = "沿海岸往北，然后转向内陆到{npc:11863}的塔。海岸的蚌和纳迦是下一步，一路往北走到{area:2406}。",
    ["North along the hills to {npc:3650}, then on north-east to the {area:456}."] = "沿山丘向北找{npc:3650}，再继续向东北前往{area:456}。",
    ["North along the hills. {npc:3650} waits in the ruins of {quest:954}; Wild Grells and Vile Sprites fill them, Deth'ryll Satyrs the eastern edge. {quest:1001} stands by the road north-north-west of {npc:3650}; a {quest:4723} lies on the shore on the way to him."] = "沿山丘向北。{npc:3650}在{quest:954}废墟中等候；废墟里满是狂野劣魔和邪恶精灵，东缘则是德斯里尔萨特。{quest:1001}立在{npc:3650}北偏西的路边；过去途中的海岸上还有一具{quest:4723}。",
    ["North along the road from {area:205} towards the {area:880}: Ebenezer Rustlocke's corpse lies under the span. His parchment goes back to {npc:1075}.\nCareful: Two elite Dark Iron Saboteurs (28-29) stand by the corpse inside the span: loot the corpse and walk straight out without fighting, or, from level 31, pull them one at a time."] = "从{area:205}沿路向北朝{area:880}走：伊贝尼瑟·锈锁的尸体躺在桥下。他的羊皮纸要交回给{npc:1075}。\n小心：桥洞尸体旁守着两名精英黑铁破坏者（28-29级）：直接摸尸体后立刻走出来别交战，或31级以后再逐个拉出来打。",
    ["North along the road to {area:467}: {npc:3994} stands by the flight master, {npc:16458} in the inn just west of them."] = "沿路向北前往{area:467}：{npc:3994}站在飞行管理员旁，{npc:16458}就在他们西侧的旅店里。",
    ["North from the falls to the shore: the {quest:4727} lies on the beach there, for {npc:10219} in {area:442}."] = "从瀑布向北走到海岸：海滩上有一具{quest:4727}，任务交给{area:442}的{npc:10219}。",
    ["North from {area:16724}, past {area:16729} and across the river, to {area:16723}, the farm town the Twilight cult holds; keep clear of {area:16743}, the Horde's fort east of the town. {npc:259158} the kobold waits in a cage at the arrow, {npc:256831} below ground in a cave at the town's eastern edge (the entrance is at 50.0,46.0), and {npc:258697} waits at his farm on the north-eastern edge."] = "从{area:16724}向北，经过{area:16729}并过河，前往暮光教派占据的农庄小镇{area:16723}；避开镇东的部落要塞{area:16743}。狗头人{npc:259158}关在箭头处的笼子里，{npc:256831}在镇东边缘地下的山洞里（洞口坐标 50.0, 46.0），{npc:258697}则在东北边缘的农场里等候。",
    ["North from {area:421}, past {area:415}'s east side, to the Thistlefur camp: {npc:3987} leads the furbolgs there. Then south to {area:415}.\nCareful: Dal is level 25, and the furbolgs near him usually join in when he is pulled. Kill the ones along his path first so you fight him alone."] = "从{area:421}向北，绕过{area:415}东侧前往蓟皮熊怪营地：{npc:3987}率领着那里的熊怪。完成后向南前往{area:415}。\n小心：达尔是25级，拉他时附近的熊怪通常会一起加入战斗。先清掉他巡逻路线上的熊怪，再单独对付他。",
    ["North from {npc:260626} to the workshop, crate first. Watch for Ghansurok, the elite chimaera (level 61) that prowls around the workshop."] = "从{npc:260626}往北到工坊，先交箱子。留意在工坊周围游荡的精英奇美拉甘苏洛克（61 级）。",
    ["North from {object:3202} to the hilltop just south-west of Nesingwary's camp: {npc:729} prowls there alone.\nCareful: {npc:729} (37) is a level over you: pull him at full health, clear of the Elder Stranglethorn Tigers (34-35) on the hill's slopes."] = "从{object:3202}向北到奈辛瓦里营地西南的山顶：{npc:729}独自在那里游荡。\n小心：{npc:729}（37 级）比你高一级：满血时拉他，避开山坡上的老年荆棘谷猛虎（34-35 级）。",
    ["North into Mistvale, a short ride from {area:35}: {npc:1449} sits among the gorillas. Hand him ten gorilla fangs and stay by him: three waves of gorillas, then {npc:1514}. Start at full health and mana."] = "往北进入雾谷，离{area:35}骑马不远：{npc:1449}坐在大猩猩之间。交给他十颗大猩猩獠牙，然后待在他身边：三波大猩猩，然后是{npc:1514}。满血满蓝再开始。",
    ["North into the shrub field: the {npc:248395} drop the leaves, and the Scarlet Dart Tubers grow in the open ground, most of them in the field's western half. Keep clear of {quest:91923} and {npc:248709}, the field's elites."] = "往北进入灌木地：{npc:248395}掉叶子，猩红飞镖块茎长在空地上，大多在灌木地西半边。避开灌木地的精英{quest:91923}和{npc:248709}。",
    ["North into {area:2361}: {npc:11802} stands in the north-east of the village, upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "往北进入{area:2361}：{npc:11802}站在村子东北他那栋楼的楼上：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
    ["North into {area:42}: {npc:276}'s house stands at the east end of town, on the way in."] = "向北进入{area:42}：{npc:276}的屋子就在进镇途中的镇东端。",
    ["North of the gnolls the ogres hold a hilltop outpost; pull the ogre-magi to you. The cobalt is in the dirt mounds around the outpost, and the scroll lies on the ground inside it.\nCareful: {npc:222233} (level 43, elite) stands in the outpost: pull the ogres out to you, away from him.\nUse {item:9466} on each {object:144064} around the outpost: the arrow goes from mound to mound."] = "豺狼人北边，食人魔占据着一个山顶前哨；把食人魔法师拉到你这边来打。钴矿在前哨周围的土堆里，卷轴在前哨里面的地上。\n小心：{npc:222233}（43 级，精英）站在前哨里：把食人魔拉出来，远离他。\n对前哨周围的每个{object:144064}使用{item:9466}：箭头会一个土堆接一个土堆地带你走。",
    ["North of the post, west of the road: the Stonesplinter troggs and scouts camp in the hills. Both drop the Trogg Stone Teeth.\nCareful: pull the Stonesplinter Scouts and Troggs one at a time. Stay at the north edge of the valley; Headsplitter patrols the deeper camps."] = "哨站北面、道路西侧：碎石怪穴居人和斥候在山丘里扎营，两种怪都会掉落穴居人的石牙。\n小心：一次只拉一只碎石怪斥候或穴居人。待在山谷北缘即可，裂头者在更深处的营地巡逻。",
    ["North of the {area:417}, {npc:3585} waits at the {area:416}."] = "{area:417}北面，{npc:3585}在{area:416}等候。",
    ["North to the druids' camp."] = "往北到德鲁伊的营地。",
    ["North to the old bridge over the Cradle: touch the crow effigy on it and {npc:267158}, the crow wild god, appears."] = "往北到横跨摇篮的旧桥：触摸桥上的乌鸦雕像，乌鸦荒野之神{npc:267158}就会出现。",
    ["North to the workshop. Turn the two gears and connect the two battery terminals on both sides of her glaive thrower. Ghansurok, the elite chimaera (level 61), prowls around the workshop: watch for him while you work."] = "往北到工坊。转动她的刃轮投掷器两侧的两个齿轮，并连接两个电池接线端。精英奇美拉甘苏洛克（61 级）在工坊周围游荡：干活时留意他。",
    ["North to the {area:383}: {quest:876} leads the Witchwing harpies in the hills to the west.\nCareful: The route in passes stealthed Harpy Ambushers and an elite harpy that patrols."] = "向北前往{area:383}：{quest:876}要去西边山上对付巫翼鹰身人。\n小心：进去的路上有潜行的鹰身伏击者，还有一只巡逻的精英鹰身人。",
    ["North to {npc:10667} in the ruined inn on the west side of Andorhal."] = "向北前往安多哈尔西侧残破旅店里的{npc:10667}处。",
    ["North to {npc:249234} and his crates. Drive the skunks out from behind the crates without attacking them."] = "往北找{npc:249234}和他的箱子。把箱子后面的臭鼬赶走，别攻击它们。",
    ["North to {npc:255683}, then {npc:267109} in the ruins south of her."] = "往北找{npc:255683}，然后是她南边废墟里的{npc:267109}。",
    ["North to {npc:263757}, a demon caged in the middle of the scar. He stood at the spot marked here every time he was met in the recording, south of where the quest data puts him."] = "往北找{npc:263757}，一个被关在伤疤中央笼子里的恶魔。录像里每次遇到他时，他都站在这里标记的位置，在任务数据给出的位置南边。",
    ["North to {npc:717} in Nesingwary's camp, then back south to {object:3202}'s zeppelin tower."] = "向北到奈辛瓦里营地找{npc:717}，然后往南回到{object:3202}的飞艇塔。",
    ["North up the river to {area:16726}: {npc:263440} just south of the ring, {npc:257058} north-east of it, then {npc:257062}."] = "沿河往北到{area:16726}：擂台南边不远的{npc:263440}，擂台东北的{npc:257058}，然后是{npc:257062}。",
    ["North up the road to the first pylon, gathering mana from the Unstable Mana Rifts on the way. Stop where the arrow points, on the road just south of the pylon, keeping to its west edge: the quiet side, with no Protectors behind you. Pull one {npc:252711} at a time down to that spot, the one nearest the pylon's south side first, and kill it there; then step up to the pylon's west side and use the Pile of Pylon Parts Mordent gave you: its {spell:1289727} takes your four Coalesced Mana Crystals.\nCareful: stay off the pylon's east and north-east side. The Protectors stand there two and three together, a Corpsefeeder (level 45, elite) walks among them and the Magram Necrokhans (elites, 45) stand just beyond: nearly every recorded death at this pylon happened east of it. If the Magram attack you (they do once you have killed Magram), wait at the arrow until any Necrokhan by the pylon walks off before you pull. Nascent Pylon Protectors (elites, 43) wander the road south of it: let them pass.\nIf you die here, walk your ghost back to the arrow before you come back to life: players who rose beside the pylon died again within seconds."] = "沿大路向北前往第一座水晶塔，途中从不稳定的法力裂隙收集法力。在箭头所指位置停下，就在水晶塔正南方的路上，靠路西侧走：这边比较安全，背后没有守护者。一次拉一只{npc:252711}到该位置，先拉离水晶塔南侧最近的一只并在那里击杀；然后走到水晶塔西侧，使用莫丹特给你的那堆水晶塔零件：其{spell:1289727}会消耗你的四块凝聚法力水晶。\n小心：远离水晶塔的东侧和东北侧。守护者在那里两三只扎堆，一只食尸者（45级，精英）在其间游荡，再往外就是玛格拉姆死灵可汗（45级，精英）：这座水晶塔记录到的死亡几乎全发生在东侧。如果玛格拉姆会攻击你（杀过玛格拉姆之后就会），先在箭头处等水晶塔旁的死灵可汗走远再拉怪。新生水晶塔守护者（43级，精英）在塔南面的路上游荡：让它们先过去。\n如果在这里阵亡，先跑尸回到箭头处再复活：直接在水晶塔旁复活的玩家几秒内就会再次阵亡。",
    ["North up the road to the first pylon, gathering mana from the Unstable Mana Rifts on the way. Stop where the arrow points, on the road just south of the pylon, keeping to its west edge: the quiet side, with no Protectors behind you. Pull one {npc:252711} at a time down to that spot, the one nearest the pylon's south side first, and kill it there; then step up to the pylon's west side and use {spell:1289727}, as players did to repair it.\nCareful: stay off the pylon's east and north-east side. The Protectors stand there two and three together, a Corpsefeeder (level 45, elite) walks among them and the Magram Necrokhans (elites, 45) stand just beyond: nearly every recorded death at this pylon happened east of it. If the Magram attack you (they do once you have killed Magram), wait at the arrow until any Necrokhan by the pylon walks off before you pull. Nascent Pylon Protectors (elites, 43) wander the road south of it: let them pass.\nIf you die here, walk your ghost back to the arrow before you come back to life: players who rose beside the pylon died again within seconds."] = "沿大路往北到第一座水晶塔，路上从不稳定的法力裂隙收集法力。在箭头指的地方停下，就在水晶塔南边的路上，靠它的西侧：这边比较安静，背后没有守护者。一次拉一个{npc:252711}到那里，先拉离水晶塔南侧最近的那个，在那里杀掉；然后走到水晶塔西侧使用{spell:1289727}，玩家们就是这样修好它的。\n小心：别去水晶塔的东侧和东北侧。守护者两三个一组站在那里，一只食尸者（45 级，精英）在它们之间走动，玛格拉姆死灵可汗（45 级精英）就站在再往外一点：这座塔记录到的死亡几乎都发生在它的东边。如果玛格拉姆攻击你（你杀过玛格拉姆后就会），在箭头处等到水晶塔旁的死灵可汗走开再拉怪。新生水晶塔守护者（43 级精英）在它南边的路上游荡：让它们过去。\n如果你死在这里，先跑尸回到箭头处再复活：在水晶塔旁复活的玩家几秒内就又死了。",
    ["North up the road to {area:1997}."] = "沿大路往北到{area:1997}。",
    ["North up the valley to {area:16848}, where the Alliance outpost ({npc:244517}, {npc:249968}) and the Horde's ({npc:244511}, {npc:244512}) stand next to each other."] = "沿山谷往北到{area:16848}，联盟前哨（{npc:244517}、{npc:249968}）和部落前哨（{npc:244511}、{npc:244512}）挨在一起。",
    ["North up the valley to {area:16848}, where the Horde outpost ({npc:244511}, {npc:244512}, {npc:265788}) and the Alliance's stand next to each other."] = "沿山谷往北到{area:16848}，部落前哨（{npc:244511}、{npc:244512}、{npc:265788}）和联盟前哨挨在一起。",
    ["North-east across the Cradle to {npc:249234}'s camp at the edge of {area:16866}."] = "往东北穿过摇篮到{area:16866}边缘{npc:249234}的营地。",
    ["North-east back to {npc:267097}, in the corner of {area:16866} where {npc:263394} stands: the Defiling Hounds around him drop any spikes you still need.\nCareful: Legion Hulks (60, rare elites) stomp through {area:16866}'s camps, and {npc:267439}, an elite (level 61), walks this corner: give them room."] = "往东北回到{npc:267097}那里，在{npc:263394}所在的{area:16866}角落：他周围的亵渎猎犬会掉落你还缺的尖刺。\n小心：军团巨兽（60 级，稀有精英）在{area:16866}的营地间践踏而过，精英{npc:267439}（61 级）在这个角落走动：离它们远点。",
    ["North-east from the lake to {area:413}."] = "从湖边向东北前往{area:413}。",
    ["North-east from the pylon to {area:543}: {npc:10302} the goblin sits by the water."] = "从水晶塔向东北前往{area:543}：地精{npc:10302}正坐在水边。",
    ["North-east from {npc:11596}'s camp to {area:609}, on the way back to {area:608}: every Kolkar drops Centaur Ears for {npc:5752} and {quest:93224} for {npc:5396}. The Magram south-east of {npc:11596}'s camp drop them too, but their village holds Necromancers (42-43) and Guardians (39-41): stay with the Kolkar (30-35)."] = "从{npc:11596}的营地向东北前往{area:609}，顺路返回{area:608}：每个科卡尔半人马都会掉落{npc:5752}要的半人马耳朵和{npc:5396}要的{quest:93224}。{npc:11596}营地东南方的玛格拉姆也会掉，但他们村里有亡灵巫师（42-43级）和守卫（39-41级）：只打科卡尔（30-35级）即可。",
    ["North-east into the {area:17145}: {npc:267109} rests in the ruins south of {npc:255683}, on your way."] = "往东北进入{area:17145}：顺路找{npc:255683}南边废墟里休息的{npc:267109}。",
    ["North-east to {npc:263394}. Drain him first: use {npc:263406}'s eye on him, and only then fight him. Undrained, he and {npc:252457} are level 60 elites. {npc:267439}, an elite (level 61), walks this corner of {area:16866}: keep out of his way.\nCareful: Legion Hulks (60, rare elites) stomp through {area:16866}'s camps: give them room."] = "往东北找{npc:263394}。先吸干他：对他使用{npc:263406}的眼睛，然后再打。没吸干的话，他和{npc:252457}都是 60 级精英。精英{npc:267439}（61 级）在{area:16866}的这个角落走动：别挡他的路。\n小心：军团巨兽（60 级，稀有精英）在{area:16866}的营地间践踏而过：离它们远点。",
    ["North-east to {npc:267097} at the northern ruins of {area:16866}: take {quest:97009} so the Defiling Hounds drop their spikes while you work the other errands here.\nCareful: Legion Hulks (60, rare elites) stomp through {area:16866}'s camps, and {npc:267439}, an elite (level 61), walks this corner: give them room."] = "往东北到{area:16866}北边废墟的{npc:267097}处：接{quest:97009}，这样你在这里做其他任务时，亵渎猎犬就会掉落尖刺。\n小心：军团巨兽（60 级，稀有精英）在{area:16866}的营地间践踏而过，精英{npc:267439}（61 级）在这个角落走动：离它们远点。",
    ["North-east up the slope from the veteran, north of {area:16868}: {npc:244512}'s silphium grows in the meadows there, where the Horde players in our recordings picked it. Then ride west to {area:16848}.\nCareful: Death Wailers (61, rare elites) drift over these slopes: keep out of their way."] = "从老兵那里沿山坡往东北，在{area:16868}北边：{npc:244512}要的串叶松香草长在那里的草地上，我们录像里的部落玩家就是在那里采的。然后往西骑到{area:16848}。\n小心：死亡哀嚎者（61 级，稀有精英）在这些山坡上飘荡：别挡它们的路。",
    ["North-east up the {area:456} to the falls: fill the sampler at the water there. Moonstalkers (14-15) roam the hills around the river.\nCareful: Encrusted Tide Crawlers (17-20) line the shore below the falls and the {npc:6788}'s bears (18-19) lair in the hills south of them: keep to the river."] = "沿{area:456}向东北上行到瀑布，在那里取水装满采样器。月夜猛虎（14-15级）在河流周围的山丘上游荡。\n小心：瀑布下方的岸边满是硬壳潮行蟹（17-20级），南边山丘里还有{npc:6788}的熊（18-19级）栖息：贴着河边走。",
    ["North-north-west of Asterion by the road, past the {quest:4723}: {quest:1001} wants Moonstalker Fangs next, from the second loop's hills. Then south-west down to {area:442}."] = "在阿斯特里昂北偏西的路边、过了{quest:4723}就是{quest:1001}，接下来它要你从第二轮路线的山丘上收集月夜猛虎的尖牙。然后向西南下到{area:442}。",
    ["North-west from {area:159} past {area:157} to the {area:16616}. Leonid stands just north of {npc:246389}'s camp.\n{npc:246389} and {npc:259190} camp at the forest's edge just south of Leonid. Every class can take both quests once {quest:96896} is handed in (level 10). They send you into the cellar under {area:16881}, the next stop."] = "从{area:159}向西北经过{area:157}前往{area:16616}。列奥尼德站在{npc:246389}营地正北。\n{npc:246389}和{npc:259190}在列奥尼德正南方的森林边缘扎营。10级交完{quest:96896}后，所有职业都能接取这两个任务，目标就在下一站{area:16881}下方的地窖里。",
    ["North-west from {area:609} back along the road to {area:608}: {npc:11438} waits at {area:2407}. He sends you after the robber to {area:35}, where the next guide ends: keep it."] = "从{area:609}沿路向西北返回{area:608}：{npc:11438}在{area:2407}等候。他会派你去{area:35}追捕强盗，正好在下一篇指南的终点：先留着。",
    ["North-west from {npc:1244}: the Mosshide Fenrunners and Trappers (22-24) along the river south-west of {area:309} drop flint, almost every one. Black, Crimson and Monstrous Oozes fill {area:309}, just west of the road to {area:205} and north of Einar's camp. Careful: Black and Crimson Oozes also drop {item:3349}. Pull those instead of fighting the larger Monstrous Oozes (25–26).\nCareful: Maddened Rotclaws (25-26) roam the {area:1025} around {npc:1244} and north of him: cross it to the river and don't hunt the flint there. Mosshide Brutes, Mystics and Alphas (24-27) hold the hills north-west of the Fenrunners' camp."] = "从{npc:1244}向西北：{area:309}西南河边的藓皮沼泽行者和藓皮捕猎者（22-24级）几乎每只都会掉落打火石。{area:309}就在通往{area:205}的大路西侧、艾纳尔营地以北，里面满是黑色软泥怪、深红软泥怪和巨型软泥怪。小心：黑色软泥怪和深红软泥怪同样掉落{item:3349}，优先打它们，避开体型更大的巨型软泥怪（25–26级）。\n小心：发狂腐爪（25-26级）在{npc:1244}周围及以北的{area:1025}游荡：直接穿过去到河边，别在那里刷打火石。藓皮蛮兵、秘法师和首领（24-27级）盘踞在沼泽行者营地西北的山丘上。",
    ["North-west hills"] = "西北山丘",
    ["North-west of Whitereach Post the Gravelsnout Diggers and Surveyors dig in the far western hills; one of them drops the ore sample. {quest:1131}, a lone hyena, prowls the same hills with the Pesterhide Snarlers: his rib is {npc:3441}'s.\nCareful: {quest:1131} is level 30 and the kobolds 28-29: pull them one at a time."] = "在白伸岗西北，碎石鼻挖掘者和勘测者在远西的山里挖矿，其中一种会掉落矿石样本。{quest:1131}是一只独行的鬣狗，和刺皮咆哮者一起在同一片山里游荡：它的肋骨是{npc:3441}要的。\n小心：{quest:1131}是 30 级，狗头人 28-29 级：一次拉一个。",
    ["North-west of the {area:228} the Moonrage Gluttons and Darksouls roam the hills between the road and the lake; their shackles drop from them. Past them, farther north-west, Moss Stalkers and Mist Creepers bleed the {item:3254}, and Giant Grizzled Bears roam among them for the hearts (any Grizzled Bear in the forest drops one)."] = "在{area:228}西北，月怒暴食者和月怒黑魂在大路和湖之间的山上游荡，镣铐从它们身上掉落。再往西北，苔藓潜伏者和迷雾爬行者会掉落{item:3254}，巨型灰熊在它们之间游荡，可以打熊心（森林里任何灰熊都会掉）。",
    ["North-west over the shrub field to {npc:249235}'s workshop on the slope above it. {quest:91923}, an elite (level 57), patrols the field, and {npc:248709}, an elite ancient (level 56), stands in its middle: give both room. Ghansurok, an elite chimaera (level 61), prowls around the workshop itself: see where he is before you ride up to {npc:249235}."] = "往西北越过灌木地，到它上方山坡上{npc:249235}的工坊。{quest:91923}是精英（57 级），在灌木地里巡逻，{npc:248709}是精英古树（56 级），站在灌木地中央：离它们都远点。甘苏洛克是精英奇美拉（61 级），在工坊周围游荡：骑到{npc:249235}那里之前先看看他在哪。",
    ["North-west to Barkskin Burrow, the furbolgs' den in the hillside: {npc:256978} waits just north of its mouth. The Barkskin furbolgs show as hostile until your standing with them improves, but none of them attacked in the recording: the Deadwood furbolgs in the camps around are the ones to fight. {npc:256978} offers more only once this first quest is handed in."] = "往西北到树皮熊怪的巢穴，那是山坡上的熊怪窝：{npc:256978}在洞口北边等着。在你和树皮熊怪的声望提升之前，它们显示为敌对，但录像里没有一个主动攻击：要打的是周围营地里的死木熊怪。交了这第一个任务后，{npc:256978}才会提供更多任务。",
    ["North-west to the road and north along it to {area:205}. {npc:1071} and {npc:1075} stand together in the dwarves' camp on the east side of the road; the {object:147516} ruins west of it are full of elites: keep to the road.\nCareful: Modr (32, elite) walks the {object:147516} ruins about 55 yards west of {npc:1075}; players have met it from the camp and the road: stay on the camp's east side."] = "向西北上大路并沿路向北前往{area:205}。{npc:1071}和{npc:1075}一起站在路东侧的矮人营地里；路西侧的{object:147516}废墟满是精英怪：贴着大路走。\n小心：莫德尔（32级，精英）在{npc:1075}以西约55码的{object:147516}废墟中巡逻，曾有玩家在营地和路上引到它：待在营地东侧。",
    ["Northern {zone:1412}. A long trip, but the idol only drops while his quest is in your log."] = "{zone:1412}北部。路很远，但只有你日志里有他的任务时神像才会掉落。",
    ["Not done on your first {zone:1440} visit? {npc:3691} also has {quest:1025} (the Foulweald, on the way to {npc:3897}) and {quest:1054} ({npc:3987}, on the way back from {area:413})."] = "第一次来{zone:1440}时没做完？{npc:3691}还提供{quest:1025}（污林熊怪，去{npc:3897}的顺路）和{quest:1054}（{npc:3987}，从{area:413}返回的顺路）。",
    ["OOX-22/FE sits in a cave near {area:1105}, among yetis and apes. Its escort runs west along the road to the dock on the {area:1108} with three ambushes: three yetis, then three gorillas, then four or five gnolls with a caster. Bring a friend if you are under 47. The robot keeps walking unless it is hit, so stay close; if it will not move, another player has it: wait for it to come back. Its turn-in is in {area:35}; keep the quest for later."] = "OOX-22/FE 在{area:1105}附近的山洞里，周围是雪人和猿猴。护送它沿大路往西到{area:1108}的码头，途中有三次伏击：三只雪人，然后三只大猩猩，然后四五个豺狼人带一个施法者。47 级以下最好带个朋友。机器人只要不挨打就会一直走，所以跟紧点；如果它不动了，说明别的玩家正在护送它：等它回来。交任务在{area:35}；先保留任务。",
    ["Ogre Miners recruited"] = "食人魔矿工已招募",
    ["On along the road east: the Dabyrie farm lies just north of it. {npc:4481} (34) and {npc:4479} (33) Dabyrie walk the farm's western yard among their Laborers and Militia (30-32); {npc:4480} (35) stands at the farm's north-eastern edge."] = "继续沿大路往东：达比里农场就在路北边。{npc:4481}（34 级）和{npc:4479}（33 级）在农场西院的劳工和民兵（30-32 级）之间走动；{npc:4480}（35 级）站在农场东北边缘。",
    ["On into {zone:1453}: {npc:1212} stands in the Cathedral of Light, on the way to the gryphon master. His next quest is for {npc:1217} in {area:150}, where the flight lands."] = "继续进入{zone:1453}：{npc:1212}站在去狮鹫管理员顺路经过的光明大教堂里。他的下一步任务交给降落地点{area:150}的{npc:1217}。",
    ["On into {zone:1453}: {npc:297} (the arrow shows him) takes the letter; the {object:1561} beside him holds the next clue."] = "继续进入{zone:1453}：把信交给{npc:297}（箭头所指）；他身旁的{object:1561}里藏着下一条线索。",
    ["On south-west to the jungle north-east of Mistvale: the three ghostly pirates haunt it beside Zanzil's camps. {npc:2535} and Jon-Jon stand together, {npc:2537} further east. Every one of Zanzil's followers can carry the mixture.\nCareful: the Zanzil Witch Doctors (44) cast and the camps are packed: pull from the edge, one at a time. {npc:2534} (46) himself stands in the southern camp around 39.6,58.6, a few steps from {npc:2537}'s ghost: pull {npc:2537} out to the north or east before you fight him."] = "继续往西南到雾谷东北的丛林：三个幽灵海盗在赞吉尔营地旁出没。{npc:2535}和乔恩乔恩站在一起，{npc:2537}在更东边。赞吉尔的每个追随者都可能带着混合物。\n小心：赞吉尔巫医（44 级）会施法，营地里怪很密：从边缘一次拉一个。{npc:2534}（46 级）本人站在南边营地约 39.6,58.6 处，离{npc:2537}的幽灵几步远：打他之前先把{npc:2537}往北或往东拉出来。",
    ["On the ride back west, the skeletons on the fields around {area:200} and {area:199} (50-53) drop the fragments."] = "往西骑回去的路上，{area:200}和{area:199}周围田野上的骷髅（50-53 级）会掉碎片。",
    ["On the ride north to {area:2255}, the Ice Thistle Yetis (55-56) in the hills south-east of the town carry Vizzie's {item:258323}: four pieces."] = "往北骑回{area:2255}的路上，镇子东南山里的冰蓟雪人（55-56 级）带着维齐要的{item:258323}：四块。",
    ["On the ride south, {npc:7771}'s dig camp stands at the {area:1938}: hand him the {item:10556}."] = "南下途中，{npc:7771}的挖掘营地就在{area:1938}：把{item:10556}交给他。",
    ["On the road east out of {area:3197}, {npc:10927}'s farmhouse stands on {area:197}: her {quest:5142} goes to the ghost in {area:2262}, the next stop."] = "从{area:3197}向东出镇的大路旁，{npc:10927}的农舍就在{area:197}：她的{quest:5142}交给下一站{area:2262}里的幽灵。",
    ["On the way back north from the dragon caves, the Muckshell Razorclaws and Pincers (41-44) crowd the shallows just north of the caves; about one in twenty carries the Jeweled Pendant Marg Speaks asks for."] = "从龙洞往北回去的路上，泥壳利钳蟹和钳蟹（41-44 级）挤在龙洞北边的浅水里；大约每二十只里有一只带着「玛格说话」要的宝石吊坠。",
    ["On the way back north-east towards {area:1099}, the Rogue Vale Screechers (44-46) hunt the open ground north of {area:1105}. Kill one, use {item:10699} on its body before you loot it, then talk to the spirit that rises: it is friendly. Three spirits in all; {npc:8579} takes them in {area:977} on your next {zone:1446} visit."] = "往东北回{area:1099}的路上，盗贼谷尖啸者（44-46 级）在{area:1105}北边的空地上狩猎。杀一只，拾取前先对它的尸体使用{item:10699}，然后和升起的灵魂对话：它是友好的。总共三个灵魂；下次来{zone:1446}时在{area:977}交给{npc:8579}。",
    ["On the way back south-east towards the camp, the Rage Scar yetis live around the caves in the hills by the road. Any of them can also drop a {quest:7738}, which starts a quest of its own."] = "往东南回营地的路上，怒痕雪人住在路边山里的洞穴附近。它们中任何一只都可能掉{quest:7738}，可以开始一个独立的任务。",
    ["On the way back to {area:159}, {area:164} is the Rot Hide camp on the hill east of the mills, south of the shore. {npc:1753} stands in the hut.\nCareful: {npc:1753} is level 11 and gnoll guards stand outside the hut and can join the fight: clear them one at a time first. If you slip past them and fight him inside, he fights alone."] = "返回{area:159}的途中，磨坊以东、海岸以南山丘上的腐皮营地就是{area:164}。{npc:1753}就在小屋里。\n小心：{npc:1753}是11级，屋外守着可能参战的豺狼人护卫：先逐个清掉它们。如果能绕过护卫直接进屋打他，他只会独自迎战。",
    ["On the way north, a short way east of the road: {npc:4723}'s house stands on the north shore of {area:37}. {npc:4723} (38) carries the key to his footlocker, inside the house; the Venture Co. Agents (39) stand in and around it: pull them one at a time. Then on north-west to Nesingwary's camp."] = "往北的路上，大路东边不远：{npc:4723}的房子在{area:37}北岸。{npc:4723}（38 级）带着他屋里小箱子的钥匙；风险投资公司特工（39 级）站在房子里外：一次拉一个。然后继续往西北去奈辛瓦里营地。",
    ["On the way to the harbour: {npc:4984}'s message goes to {npc:8997} in {area:442}, beside Terenthis, where the boat lands."] = "去港口的路上顺便接下：{npc:4984}的口信交给下船地点{area:442}、特伦希斯身旁的{npc:8997}。",
    ["On the way west to {npc:311}: Skeletal Fiends and Skeletal Horrors walk the cemetery's southern half, north of {area:94}. {npc:522}, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him."] = "向西前往{npc:311}的路上：骷髅恶魔和骷髅恐魔在{area:94}以北的墓地南半部游荡。精英怪{npc:522}在墓地间巡逻：远离他。",
    ["On the {zone:1455} platform of the {area:2257}, {npc:12997} asks for help with the rats: use his {item:17117} on the Deeprun Rats around the platform, hand them in, then take his letter to his brother {npc:13018} at the {zone:1453} end. The tram has no map inside. The city markers show the entrances, not the two brothers."] = "在{area:2257}的{zone:1455}站台上，{npc:12997}请你帮忙抓老鼠：对站台周围的矿道老鼠使用他的{item:17117}，交完任务后把他的信带给{zone:1453}一端的兄弟{npc:13018}。地铁内部没有地图，城中标记仅指示入口位置，而非兄弟二人所在。",
    ["On through the Drag: {npc:3348} and {npc:3347} run the alchemy shop; {npc:11046} is next door."] = "继续穿过暗巷区：{npc:3348}和{npc:3347}经营炼金店，{npc:11046}就在隔壁。",
    ["On to the old bridge over the Cradle: touch the crow effigy on it and {npc:267158} appears again."] = "继续到横跨摇篮的旧桥：触摸桥上的乌鸦雕像，{npc:267158}会再次出现。",
    ["On to {area:287} town, south-west of the yeti caves. The town hall is on the town's west side: {npc:2335} (30) and {npc:2448} are inside with the Town Registry; the Proclamation is pinned up beside it. Councilmen walk the town. Every {area:287} human you kill from here on can drop a skull for Samsa: keep them."] = "继续前往雪人洞西南的{area:287}镇。市政厅在镇子西边：{npc:2335}（30 级）和{npc:2448}在里面，旁边是镇民登记册，公告就钉在旁边。议员在镇里走动。从现在起你杀的每个{area:287}人类都可能掉落萨姆萨要的头骨：留着。",
    ["On west to the {area:152}."] = "继续往西到{area:152}。",
    ["Once you have the ten artifacts."] = "攒够十个神器后。",
    ["One pass through the pirates may give fewer than ten: {npc:773} takes the quest whenever you have them."] = "海盗打一遍可能拿不到十个：只要你攒够了，随时都可以交给{npc:773}。",
    ["Only from Friendly with the Timbermaw: {npc:11557}, in the tunnel near its {zone:1448} mouth, gives {quest:6031} then (the {area:1769} reputation guide gets you there)."] = "只有和木喉要塞达到友善后：隧道里靠近{zone:1448}出口的{npc:11557}届时会给{quest:6031}（{area:1769}声望指南可以帮你达到）。",
    ["Only if a Southsea pirate gave you a {item:9250}: it starts a quest for {npc:7882}, inside, where you stand."] = "仅当你从南海海盗身上打到{item:9250}时：使用它开启任务，直接交给眼前的室内{npc:7882}。",
    ["Only if a {quest:8471} dropped for you and you are Neutral with the Timbermaw (the {area:1769} reputation guide gets you there): {npc:11558} waits at the {zone:1448} entrance of {area:1769}."] = "仅在你掉了{quest:8471}并且和木喉要塞是中立时（{area:1769}声望指南可以帮你达到）：{npc:11558}在{area:1769}的{zone:1448}入口等着。",
    ["Only if the Timbermaw are already Neutral to you: the Deadwood furbolgs drop a {quest:8470} about one kill in thirty, and {npc:11558} just inside {area:1769} takes it. Below Neutral the quest is refused: it needs Neutral with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there."] = "仅当你在木喉要塞已达到中立时：死木熊怪大约每三十只掉落一件{quest:8470}，交给刚进{area:1769}的{npc:11558}。低于中立时无法接交该任务，需要木喉要塞声望达到中立；可参考声望指南刷够。",
    ["Only if you escorted the {zone:1425} robot: {npc:7406} has its reward too."] = "仅当你护送过{zone:1425}的机器人时：{npc:7406}这里也有它的奖励。",
    ["Only if you escorted the {zone:1444} robot: its reward waits with {npc:7406} here in {area:35}."] = "仅当你护送过{zone:1444}的机器人时：它的奖励就在{area:35}的{npc:7406}这里。",
    ["Only if {area:1638}'s {quest:1000} is still open for you (the {zone:1452} guide's stop offers it from level 54): it opens {quest:1123} in {zone:1450} and her {zone:1451} chain, so fly there first."] = "仅在{area:1638}的{quest:1000}对你仍然开放时（{zone:1452}指南的站点从 54 级起提供）：它会开启{zone:1450}的{quest:1123}和她在{zone:1451}的任务链，所以先飞到那里。",
    ["Only if {npc:11019} sent you after {npc:9518} (the {item:13140}'s chain): on the ride north, turn west into {area:1763}. {npc:9518} (56) stands by the remains of Trey Lightforge at the edge of the camp, well under you now; Trey's remains go back to {npc:11019} at the end of this guide."] = "只有{npc:11019}让你去找{npc:9518}时（{item:13140}的任务链）：往北骑时向西拐进{area:1763}。{npc:9518}（56 级）站在营地边缘特雷·光铸的遗骸旁，现在比你低很多；特雷的遗骸在本指南最后交回给{npc:11019}。",
    ["Only if {quest:4494} isn't done yet: {npc:7010} works in the Drag. Pestlezugg takes it in {area:976} on the {zone:1451} guide's first stop, after {zone:2482}."] = "仅在{quest:4494}还没完成时：{npc:7010}在暗巷工作。佩斯特扎格在{zone:1451}指南的第一站{area:976}收下，在{zone:2482}之后。",
    ["Only with the distress beacon, a rare drop in the {zone:1425}: it starts a quest to find the robot it calls for."] = "仅当你在{zone:1425}稀有掉落并获得求救信标时：使用它开启寻找对应机器人的任务。",
    ["Only with the distress beacon, a rare drop in {zone:1444}: it starts a quest to find the robot it calls for."] = "仅当你在{zone:1444}稀有掉落并获得求救信标时：使用它开启寻找对应机器人的任务。",
    ["Open Cuely's {item:10695} in your bags for the four labelled vials. The tide pools cannot be clicked: stand in each pool and use its own vial from your bags, from {area:1231} north up the coast; Spitelash naga patrol between them. No vials? Abandon the quest and take it again from {npc:8390} in the {zone:1458}."] = "在背包里打开科雷的{item:10695}取出四个带标签的小瓶。潮汐水池无法直接点击：从{area:1231}沿海岸向北，站进每个水池里从背包使用对应小瓶，水池之间有恶鞭纳迦巡逻。找不到小瓶？放弃任务后去{zone:1458}找{npc:8390}重接。",
    ["Open the {item:10569} from {zone:1427} for its {item:10575}, then tell {npc:9459} you bring proof of your deeds: no drake to fight.\nCareful: Volchan (60, a rare fire elemental) roams the hills around {npc:9459}'s cave: if he is about, wait for him to pass."] = "打开来自{zone:1427}的{item:10569}取出{item:10575}，然后告诉{npc:9459}你带来了功绩的证明：不用打幼龙。\n小心：60级稀有火元素沃尔坎在{npc:9459}山洞周围的山丘上游荡：如果他在附近，等他走过去再行动。",
    ["Ore Sample, from the Gravelsnout Diggers and Surveyors"] = "矿石样本，来自碎石鼻挖掘者和勘测者",
    ["Out to the pirates' cliffs once more. Plant Whizzbuzz's charges on the three ships moored below the camp, south to north. {quest:95124} (level 45) walks the middle ship's top deck; her loot chest is below deck. Keep an eye out for {npc:259758} on the way."] = "再次前往海盗的悬崖。从南到北，把维兹布兹的炸药安放在营地下方停泊的三艘船上。{quest:95124}（45级）在中间那艘船的上层甲板巡逻；她的战利品箱在甲板下。路上留意{npc:259758}。",
    ["Out to the pirates' cliffs once more. Plant Whizzbuzz's charges on the three ships moored below the camp, south to north. {quest:95124} walks the middle ship's top deck; her loot chest is below deck. Keep an eye out for {npc:259758} on the way.\nCareful: {quest:95124} is level 45, a level or two over you here: clear the deck around her first and come in with full health."] = "再去一次海盗的悬崖。把维兹布兹的炸药安放在营地下方停泊的三艘船上，从南到北。{quest:95124}在中间那艘船的上层甲板走动，她的战利品箱在甲板下。路上留意{npc:259758}。\n小心：{quest:95124}是 45 级，这时比你高一两级：先清掉她周围甲板上的怪，满血再上。",
    ["Over the {area:880}: the Dark Irons' cache of explosives sits by its Arathi end.\nCareful: Dark Iron Shadowcasters (31-32) and Bombardiers (30-31), who fight from range, and a Supplier (31-32) stand within 15-25 yards of the cache: pull them one at a time to the bridge before you touch it."] = "穿过{area:880}：黑铁矮人的炸药箱就放在大桥阿拉希一端。\n小心：会远程攻击的黑铁暗影法师（31-32级）和黑铁投弹手（30-31级），以及一名黑铁补给员（31-32级）站在炸药箱15-25码范围内：动箱子前先把它们逐个拉到桥上清掉。",
    ["Owl feathers"] = "猫头鹰羽毛",
    ["Past the Champions of the Deep, {npc:260202} fights with his guardians. He drops the idol."] = "过了深渊勇士，{npc:260202}和他的守卫一起战斗。他会掉神像。",
    ["Past the Makrura Snappers and Chasm Crawlers waits {npc:258905}, the first boss. The first tablet comes soon after him: click it for the rubbing."] = "过了马克鲁拉钳嘴蟹和深渊爬行者，就是第一个首领{npc:258905}。第一块石板就在他之后不远：点击它获得拓片。",
    ["Pathfinders, Den Watchers and Totemics share the furbolg camps around the hot springs; Ragged Owlbeasts roam the slopes between them. Kill Totemics first. Save every {item:14047} you loot for Meilosh.\nCareful: the Den Watchers are 55-56: pull the 55s, one at a time, and keep clear of the camps' totems."] = "探路者、巢穴守望者和图腾师分布在温泉周围的熊怪营地，破烂枭兽在营地之间的山坡上游荡。先杀图腾师。拾取到的每个{item:14047}都留给梅洛什。\n小心：巢穴守望者是 55-56 级：一次拉一只 55 级的，远离营地的图腾。",
    ["Pedestal examined"] = "已查看底座",
    ["Pestlezugg's next task, Pawn Captures Queen, sends you back to the {npc:10041} in the {area:540}: skip it."] = "匹斯特苏格的下一步任务“兵吃后”要你回到{area:540}打{npc:10041}：跳过。",
    ["Piznik"] = "皮兹尼克",
    ["Place the Toxic Fogger"] = "放置毒雾器",
    ["Place the grim message."] = "放置可怕的讯息。",
    ["Portal to {zone:1438}"] = "通往{zone:1438}的传送门",
    ["Portals Banished"] = "传送门已放逐",
    ["Predatory stags"] = "凶猛的雄鹿",
    ["Prickly pinecones"] = "带刺的松果",
    ["Pridewing Wyverns (21-22) and Consorts (22-23) nest on the slopes either side of the road, Skyhunters (23-24) a little further north-east. Any of them drops the venom sacs and the courier's supplies: start with the Consorts right beside the courier and work back along the road.\nCareful: {npc:5928}, a rare elite wyvern (27), flies over the Pridewing slopes and the road north: leave it alone."] = "雄翼双足飞龙（21-22级）和雄翼伴侣（22-23级）在道路两侧山坡筑巢，雄翼猎空者（23-24级）在稍东北处。它们全都会掉落毒囊和信使的补给品：先从信使身旁的雄翼伴侣打起，再沿路往回刷。\n小心：27级稀有精英双足飞龙{npc:5928}在雄翼山坡和北面道路上空盘旋：别去招惹它。",
    ["Priests: {quest:5621} counts only {spell:613} (Rank 2). {npc:3600} trains priests too: learn it from her now if you have not yet."] = "牧师：{quest:5621}只计入{spell:613}（等级2）。{npc:3600}也是牧师训练师：如果还没学，现在就向她学习。",
    ["Priests: {quest:5648} counts only {spell:613} (Rank 2). {npc:3706} trains priests too: learn it from her now if you have not yet."] = "牧师：{quest:5648}只计入{spell:613}（等级2）。{npc:3706}也是牧师训练师：如果还没学，现在就向她学习。",
    ["Protect Arko'narin out of Shadow Hold"] = "保护阿尔科纳林离开暗影堡",
    ["Pull a single Protector down to the road, then repair the pylon from its west side."] = "拉一个守护者到路上，然后从西侧修复水晶塔。",
    ["Pull a single Protector down to the road, then use the {item:271882} on the pylon's west side."] = "单拉一只守护者到路上击杀，然后在水晶塔西侧使用{item:271882}。",
    ["Question Reethe with Ogron"] = "和奥格隆一起审问里瑟",
    ["Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills south of {area:442}: use {quest:2139} on one to capture it. Then walk up to the furbolg camp just east of them: nothing to kill yet."] = "狂暴的蓟熊在{area:442}南边的山丘上游荡：对其中一只使用{quest:2139}将其捕获。然后走到它们正东的熊怪营地：暂时不用击杀任何怪物。",
    ["Radley and Durgen"] = "拉德利与杜根",
    ["Raise your alchemy skill to 20"] = "将炼金术技能提升到 20",
    ["Raise your blacksmithing skill to 20"] = "将锻造技能提升到 20",
    ["Raise your enchanting skill to 20"] = "将附魔技能提升到 20",
    ["Raise your engineering skill to 20"] = "将工程学技能提升到 20",
    ["Raise your herbalism skill to 20"] = "将草药学技能提升到 20",
    ["Raise your leatherworking skill to 20"] = "将制皮技能提升到 20",
    ["Raise your mining skill to 20"] = "将采矿技能提升到 20",
    ["Raise your skinning skill to 20"] = "将剥皮技能提升到 20",
    ["Raise your tailoring skill to 20"] = "将裁缝技能提升到 20",
    ["Return the corrupted cat to Winna Hazzard"] = "把被腐化的猫交还给温娜·哈扎德",
    ["Ride back north up the valley and west along the road to the tunnel at {zone:1452}'s western end, where Salfa stands. Walk into {area:1769} and take the {area:493} branch of the tunnel down to {area:493}. {npc:10897}, {area:493}'s flight master, stands south of the lake, outside {area:2361}: learn the flight path from him. The flight master in {area:2361} itself flies only Druids, from her gossip, and has no flight path to learn. The next guide flies on from here."] = "沿山谷向北、再沿路向西骑到{zone:1452}西端萨尔法所在的隧道。走进{area:1769}，从隧道里的{area:493}岔路下去抵达{area:493}。{area:493}的飞行管理员{npc:10897}站在湖南岸、{area:2361}外：向他学习飞行路线。{area:2361}里面的飞行管理员仅通过对话为德鲁伊提供飞行，没有可学习的飞行点。下一篇指南将从这里起飞。",
    ["Ride back north-west to {area:2253} on its hill: {npc:11079} and {npc:10301} stand together."] = "向西北骑回山丘上的{area:2253}：{npc:11079}和{npc:10301}站在一起。",
    ["Ride back south from {area:200} to the camp."] = "从{area:200}向南骑回营地。",
    ["Ride back south into the {zone:1419} for the bloodmages' beasts: Starving Snickerfangs roam the dry hills south of the bloodmages' camp, Scorpok Stingers scuttle across the middle of the north and {npc:5982} vultures circle over all of it. Ashmane Boars and Redstone Basilisks share the slopes south-west of the keep.\nCareful: two elites roam here: {npc:221740} (50) in the middle of the zone around 44,34, and {npc:247015} (55) on the ridge around 39,32. When you see one, hunt somewhere else.\nCareful: {npc:8301} (53, a rare scorpid) walks the north around 47,36, {npc:8298} (54, rare) the middle around 45,48, and Snickerfang Matriarchs (60) roam the ground east of here, between Kum'isha's hill and the {area:1440} (about 54-62, 31-47): give them room.\nAny mob here may drop a {item:8244}: keep it for Kum'isha."] = "骑马向南返回{zone:1419}，狩猎血法师要的野兽：饥饿的弯牙土狼在血法师营地以南的干涸山丘游荡，厚甲毒刺蝎在北部中央爬行，{npc:5982}秃鹫则在整片区域上空盘旋。灰鬃野猪和红石蜥蜴分布在要塞西南的山坡上。\n小心：这里有两只游荡的精英：{npc:221740}（50级）在地区中部约44,34一带，{npc:247015}（55级）在约39,32的山脊上。看到它们就换个地方打怪。\n小心：{npc:8301}（53级稀有蝎子）在北部约47,36处巡逻，{npc:8298}（54级稀有）在中部约45,48处，60级的弯牙土狼主母则在东边库米沙所在的山丘与{area:1440}之间（约54-62, 31-47）游荡：离它们远点。\n这里的任何怪物都可能掉落{item:8244}：留着交给库米沙。",
    ["Ride back south to {area:3197}."] = "骑马向南返回{area:3197}。",
    ["Ride back west along the road to the {area:2260}."] = "沿大路往西骑回{area:2260}。",
    ["Ride back west along the road to {npc:10927}'s farmhouse; {npc:10936}'s monument is just north of it."] = "沿大路向西骑回{npc:10927}的农舍；{npc:10936}的纪念碑就在农舍北边。",
    ["Ride back west: Raging Owlbeasts roam the hills north of {area:2251}, by the road between {area:2255} and {area:2246}. Careful: the biggest are level 56: pull them one at a time."] = "往西骑回去：狂暴枭兽在{area:2251}北边的山里游荡，就在{area:2255}和{area:2246}之间的路边。小心：最大的是 56 级：一次拉一只。",
    ["Ride east again to the foot of {area:537}: {npc:9999} sits on its eastern slope, lost and exhausted."] = "再向东骑到{area:537}山脚：{npc:9999}坐在它东边的山坡上，迷了路，精疲力竭。",
    ["Ride east along the road past {area:2251} to {area:2255} first: its yeti and chimaera errands bring you about a quarter of a level, which the Frostfire furbolg camps want; {npc:9298}'s camps come on the ride back west."] = "沿大路往东经过{area:2251}，先到{area:2255}：那里的雪人和奇美拉任务能给你大约四分之一级，霜火熊怪营地需要这些经验；{npc:9298}的营地在往西骑回去的路上。",
    ["Ride east along the road to {area:2255}: {npc:11755} sends you to {npc:10307}, who stands in the town, on the way to {area:2249}."] = "沿大路往东骑到{area:2255}：{npc:11755}让你去找镇里的{npc:10307}，在去{area:2249}的路上。",
    ["Ride east along the road to {area:2268}."] = "沿大路往东骑到{area:2268}。",
    ["Ride east along the road to {area:489}, on the {zone:1441} border: the next guide flies from there."] = "沿大路向东骑往{zone:1441}边界上的{area:489}：下一份指南会从那里坐飞机出发。",
    ["Ride east along the southern road across the {zone:1423} to {area:2268}: Plaguehound Runts and Plaguebats roam beside it.\nCareful: Gargantuan Plaguebats (60) fly among the smaller bats near the western border: take the Plaguebats of your level."] = "沿南部大路向东穿过{zone:1423}前往{area:2268}：路边有瘟疫幼犬和瘟疫蝙蝠游荡。\n小心：西部边界附近的小蝙蝠群中混有60级的巨型瘟疫蝙蝠：只挑与你等级相当的瘟疫蝙蝠打。",
    ["Ride east from Kum'isha's hill to the mouth of the {area:1440} caverns, due south of {area:1438}: Danneth hides just inside.\nCareful: Snickerfang Matriarchs (60) roam the ground between Kum'isha's hill and the caverns: watch for them on the ride and go round them, there and back.\nCareful: Shadowsworn Cultists, Thugs and Adepts (51-52) guard the caves, and the deeper chambers hold {npc:7728} (55, elite) and {npc:7666} (58, elite): stay near the mouth, pull one at a time, and lead Danneth straight out.\nWalk him out of the caves and north to {area:1438}: Connar takes him there."] = "从库米沙的山丘向东骑往{area:1438}正南方的{area:1440}洞口：丹内斯就躲在洞口里面一点。\n小心：60级的弯牙土狼主母在库米沙的山丘和洞穴之间游荡：来回骑行时注意观察并绕开它们。\n小心：魔誓祭司、魔誓暴徒和魔誓专家（51-52级）守着洞穴，深处还有{npc:7728}（55级精英）和{npc:7666}（58级精英）：待在洞口附近逐个拉怪，直接带丹内斯出来。\n护送他走出洞穴并向北前往{area:1438}，交给康纳尔。",
    ["Ride east from {area:1237} to Sanath's camp at the foot of the cliff and get off your mount: he teleports you up to {npc:8379}'s tower."] = "从{area:1237}向东骑到悬崖脚下萨纳斯的营地，然后下坐骑：他会把你传送到{npc:8379}的塔上。",
    ["Ride east into the {zone:1423}: the {area:2260} is the farm north of the southern road, north-west of {area:2262}. The three agents' remains are bone outlines on the ground: one by the road south of the farm, one on the hill east of the house, one on the mound in front of it.\nCareful: {npc:11878} (level 62 elite) and his elite hounds stand in front of the house: take the remains on the mound from the side and do not pull him. You don't have to fight him."] = "向东骑入{zone:1423}：{area:2260}在南部大路北侧、{area:2262}西北方向。三名特工的遗骸是地上的骸骨轮廓：一具在农场南面的路边，一具在农舍东面的小山上，一具在农舍前的土丘上。\n小心：{npc:11878}（62级精英）和他的精英猎犬守在屋前：从侧面拾取土丘上的遗骸，别引到他。你不需要和他战斗。",
    ["Ride east to the border river: {npc:1855} lives in a small hut on the bank. His hunts are in the {area:2277} and {area:2627}, at the end of this guide's ride east."] = "向东骑到边界河边：{npc:1855}住在河岸的小木屋里。他的狩猎任务在{area:2277}和{area:2627}，就在本指南向东骑行的终点附近。",
    ["Ride east to {area:537}, climb it and use {npc:10541} at the lava vent near the top, then ride back west to {npc:10302}.\nCareful: Living Blazes (54-55) and Scorching Elementals (53-54) burn on the slopes: ride up the path and pull only what stands on it."] = "向东骑到{area:537}，爬上去，在靠近山顶的熔岩口使用{npc:10541}，然后骑回西边找{npc:10302}。\n小心：活体火焰（54-55 级）和灼热元素（53-54 级）在山坡上燃烧：沿小路骑上去，只拉路上的怪。",
    ["Ride east, then south down {area:2249}. The Frostmaul giants there are elite level 59-60: keep to the middle and keep moving. The strange source is at the mouth of {area:2256}, at the south end."] = "往东骑，然后往南下到{area:2249}。那里的霜槌巨人是 59-60 级精英：走中间，别停下。奇怪的来源在南端{area:2256}的入口。",
    ["Ride north from {area:271} into Alterac and west to the walls of {area:279}: {npc:34365} stands outside them."] = "从{area:271}向北进入奥特兰克，再向西前往{area:279}城墙外：{npc:34365}站在城墙外面。",
    ["Ride north up the road to the cave mouth of {area:1769}."] = "沿大路向北骑到{area:1769}的洞口。",
    ["Ride north up the whole {zone:1448} road, past {area:1997}. The cauldron stands in {area:1762}, just south-west of {area:1769}; the Deadwood furbolgs there are hostile."] = "沿{zone:1448}的大路一路往北，经过{area:1997}。大锅立在{area:1762}，就在{area:1769}西南；那里的死木熊怪是敌对的。",
    ["Ride north up the {zone:1448} road to {area:1767}; the {quest:5086} ooze between the trees, and most of them drop a droplet. The Irontree Wanderers and Stompers (52-53) there carry {npc:9116}'s {item:11173}, the Angerclaw bears and Felpaw wolves his {item:11172}.\nCareful: Ancient Irontree Walkers, level 59 elites, walk among the {quest:5086}, and {npc:14524} (63, elite) roams the woods: work the Horrors at the north tip of {area:1767}, one at a time."] = "沿{zone:1448}的大路往北骑到{area:1767}；{quest:5086}在树木之间蠕动，大多数都会掉落一滴。那里的铁木游荡者和践踏者（52-53 级）带着{npc:9116}要的{item:11173}，怒爪熊和魔爪狼带着他要的{item:11172}。\n小心：远古铁木行者（59 级精英）在{quest:5086}之间行走，{npc:14524}（63 级，精英）在树林里游荡：在{area:1767}北端一次一个地打恐魔。",
    ["Ride north-east from the dock past the {area:1119} to {npc:7775}'s camp. He brews the {item:11243} from an {item:11242}: take his errand for one."] = "从码头向东北骑行，经过{area:1119}前往{npc:7775}的营地。他可以用{item:11242}酿制{item:11243}：接下他的差事去换一瓶。",
    ["Ride north-east from {quest:3821} to the small cave in the far east of the {zone:1428}. Open the {object:149502} from the {zone:1427} for its {item:10575}, then tell {npc:9459} you bring proof of your deeds: no drake to fight.\nCareful: Volchan (60, a rare fire elemental) roams the hills around {npc:9459}'s cave: if he is about, wait for him to pass."] = "从{quest:3821}向东北骑到{zone:1428}极东的小山洞。打开来自{zone:1427}的{object:149502}拿出{item:10575}，然后告诉{npc:9459}你带来了功绩的证明：不用打幼龙。\n小心：沃尔坎（60 级，稀有火元素）在{npc:9459}山洞周围的山里游荡：如果他在附近，等他走过去。",
    ["Ride north-east to {npc:13220} at {area:3077}."] = "向东北骑往{area:3077}找{npc:13220}。",
    ["Ride north-west along the road into {zone:1448}. Ror stands at the far south end of {area:1761}, just inside the border."] = "沿大路向西北骑进{zone:1448}。罗尔站在{area:1761}最南端，刚过边界。",
    ["Ride north-west along the road out of {zone:1440} into {zone:1448}. The {area:2479} is the druids' camp just past the border."] = "沿大路向西北骑出{zone:1440}进入{zone:1448}。{area:2479}是刚过边界的德鲁伊营地。",
    ["Ride north-west past {area:1763} to the corrupted moonwell of the Jadefire satyrs and fill {npc:9996}'s flasket there."] = "向西北骑过{area:1763}，到玉火萨特被腐化的月亮井，在那里装满{npc:9996}的小瓶。",
    ["Ride north-west to the Dalson farm. The diary lies in the barn; a wandering skeleton carries the outhouse key, and {npc:10836} waits in the outhouse with the cabinet key. {npc:11152} stands just south-west of the farmhouse, and its Cauldron Lord beside it carries the key."] = "向西北骑往达尔松农场。日记在谷仓里；一只游荡的骷髅带着厕所钥匙，{npc:10836}拿着橱柜钥匙待在厕所里。{npc:11152}就在农舍西南方，旁边的护锅者身上带着钥匙。",
    ["Ride north-west to {area:1763}. The four braziers stand among the Shadow Council's buildings; use the Cleansed Water on each one.\nCareful: Shadow Council mobs of level 53-55 fill the cave and often come in linked groups, many with stuns: pull them one group at a time."] = "向西北骑到{area:1763}。四个火盆立在暗影议会的建筑之间，对每个火盆使用净化之水。\n小心：洞里满是 53-55 级的暗影议会怪，常常成组连在一起，很多会昏迷技能：一次拉一组。",
    ["Ride north-west to {npc:1855}'s hut by the {area:2619} and hear him out."] = "向西北骑到{area:2619}旁{npc:1855}的小屋，听他说完。",
    ["Ride on to {npc:9298}'s camp beside the hot springs."] = "继续骑往温泉旁的{npc:9298}营地。",
    ["Ride south across the gorge to the long bridge into {area:254}. Inside, follow the chain walkways down and leave through the southern exit; stay off the paths to the dungeon portals."] = "向南穿过峡谷，走长桥进入{area:254}。在里面沿着铁链走道往下，从南边出口离开；别走去副本传送门的路。",
    ["Ride south from the cave to {area:1998}, the night elves' camp on the road."] = "从洞穴向南骑往大路边的暗夜精灵营地{area:1998}。",
    ["Ride south from {npc:1855}'s hut to {area:201}. {npc:11078} (58) guards the cauldron.\nCareful: Soulwrath is level 58, a level over you here: clear the ghouls around the cauldron first and pull him alone."] = "从{npc:1855}的小屋向南骑往{area:201}。{npc:11078}（58级）看守着大锅。\n小心：索瓦斯是58级，比你此时高一级：先清掉大锅周围的食尸鬼，再单独拉他。",
    ["Ride south to {npc:9298}'s camp beside the hot springs."] = "向南骑往温泉旁的{npc:9298}营地。",
    ["Ride south-east from {area:2255} down the valley to {npc:10301}'s damaged crate in the snow at {area:2245}, with his wrecked wagon just east of it."] = "从{area:2255}沿山谷向东南骑到{area:2245}雪地里{npc:10301}损坏的箱子处，他损毁的马车就在箱子东边。",
    ["Ride south-east to {area:201}, the farm under the eastern hills: {npc:11078} (58) guards its cauldron. Kill him for the key, then use the cauldron.\nCareful: Soulwrath is about two levels over you here: clear the ghouls around the cauldron first, start at full health and use your cooldowns on him."] = "向东南骑到东边山下的农场{area:201}：{npc:11078}（58 级）守着那里的大锅。杀了他拿钥匙，然后使用大锅。\n小心：灵魂之怒这时比你高大约两级：先清掉大锅周围的食尸鬼，满血开打，对他用上你的冷却技能。",
    ["Ride south-west into Andorhal. {npc:10667} waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town. Stand in the doorway of each of the four towers with the {item:12815} to mark it; keep to the edges of town. Use the {item:12627} by the silos in the middle of town to bring out Temporal Parasites (55-57): fight them one at a time and let the biggest go.\nCareful: a {npc:10996}, a level 58-59 elite, can stand in Andorhal, as at many other spots of the {zone:1422}: give it room.\nCareful: Skeletal Warlords, level 56-57 elites, stand by the first and second towers (the south-western and the western one): mark those towers from the far side of the doorway once the Warlord has turned away, and never pull one. Putridius (58, rare) walks among the silos."] = "向西南骑进安多哈尔。{npc:10667}在镇子西边被毁的旅店里等着。拿着{item:12815}站在四座塔每一座的门口来标记它，沿着镇子边缘走。在镇子中央的粮仓旁使用{item:12627}引出时空寄生虫（55-57 级）：一次打一只，放过最大的。\n小心：一只{npc:10996}（58-59 级精英）可能站在安多哈尔，{zone:1422}的很多地方都有它：给它留出空间。\n小心：骷髅督军（56-57 级精英）站在第一和第二座塔旁（西南那座和西边那座）：等督军转过身后，从门口远侧标记这两座塔，绝对别拉它。普崔迪乌斯（58 级，稀有）在粮仓之间走动。",
    ["Ride south-west through the {zone:1422} to {area:3197}."] = "向西南穿过{zone:1422}骑往{area:3197}。",
    ["Ride to the lake south of the {area:2277}, north-west of {area:2268}."] = "骑往{area:2277}以南、{area:2268}西北方的湖泊。",
    ["Ride west from {area:3077} to the walled hold in the middle of the desert. {npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "从{area:3077}向西骑到沙漠中央有围墙的要塞。{npc:15189}站在他那栋楼的楼上：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
    ["Ride west from {area:541} to the crater's north-western pass into {zone:1451}."] = "从{area:541}向西骑往环形山西北山口，进入{zone:1451}。",
    ["Ride west from {npc:1855}'s hut into the {zone:1422}: {npc:11610} hides on the hill north-east of the {area:192}, on the way to the {area:152}."] = "从{npc:1855}的小屋往西骑进{zone:1422}：{npc:11610}躲在{area:192}东北的山上，在去{area:152}的路上。",
    ["Ride west out of the keep to the bloodmages' camp beside the road into the {zone:1419}."] = "向西骑出要塞，前往进入{zone:1419}的大路旁的血法师营地。",
    ["Ride west to the dig site. The {quest:4296} stands in its middle among the Thaurissan dwarves. Copy it.\nBlack Broodlings nest in the hills just east of {area:251}. Use {npc:10267}'s {item:12284} on a broodling when it is almost dead to capture its essence.\nCareful: a {npc:7040} and a {npc:7044}, elites of 50-53, wander the same hills, and Volchan (60, a rare fire elemental) roams them too: pull the broodlings away from them, or bring a group."] = "向西骑到挖掘场。{quest:4296}立在挖掘场中央的索瑞森矮人之间。抄写它。\n黑色雏龙在{area:251}东边的山里筑巢。在雏龙快死时对它使用{npc:10267}的{item:12284}来捕获它的精华。\n小心：一只{npc:7040}和一只{npc:7044}（50-53 级精英）在同一片山里游荡，沃尔坎（60 级，稀有火元素）也在：把雏龙拉离它们，或者组队来。",
    ["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount, and the {zone:2548} after Stranglethorn are a long walk without one. Take the zeppelin from {object:3202}'s tower to the {zone:1458}'s towers: {npc:4773} teaches the Forsaken in {area:159}, a short ride north, with {npc:4731}'s skeletal horses (20 gold each). Then the zeppelin back to {object:3202}. Short of gold? Skip this step: the {zone:1444} & {zone:1446} guide passes the {zone:1458} again at about 45."] = "骑术需要 40 级，学费 100 金币；学会后会给你一匹坐骑，荆棘谷之后的{zone:2548}没有坐骑要走很远。从{object:3202}的塔坐飞艇到{zone:1458}的塔：{npc:4773}在北边不远的{area:159}教被遗忘者骑术，{npc:4731}卖骷髅马（每匹 20 金币）。然后坐飞艇回{object:3202}。金币不够？跳过这一步：{zone:1444}和{zone:1446}指南约 45 级时会再经过{zone:1458}。",
    ["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is {npc:4773} in {area:159}, a short ride north of the zeppelin towers, with {npc:4731}'s skeletal horses (20 gold each) beside her. Ride back to the towers for the {zone:1454} zeppelin."] = "骑术需要 40 级，学费 100 金币；学会后会给你一匹坐骑。每个种族向自己种族的训练师学：你的是{area:159}的{npc:4773}，在飞艇塔北边不远，旁边是卖骷髅马的{npc:4731}（每匹 20 金币）。骑回塔那里坐去{zone:1454}的飞艇。",
    ["Right-click the beacon: it starts {quest:2766}"] = "右键点击信标：开始{quest:2766}",
    ["Right-click the beacon: it starts {quest:351}"] = "右键点击信标：开始{quest:351}",
    ["Right-click the beacon: it starts {quest:485}"] = "右键点击信标：开始{quest:485}",
    ["Rog'mar Scout rescued"] = "罗格玛斥候已获救",
    ["Rusted Iron Key"] = "生锈的铁钥匙",
    ["Rutgar Glyphshaper"] = "鲁特伽·刻符者",
    ["Savages and Storm Witches nest in {area:370}, east of {npc:3293}. A Storm Witch drops the {item:277661}, which starts {quest:97281}."] = "尘风暴徒和雷巫盘踞在{npc:3293}东边的{area:370}。雷巫会掉落{item:277661}，可开启{quest:97281}。",
    ["Savages and Storm Witches nest in {area:370}, east of {npc:3293}. A Storm Witch drops the {item:277661}, which starts {quest:97281}.\nShamans: the Burning Blade Cultists by {area:371}, at the ravine's south end, drop the {item:6652}. The {item:5026} comes from the Razormane on the next guide's first visit to their camp."] = "尘风暴徒和雷巫盘踞在{npc:3293}东边的{area:370}。雷巫会掉落{item:277661}，可开启{quest:97281}。\n萨满祭司：峡谷南端{area:371}附近的火刃祭司会掉落{item:6652}。{item:5026}则在下一份指南首次前往钢鬃野猪人营地时获取。",
    ["Savannah Patriarchs roam the plains east of {npc:3682}'s camp, and the Sprung Traps lie among them."] = "草原狮王在{npc:3682}营地东边的平原上游荡，被触发的陷阱就散落在它们之间。",
    ["Scare {npc:10977} with {item:12928}"] = "用{item:12928}吓唬{npc:10977}",
    ["Scout the gazebo on Mystral Lake that overlooks the nearby Alliance outpost."] = "侦察密斯特拉湖上能俯瞰附近联盟哨站的凉亭。",
    ["Seahorn's next task, {quest:597}, waits for the level-48 {area:35} stop with the {area:43} camp (41-43): leave it for now."] = "海角船长的下一个任务{quest:597}留到48级回{area:35}时连同{area:43}营地（41-43级）一起做：现在先别管。",
    ["Search the tents and the rowboat for both papers; if one place is empty, try the next. Neither paper is on a ship."] = "在帐篷和小划艇里找这两份文件，一处没有就换下一处。两份文件都不在船上。",
    ["Seed planted in Sunderbark's remains"] = "种子已种在裂皮的遗骸里",
    ["Seeds and owl eggs"] = "种子与猫头鹰蛋",
    ["Shenthul"] = "申苏尔",
    ["Shrine Of Remulos"] = "雷姆洛斯神殿",
    ["Silithus Dust Turnin Quest Doodad"] = "希利苏斯尘土交付点",
    ["Silithus Dust Turnin Quest Doodad Horde"] = "希利苏斯尘土交付点（部落）",
    ["Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls (50) roam the fields just north of the camp.\nCareful: These undead notice you from far away, and other undead nearby join the fight when one is pulled."] = "骷髅剥皮者和被奴役的食尸鬼（50级）在营地正北的田野里游荡。\n小心：这些亡灵警戒范围很大，拉到一只时附近的其他亡灵也会加入战斗。",
    ["Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls (50) roam the fields north of the camp; all the Scourge here drop Scourgestones.\nCareful: These undead notice you from far away, and other undead nearby join the fight when one is pulled.\nCareful: The {npc:10411} (3 spawns, 15 min respawn) turns invisible when out of combat and calls in Rockwing Gargoyles once a fight starts."] = "骷髅剥皮者和被奴役的食尸鬼（50级）在营地北边的田野里游荡；这里的所有天灾亡灵都会掉落天灾石。\n小心：这些亡灵警戒范围很大，拉到一只时附近的其他亡灵也会加入战斗。\n小心：{npc:10411}（3处刷新点，15分钟刷新）脱战时会隐身，一旦开战就会召唤石翼石像鬼。",
    ["Skeletal Raiders"] = "骷髅袭击者",
    ["Skunks repelled"] = "臭鼬已被赶走",
    ["Slay Blackthorne Pact Members"] = "杀死黑棘盟约成员",
    ["Slime Workstation"] = "软泥工作台",
    ["Slime Workstation disrupted"] = "软泥工作台已破坏",
    ["Slime ooze as you go"] = "顺路收集软泥",
    ["Small lockboxes lie in the rubble all over Andorhal; each holds a watch.\nCareful: Ghouls and skeletons usually stand next to the boxes and attack when you come close. Searing ghouls also hurt anyone nearby and will break stealth."] = "安多哈尔各处的废墟里散落着小箱子，每个里面都有一块怀表。\n小心：箱子旁边通常守着食尸鬼和骷髅，靠近就会遭攻击。灼热的食尸鬼还会伤害周围目标并打破潜行。",
    ["Snufflesnout (44) is elite: a hard one-on-one fight in the ring, where nobody can help you. Come in rested, with full health and mana."] = "嗅嗅鼻（44 级）是精英：在擂台里一对一硬战，没人能帮你。带着休息经验、满血满蓝再上。",
    ["Snufflesnout defeated"] = "嗅嗅鼻已被击败",
    ["Soil and venison"] = "土壤与鹿肉",
    ["South Bonfire"] = "南边篝火",
    ["South along the coast, the Southsea pirates hold the cove. {npc:7883} and the stolen cargo are on the docks at its far end. Any pirate can drop a hat, the kidnappers most often.\nCareful: Two or three pirates stand with {npc:7883} (45), and many more pirates from the town join the fight once it starts: pull his guards away from him first.\nThe cove's pirates sometimes drop a {item:9276}: open it, and if it holds a {item:9250}, read it to start a quest for the Security Chief in {area:977}."] = "沿海岸往南，南海海盗占据着海湾。{npc:7883}和被偷的货物在海湾尽头的码头上。任何海盗都可能掉帽子，绑匪掉得最多。\n小心：{npc:7883}（45 级）身边站着两三个海盗，战斗一开始镇里还会有更多海盗加入：先把他的护卫拉开。\n海湾的海盗有时会掉{item:9276}：打开它，如果里面有{item:9250}，阅读它可以开始{area:977}安全主管的任务。",
    ["South along the road to the {area:1025}: {npc:270637} camps among the Fenrunners, just west of {npc:1244}."] = "沿大路向南前往{area:1025}：{npc:270637}在{npc:1244}西边的藓皮沼泽行者之间扎营。",
    ["South along the road to the {area:2479}."] = "沿大路往南到{area:2479}。",
    ["South along the road to the {area:2479}: {npc:11019}, at its east side, takes Trey Lightforge's remains."] = "沿大路往南到{area:2479}：东侧的{npc:11019}收下特雷·光铸的遗骸。",
    ["South down the coast to Shadowprey: {npc:268705} first, on the path into the village; {npc:11624} takes the box and sends you to {area:602} with it; {npc:12340} takes the naga."] = "沿海岸往南到葬影村：先在进村的小路上找{npc:268705}；{npc:11624}收下盒子，让你带着它去{area:602}；{npc:12340}收纳迦的任务。",
    ["South down the west side of the shrub field to the ancients' outpost: kill the {npc:248395} you pass for {npc:249235}. {npc:260626}, the flight mistress, waits by the outpost; {npc:248367} and {npc:265586} stand with the ancient {npc:248366}."] = "沿灌木地西侧往南到古树的前哨：路上杀掉你经过的{npc:248395}，交给{npc:249235}。飞行管理员{npc:260626}在前哨旁等着；{npc:248367}和{npc:265586}和古树{npc:248366}站在一起。",
    ["South from {area:272} along the river: Snapjaws (29-31) sun themselves on its banks all the way down to the hills above {area:271}. Some of them carry {item:3712}."] = "从{area:272}沿河往南：钳嘴龟（29-31 级）在河岸上晒太阳，一直到{area:271}上方的山边。其中一些身上带着{item:3712}。",
    ["South from {area:42} to the {area:121}, on the way to {zone:1430}: the mound of dirt by the Nightbane worgen (29-31) holds the evidence {npc:661} wants."] = "从{area:42}向南前往去往{zone:1430}路上的{area:121}：夜行狼人（29-31级）旁边的一堆泥土里藏着{npc:661}要的证据。",
    ["South from {npc:3987}'s camp to {area:415}: {npc:3691} and {npc:3961} are in the inn, the flight master at the west end."] = "从{npc:3987}的营地向南前往{area:415}：{npc:3691}和{npc:3961}在旅店里，飞行管理员在西头。",
    ["South of Darkcloud Pinnacle the Screeching harpies hold {area:487}; {npc:4877}'s stolen supplies lie on the ground around it.\nCareful: the harpies (28-29) stand in packs and the Windcallers cast from range: pull at the edge. {npc:4490} (31) waits deeper in the den: leave her for {npc:2986}'s {quest:1150} at about 30, in the next guide."] = "黑云峰南边，尖啸鹰身人占据着{area:487}；{npc:4877}被偷的补给散落在巢穴周围的地上。\n小心：鹰身人（28-29 级）成群站着，唤风者会远程施法：在边缘拉怪。{npc:4490}（31 级）在巢穴更深处：留给下一个指南里{npc:2986}的{quest:1150}，约 30 级时再打。",
    ["South of the {area:1938} the Dunemaul ogres hold their compound, with {npc:12046} at its eastern end: {npc:11758}'s quest, if you still carry it from {zone:1446}."] = "{area:1938}南边，沙槌食人魔占据着他们的营地，{npc:12046}在营地东端：{npc:11758}的任务，如果你还带着从{zone:1446}来的。",
    ["South of the {area:982}, on the way west to {quest:3362}, the Dunemaul ogres hold their compound: the Brutes (46-48) and Enforcers (45-47) fill it, {npc:12046} (49) stands at its eastern end.\nCareful: {npc:12046} is one to two levels above you here, and the Ogre Mages and Warlocks (46-48) cast from range: pull from the compound's edge, one at a time, and leave {npc:12046} for last with full health."] = "{area:982}南边，往西去{quest:3362}的路上，沙槌食人魔占据着他们的营地：蛮兵（46-48 级）和执行者（45-47 级）挤满营地，{npc:12046}（49 级）站在营地东端。\n小心：{npc:12046}这时比你高一到两级，食人魔法师和术士（46-48 级）会远程施法：从营地边缘一次拉一个，最后满血再打{npc:12046}。",
    ["South to the {area:396}, south-east of the village."] = "向南前往村庄东南方的{area:396}。",
    ["South to {area:493}'s flight master (the Alliance's at the southern end of the valley, the Horde's at its south-western end) and fly to {area:2255} for {npc:249235}'s parts order."] = "往南到{area:493}的飞行管理员（联盟的在山谷南端，部落的在山谷西南端），飞往{area:2255}取{npc:249235}订的零件。",
    ["South to {area:609}. {quest:1365} (35) walks among the tents on the east side with a Battle Lord or two (32-33): clear around him, then pull him alone at full health.\nCareful: {quest:1365} is level 35, about two levels over you here, and Kolkar Battle Lords call nearby allies within 30 yd once they fall to 20% health."] = "向南前往{area:609}。{quest:1365}（35 级）在东边的帐篷之间走动，身边有一两个战斗领主（32-33 级）：清掉他周围的怪，再在满血时单独拉他。\n小心：{quest:1365}是 35 级，比你这时大约高两级；科卡尔战斗领主血量掉到 20% 时会呼叫 30 码内的同伴。",
    ["South to {npc:267113}, another wild god, at {area:16868}'s eastern edge."] = "往南到{area:16868}东边缘，找另一位荒野之神{npc:267113}。",
    ["South-east across {area:16866} to {npc:259695}, the wild god, indoors at its south-eastern edge."] = "往东南穿过{area:16866}，找东南边缘室内的荒野之神{npc:259695}。",
    ["South-east back to the Hermit's Abode."] = "往东南回到隐士居所。",
    ["South-east from {area:16726} on the way down to the port: {npc:263440}'s rock piles lie in the hills just south of the town and on the slopes west of the Twilight ogres' camp."] = "从{area:16726}往东南下山去港口的路上：{npc:263440}要的石堆在镇子南边不远的山里，以及暮光食人魔营地西边的山坡上。",
    ["South-east from {area:415}, south of the road: the Foulweald furbolgs live in the woods. The Den Watcher and the Ursas guard the den at its north-west corner.\nCareful: The Den Watcher and the Ursas (24-25) stand together at the den: pull them one at a time."] = "从{area:415}向东南走，在大路南侧的树林里住着污林熊怪。污林卫兵和污林巨熊怪把守着西北角的兽穴。\n小心：污林卫兵和污林巨熊怪（24-25级）在兽穴旁站在一起：每次只拉一只。",
    ["South-east of Smeed's camp, the Magram centaurs camp in the hills. The Scouts and Outrunners (32-33) and the Wranglers (33-34) hold the camp's north-western edge; any centaur can drop an ear for {npc:5395} and a {item:254432} for Gurda. Careful on the way: Scorpashi Venomlashes (38-39) and Dread Rippers (39-40) roam the ground just west of the camp's edge: give them room.\nCareful: the Stormers and Pack Runners (34-35), Marauders and Maulers (35-36) and the Bonepaws (37-38) hold the middle and south of the camp: stay on its north-western edge and pull one at a time."] = "斯米德营地东南，玛格拉姆半人马在山里扎营。斥候和追踪者（32-33 级）以及牧马人（33-34 级）守着营地西北边缘；任何半人马都可能掉落{npc:5395}要的耳朵和古尔达要的{item:254432}。路上小心：斯克帕什毒鞭蝎（38-39 级）和恐怖撕裂者（39-40 级）在营地边缘西边游荡：离它们远点。\n小心：风暴使者和奔行者（34-35 级）、掠夺者和重殴者（35-36 级）以及骨爪（37-38 级）占据营地中部和南部：待在西北边缘，一次拉一个。",
    ["South-east of Tarren Mill. Drull and {npc:2238} are chained in the keep's courtyard buildings, and each lock needs its key: {npc:2427} carries the {item:3467} for Drull's, {npc:2428} the {item:3499} for {npc:2238}'s, both in the keep. Kill them first, then open both locks."] = "在塔伦米尔东南。德鲁尔和{npc:2238}被锁在城堡庭院的建筑里，每把锁都要对应的钥匙：{npc:2427}带着开德鲁尔那把锁的{item:3467}，{npc:2428}带着开{npc:2238}那把锁的{item:3499}，两个都在城堡里。先杀了它们，再打开两把锁。",
    ["South-east of the Foulweald, the {object:669176} lies in the grass: {npc:3961}, in {area:415}'s inn, takes it.\nCareful: two Shadethicket Bark Rippers (26-27) stand within a few steps of it: pull them one at a time before you pick it up."] = "在污林东南方的草丛里躺着{object:669176}：交给{area:415}旅店里的{npc:3961}。\n小心：几步开外站着两只裂木沼泽兽（26-27级）：先逐个引开击杀再拾取。",
    ["South-east to the Galak camp on the plains east of the well; Herak leads them.\nCareful: {npc:275767} is level 11: clear the centaurs around him first and fight him alone."] = "向东南前往水井东边平原上的加拉克营地，赫拉克是它们的首领。\n小心：{npc:275767}是11级：先清掉周围的半人马再和他单挑。",
    ["South-east to the Hermit's Abode with what the wild gods and Omnuron gave you."] = "带着荒野之神和奥姆努隆给你的东西往东南到隐士居所。",
    ["South-east to the Hermit's Abode."] = "往东南去隐士居所。",
    ["South-east to {npc:259695}."] = "往东南找{npc:259695}。",
    ["South-east to {npc:264089} on the slope above {area:16868}."] = "往东南到{area:16868}上方山坡上的{npc:264089}处。",
    ["South-west back towards Barkskin Burrow: the Deadwood camps on the slopes east of the burrow hold the Totemics and Fel-Tenders. An elite named {quest:92446} (level 60) may roam the camps' eastern end."] = "往西南朝树皮熊怪巢穴回去：巢穴东边山坡上的死木营地里有图腾师和邪能看护者。一个叫{quest:92446}的精英（60 级）可能在营地东端游荡。",
    ["South-west down the road to the post: {npc:5641} and {npc:4498} on the rise west of it, {npc:5395} and {npc:5412} side by side in the post."] = "沿大路向西南前往哨站：{npc:5641}和{npc:4498}在哨站西边的高地上，{npc:5395}和{npc:5412}并排站在哨站里。",
    ["South-west from {area:415}: west of {area:421}, the stardust bushes grow among the ruins.\nCareful: Shadethicket Raincallers and Wood Shapers (22–24) stand among the bushes. Clear one bush at a time; don’t run through the camp."] = "从{area:415}向西南走：{area:421}西边的废墟间长着星尘草丛。\n小心：招雨沼泽兽和噬木沼泽兽（22-24级）守在草丛之间。逐丛清理，不要直接穿过营地。",
    ["South-west to {npc:216289}, the ancient. Talk to him again when you are ready and watch what he shows you."] = "往西南去找古树{npc:216289}。准备好后再和他对话，看他给你展示的东西。",
    ["South-west to {npc:263426}, in the middle of {area:16866}: drain him with the eye first, as {npc:263394}, then kill him. Undrained, he is a level 60 elite.\nCareful: Doomguards (elites, 58-59) stand around him: pull him out to you."] = "往西南到{area:16866}中央的{npc:263426}：像{npc:263394}一样先用眼睛吸干他，再杀掉。没吸干的话，他是 60 级精英。\n小心：末日守卫（精英，58-59 级）站在他周围：把他拉出来打。",
    ["Southeast Bonfire"] = "东南篝火",
    ["Speak to {npc:252448} by the inn on the west side, then cross town to {npc:252359} and {npc:259012}."] = "先在西侧旅店旁和{npc:252448}对话，然后穿过城镇去找{npc:252359}和{npc:259012}。",
    ["Stay in the southern half of the strand, where Rackmore's key drops: eight Myrmidons (34-35) walk there among the Naga, Sorceresses and Warriors (32-34).\nCareful: the northern half belongs to the Sea Witches (35-36, casters) and, at its tip, the Tidehunters (36-37): keep south of the middle of the beach."] = "待在海滩南半部分，雷克摩尔的钥匙在那里掉落：那里有八个侍从（34-35 级）在纳迦、女巫和战士（32-34 级）之间走动。\n小心：北半部分属于海巫（35-36 级，施法者），最北端是猎潮者（36-37 级）：保持在海滩中线以南。",
    ["Step into the cave: {npc:11558} stands just inside. She needs Neutral with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there."] = "走进洞穴：{npc:11558}就站在洞口里面。她需要木喉要塞声望达到中立，按声望指南即可达成。",
    ["Step into the cave: {npc:11558} stands just inside. She speaks to you only from Neutral with the Timbermaw."] = "走进洞里：{npc:11558}就站在洞口里面。和木喉要塞达到中立后她才会和你说话。",
    ["Step on the grate to begin the Affray"] = "踩上格栅开始混战",
    ["Still carrying {quest:2741}? The machine stands in the middle of {area:976}."] = "还带着{quest:2741}？机器就在{area:976}中央。",
    ["Still short of Thick Yeti Furs or Uncracked Chillwind Horns? The Rogue Ice Thistles and the Fledgling Chillwinds (both 53-55) live along the road west of {area:2255}, toward {npc:9298}. The hills east of {area:2255} hold only the Ice Thistle Yetis (55-56), Matriarchs and Patriarchs, and the Chillwind Chimaeras (55-57) and Ravagers (57-59): don't hunt the furs and horns there."] = "厚雪人毛皮或完整的冰风奇美拉角还不够？游荡的冰蓟雪人和冰风奇美拉幼兽（均为53-55级）分布在{area:2255}以西通往{npc:9298}的大路沿线。{area:2255}东边的山丘上只有冰蓟雪人（55-56级）、冰蓟雪人女王与冰蓟雪人王，以及冰风奇美拉（55-57级）和冰风破坏者（57-59级）：别去那里刷毛皮和角。",
    ["Still short of level 50 after the refuge's hand-ins? The next guide opens in {zone:1455} with quests that need level 50: top up on the Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers (48-50) of the eastern jungle, where you took the petals, before you leave the crater."] = "在避难营交完任务还不到50级？下一份指南在{zone:1455}开始，需要50级才能接任务：离开环形山之前，先去东边之前采花瓣的丛林里刷血瓣花鞭笞者和血瓣花猛击者（48-50级）补足经验。",
    ["Still short of ten {item:3712}? The Snapjaws line the river just east of {area:272}, a short way from town."] = "还差十个{item:3712}？钳嘴龟就在{area:272}东边的河边，离镇子不远。",
    ["Still under 58 after the second pass through {area:16868}? Abandon {quest:92591}: the route doesn't come back for it."] = "第二次经过{area:16868}后还不到 58 级？放弃{quest:92591}：路线不会再回来做它。",
    ["Still under 58 after the second pass through {area:16868}? Abandon {quest:92592}: the route doesn't come back for it."] = "第二次经过{area:16868}后还不到 58 级？放弃{quest:92592}：路线不会再回来做它。",
    ["Still under level 48.66 after the {area:1443} (a solo player usually is; a group's Culling the Competition or {quest:7701} covers it)? Top up on the Incendosaurs (47) in the {area:1443}'s lava pools, pulled to the edge.\nCareful: {npc:14621} (50, elite) and his elite guards hold the {area:1443}'s depths: keep to the pools near the entrance and don't follow the tunnels in."] = "做完{area:1443}后还不到48.66级（单人玩家通常会差一点；组队做完淘汰竞争者或{quest:7701}就够了）？在{area:1443}的熔岩池边拉47级熏火龙出来补足经验。\n小心：{npc:14621}（50级精英）和他的精英卫兵盘踞在{area:1443}深处：只待在入口附近的岩浆池边，别顺着坑道往里走。",
    ["Still under level 48.98 (a solo player usually is; a group's {quest:3452} covers it)? Top up on the Searing Lava Spiders (47-48) of the western plateaus, away from the {object:147516} camps.\nCareful: Magma Elementals (46-48) drift among the spiders: pull one at a time. Keep south of the Twilight camp at {area:1442}, whose cultists are elites."] = "还不到48.98级（单人玩家通常会差一点；组队做完{quest:3452}就够了）？去西边高地避开{object:147516}营地的位置刷灼热熔岩蜘蛛（47-48级）补足经验。\n小心：蜘蛛群中游荡着熔岩元素（46-48级），每次只拉一只。保持在{area:1442}暮光营地以南，那里的教徒都是精英。",
    ["Stranglethorn Tigers (32) roam the hills west of the camp and east of it toward the lake: the arrow takes the eastern ones, on your way to the geologists. Panthers (32) roam the clearings west and south-west of the camp. The Venture Co. Geologists (34-36), who carry the Tumbled Crystals, work the camps by {area:37}, south-east of the camp. Careful: Venture Co. Agents (39) stand among the geologists in the western camps by the Venture Co. house: work the eastern camps, away from them."] = "荆棘谷猛虎（32 级）在营地西边的山里游荡，东边往湖那边也有：箭头会带你打东边的，顺路去找地质学家。黑豹（32 级）在营地西边和西南的空地上游荡。风险投资公司地质学家（34-36 级）身上带着翻滚的水晶，在营地东南{area:37}旁的营地里干活。小心：风险投资公司特工（39 级）站在西边风险投资公司房子附近的地质学家之间：去东边的营地打，离他们远点。",
    ["Stranglethorn's errands are done: from {object:3202}'s flight master, fly on to {area:75} for the swamp's coast and {area:1978}, which fit you now."] = "荆棘谷的任务做完了：从{object:3202}的飞行管理员飞往{area:75}，沼泽海岸和{area:1978}现在适合你。",
    ["Sully Balloo's letter, from the {area:880}: {npc:2695} takes it here in {zone:1455}."] = "来自{area:880}的苏利·巴鲁的信：在这里的{zone:1455}交给{npc:2695}。",
    ["Sweetberries"] = "甜浆果",
    ["Taiga's {item:14547}, {npc:12340}'s {quest:6143} (unless you did it on the strand) and {zone:1443}'s other 37-40 quests wait for the second visit, at about 37: the next guides fly to {zone:1454} and take the zeppelin to {zone:1434}."] = "泰加的{item:14547}、{npc:12340}的{quest:6143}（除非你在海滩上做完了）以及{zone:1443}其他 37-40 级任务留到第二次来时再做，约 37 级：接下来的指南会飞到{zone:1454}，再坐飞艇去{zone:1434}。",
    ["Take Five Bases."] = "攻占五座基地。",
    ["Take Silverwing Outpost."] = "攻占银翼哨站。",
    ["Take Tervosh's next errand now: he stands here only right after the hand-in. {npc:4966} waits for the next {zone:1445} visit, at about 39."] = "现在就接大法师特沃什的后续任务：他只在刚交完任务时站在这里。{npc:4966}等大约39级再来{zone:1445}时再做。",
    ["Take her message to {npc:3916} on the way east"] = "向东走时顺路把她的口信带给{npc:3916}",
    ["Take the boat to Theramore: {zone:2482}, the next guide, starts with the flight to {area:2255}."] = "乘船前往塞拉摩：下一份{zone:2482}指南从飞往{area:2255}开始。",
    ["Take the boat to the mainland: {npc:14637} waits on the dock where it lands."] = "乘船返回大陆：{npc:14637}就在下船的码头上等候。",
    ["Take the bounty from the board only if you want to hunt the linked dwarf packs with a group."] = "只有打算组队清理成群联动的矮人怪时，才从布告栏接这个悬赏任务。",
    ["Take the kitten back to the Jadefire moonwell and release it there with {item:12565}; once it has turned into a {npc:10042}, bring it back to {npc:9996} and click on it to hand it over."] = "把小猫带回玉火月亮井，在那里用{item:12565}放了它；它变成{npc:10042}后，把它带回{npc:9996}那里，点击它交给她。",
    ["Take the pass out of {area:340}'s west side into the {zone:1427} and ride west to {npc:8479}, on the rim of the Cauldron south of {area:1446}."] = "从{area:340}西侧的山口进入{zone:1427}，然后向西骑到{area:1446}南边大锅边缘的{npc:8479}处。",
    ["Take the portal down from {zone:1457} to the hippogryphs."] = "穿过{zone:1457}的传送门下去找角鹰兽管理员。",
    ["Take the portal down to the hippogryphs at {area:702}."] = "穿过传送门下去找{area:702}的角鹰兽管理员。",
    ["Take the {item:286647} to an {npc:264149} on the road north of the temple and throw it into the rift. The {npc:276401} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "把{item:286647}带到神殿北边路上的{npc:264149}那里，扔进裂隙。{npc:276401}是精英：建议组队。",
    ["Take the {item:286647} to an {npc:264149} on the road north of the temple and throw it into the rift. The {npc:276401} that comes out is an elite (level 43) but it comes alone: most players in our recordings killed it without a group, from level 41 up."] = "把{item:286647}带到神殿北边路上的{npc:264149}处并投入裂隙。钻出来的{npc:276401}是43级精英，但只有一只：我们记录中的大多数玩家从41级起就能单杀它。",
    ["Taragaman the Hungerer's Heart"] = "饥饿者塔拉加曼的心脏",
    ["Temple pylon found"] = "已找到神殿的水晶塔",
    ["Test the Staff of the Mountain"] = "测试山岳之杖",
    ["The Ashen Acolytes hold the camp at the north of the scar. Not every Acolyte carries notes: keep killing them after the twelve kills until you have all twelve notes.\nCareful: Awakened Fel Ash Slimes (58, elite) ooze about the scar: pull the Acolytes away from them."] = "灰烬侍僧占据着伤疤北边的营地。不是每个侍僧都带着笔记：杀满十二个之后继续杀，直到拿齐十二份笔记。\n小心：苏醒的邪能灰烬软泥怪（58 级，精英）在伤疤里蠕动：把侍僧从它们身边拉开。",
    ["The Ashen camp"] = "灰烬营地",
    ["The Ashen workstations"] = "灰烬工作台",
    ["The Berserk Owlbeasts (58-59) roam the slopes of {area:2241}, north of {area:2255} and west of the furbolg valley. Now and then an owlbeast drops a {item:12558}: use it to start {quest:4882}."] = "狂暴枭兽（58-59 级）在{area:2255}北边、熊怪山谷西边的{area:2241}山坡上游荡。枭兽偶尔会掉{item:12558}：用它开始{quest:4882}。",
    ["The Blackthorne camps"] = "黑棘营地",
    ["The Blackthorne cultists camp on the slopes north-east of the Summit (level 60, with elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier among them: pull carefully). {npc:260674}, an elite (level 60) who leads them, stands among them: leave him be. Ghansurok, an elite chimaera (level 61), also roams the ridge north of the camps.\nThe Cultists carry the kris and the Adepts the staff; the thorn seeds lie in the woods there, and the hippogryphs and chimaeras roam the slopes all around. Not finished in our recordings yet: if something here is off, tell us."] = "黑棘教徒在峰顶东北的山坡上扎营（60 级，其中夹着精英斥候、牧师和一名信使：小心拉怪）。他们的首领{npc:260674}是精英（60 级），站在他们之中：别碰他。精英奇美拉甘苏洛克（61 级）也在营地北边的山脊上游荡。\n教徒带着波刃短剑，学徒带着法杖；荆棘种子在那里的树林里，角鹰兽和奇美拉在周围的山坡上游荡。我们的录像还没做完这部分：如果这里有不对的地方，请告诉我们。",
    ["The Blackthorne cultists camp on the slopes north-east of the Summit (level 60, with elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier among them: pull carefully). {npc:260674}, an elite (level 60) who leads them, stands among them: leave him be. Ghansurok, an elite chimaera (level 61), also roams the ridge north of the camps.\nUse {npc:40833}'s staff on a Pact member to strip its ward, then kill it, ten times: pick Cultists and Adepts, whom Thisalee wants dead too. The Cultists carry the kris and the Adepts the staff; the thorn seeds lie in the woods there, and the hippogryphs and chimaeras roam the slopes all around. Not finished in our recordings yet: if something here is off, tell us."] = "黑棘教徒在峰顶东北的山坡上扎营（60 级，其中夹着精英斥候、牧师和一名信使：小心拉怪）。他们的首领{npc:260674}是精英（60 级），站在他们之中：别碰他。精英奇美拉甘苏洛克（61 级）也在营地北边的山脊上游荡。\n对盟约成员使用{npc:40833}的法杖剥掉它的护盾，然后杀掉它，共十次：挑教徒和学徒打，西萨莉也要它们的命。教徒带着波刃短剑，学徒带着法杖；荆棘种子在那里的树林里，角鹰兽和奇美拉在周围的山坡上游荡。我们的录像还没做完这部分：如果这里有不对的地方，请告诉我们。",
    ["The Bluegill Raiders (28-29) on the beach south-west of Menethil carry the ingots."] = "米奈希尔港西南海滩上的蓝腮袭击者（28-29级）携带着铁锭。",
    ["The Chillwind horns come on the next guide's {zone:1452} loop: keep it"] = "冰风奇美拉角会在下一份指南的{zone:1452}路线中收集：先留着任务",
    ["The Crow is just south of the pristine crystal."] = "乌鸦就在纯净水晶的南边。",
    ["The Deadwood camps"] = "死木营地",
    ["The Deadwood camps fill {area:17144}, a sunken valley whose northern end runs in under the cliffs: there is no way down into it from {area:16868}. Go round to the valley's mouth in the south-east and follow it west, then north up into the camps, as players do."] = "死木营地布满了{area:17144}——这是一条北端深入悬崖下方的低洼山谷，无法从{area:16868}直接下去。像其他玩家一样绕到东南方的谷口，先向西再向北进入营地。",
    ["The Deadwood cauldron in {area:1762}, at the {zone:1448} end of the tunnel"] = "隧道{zone:1448}一侧{area:1762}里的死木蒸锅",
    ["The Deadwood cauldron stands at the top of {area:1762}, just west of the cave mouth."] = "死木蒸锅位于{area:1762}顶端，就在洞口西边。",
    ["The Deadwood furbolgs camp on the slopes north and east of {npc:256978}: kill their Den Guardians."] = "死木熊怪在{npc:256978}北边和东边的山坡上扎营：杀掉它们的巢穴守护者。",
    ["The Deadwood furbolgs live in the village just south-west of {npc:11554}; keep the Deadwood Headdress Feathers they drop: {npc:11554} and {npc:15395} each take five."] = "死木熊怪住在{npc:11554}西南方的村子里；留着它们掉落的死木头饰羽毛：{npc:11554}和{npc:15395}各收五根。",
    ["The Deadwood furbolgs of {area:1762} fill the hills west of the cave.\nCareful: Den Watchers are level 53-54 and the Avengers 54-55; they call nearby allies within 25 yd once below 50% health and run off for help below 15%."] = "{area:1762}的死木熊怪遍布洞穴西边的山丘。\n小心：死木守卫为53-54级，死木复仇者为54-55级；它们血量低于50%时会呼叫25码内的盟友，低于15%时会逃跑求援。",
    ["The Deadwood totem from {area:1762}, if you are Neutral with the Timbermaw now (the {area:1769} reputation guide gets you there): {npc:11558} waits at the tunnel mouth of {area:1769}."] = "来自{area:1762}的死木图腾，如果你现在和木喉要塞是中立（{area:1769}声望指南可以帮你达到）：{npc:11558}在{area:1769}的隧道口等着。",
    ["The Diseased Grizzlies (55-56) roam the woods around the {area:202}, east and north of {npc:10739}."] = "生病的灰熊（55-56级）在{npc:10739}东面和北面、{area:202}周围的树林里游荡。",
    ["The Elder Crag Coyotes and Giant Buzzards roam the basin south of the {area:1878}. Coyotes drop both the jawbones and the fangs; the Giant Buzzards drop the gizzards. Careful: Malevolent Mirages (42, elite) drift across the {zone:1418}: give them a wide berth.\nCareful: the Giant Buzzards are 39-41, and the 41s are two over you at 39: pick the 39s and 40s and pull them one at a time. The Buzzards (37) you kill later for {npc:2817}'s wings drop gizzards too, more rarely.\nCareful: Zaricotl (55, a rare buzzard) circles over the {zone:1418} too: if you see him, keep away."] = "老年峭壁土狼和巨型秃鹫在{area:1878}南边的盆地里游荡。土狼会掉颚骨和尖牙，巨型秃鹫掉砂囊。小心：恶毒幻象（42 级，精英）在{zone:1418}上飘荡：离它们远远的。\n小心：巨型秃鹫是 39-41 级，你 39 级时 41 级的比你高两级：挑 39 和 40 级的，一次拉一个。之后为{npc:2817}的翅膀打的秃鹫（37 级）也会掉砂囊，只是几率更低。\n小心：扎里科特（55 级，稀有秃鹫）也在{zone:1418}上空盘旋：看到它就躲远点。",
    ["The Firegut ogres hold the great rock north of the Vigil, with the Brutes on its east side.\nCareful: the Firegut Ogres are 50 and the Ogre Mages 51, but the Brutes on the rock's east side are 52: take the ogres on the near side first and pull the Brutes one at a time.\nCareful: Escaped Core Hounds (level 60) roam the Steppes, a few on the slopes west and south of {area:249}: pull the ogres on the rock itself and look around before each pull.\nCareful: the Firegut chiefs {npc:9602} and {npc:9604} (54) stand on the rock's east side among the Brutes: leave them be."] = "火腹食人魔盘踞在摩根的岗哨北边的大岩石上，火腹蛮兵在岩石东侧。\n小心：火腹食人魔50级，火腹食人魔法师51级，但岩石东侧的火腹蛮兵有52级：先打近处的食人魔，再逐个拉火腹蛮兵。\n小心：60级的逃脱的熔火恶犬在燃烧平原游荡，有几只在{area:249}西侧和南侧的山坡上：在岩石上打食人魔，每次拉怪前先环顾四周。\n小心：火腹首领{npc:9602}和{npc:9604}（54级）混在岩石东侧的火腹蛮兵中：别惹它们。",
    ["The Forsaken's camp lies in the woods south of {area:2358}.\nRotting Slimes in and around the Barrow Den leave a {object:19021} when they die: open the chests until one holds the pommel.\nCareful: Non-elite Forsaken of about level 28-30 guard the camp. Some of them are stealthed, and the ones around the table often aggro together."] = "被遗忘者营地位于{area:2358}南边的树林里。\n兽穴内外腐烂的泥浆怪死后会留下{object:19021}：逐个打开箱子，直到开出剑柄。\n小心：营地由约28-30级的非精英被遗忘者守卫。其中一些处于潜行状态，围在桌子旁的往往会一起引到。",
    ["The Hyjal Owls roost on the slopes between {npc:264089} and Barkskin Burrow: their feathers are for {area:16848}.\nCareful: Death Wailers (61, rare elites) drift over the western slopes: give them a wide berth.\nCareful: Grimroot, an elite treant (level 60), walks the slopes beside {npc:264089}. He leaves you alone unless you hit him: don't, and pull the owls away from his path."] = "海加尔猫头鹰栖息在{npc:264089}和树皮熊怪巢穴之间的山坡上：它们的羽毛交给{area:16848}。\n小心：死亡哀嚎者（61 级，稀有精英）在西边的山坡上飘荡：离它们远远的。\n小心：精英树人格林鲁特（60 级）在{npc:264089}旁边的山坡上走动。你不打他，他就不会理你：别打，把猫头鹰从他的路线上拉开。",
    ["The Ice Thistle yetis (53-57) in the hills east of {area:2255} carry the {item:258323}: take it from the ones at the edge of the hills."] = "{area:2255}东边山丘上的冰蓟雪人（53-57级）带着{item:258323}：打山丘边缘的雪人即可拿到。",
    ["The Land Walkers and Cliff Giants roam the hills north of the dock. Zap each one with {item:18904} first: shrunken, they are no longer elite. Every zapped giant drops residue; use the Muisek Vessel on its body too.\nThe Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the shore have the last cores."] = "大地行者和悬崖巨人在码头北边的山里游荡。先用{item:18904}电击每一个：缩小后它们就不再是精英。每个被电击的巨人都会掉残渣，也对它的尸体使用穆伊塞克容器。\n岸边的海元素和海浪有最后的核心。",
    ["The Legashi satyrs (51-52) hold the hills north of the blood elves' camp: {npc:235903} wants five of each kind.\nCareful: {npc:235892} (55, elite) stands among the satyrs at the north-east end of their hills, around 67,19: take the satyrs nearer the camp and leave him be."] = "雷加什萨特（51-52 级）占据着血精灵营地北边的山：{npc:235903}每种要五个。\n小心：{npc:235892}（55 级，精英）站在萨特山东北端约 67,19 处的萨特之间：打靠近营地的萨特，别碰他。",
    ["The Moonstalkers (14-15) roam the hills of the loop ahead, south of {area:442} and around the {area:456} at its end: any of them drops the fangs. Leave the Moonstalker Sires (17-18) and Matriarchs (19-20) south of the Grove."] = "月夜猛虎（14-15级）在前方环形路线的山丘上、{area:442}以南以及路线尽头的{area:456}周围游荡：它们都会掉落牙齿。避开林地以南的月夜雄虎（17-18级）和月夜雌虎（19-20级）。",
    ["The Noxious Slimes crawl all over the scar's southern half, and not every one leaves ooze: kill the ones you pass from here on.\nCareful: Awakened Fel Ash Slimes (elites, 58) ooze among the slimes: leave them be."] = "剧毒软泥怪遍布伤疤的南半部分，不是每只都会留下软泥：从这里开始，路过的都杀掉。\n小心：苏醒的邪能灰烬软泥怪（58 级精英）在软泥怪之间蠕动：别碰它们。",
    ["The Peasants work the fields south of the farmhouses.\nCareful: A fleeing peasant that reaches the town hall can bring back many adds, including {area:287} footmen; snares, roots or similar effects keep them from escaping. Kirin Tor Guards (55) stand north of the farms, on the road up toward Alterac: keep to the fields."] = "农夫在农舍南边的田里干活。\n小心：逃跑的农夫要是跑到市政厅，会带回很多援兵，包括{area:287}步兵；减速、定身之类的效果可以阻止他们逃跑。肯瑞托卫兵（55 级）站在农场北边通往奥特兰克的路上：待在田里别过去。",
    ["The Predatory Hyjal Stags roam the same meadows, east of {npc:255693}.\nCareful: Spectral Frostwyrms (61, elites) circle over the western meadows: keep out from under them."] = "掠食性海加尔雄鹿在同一片草地上游荡，在{npc:255693}东边。\n小心：幽灵冰霜巨龙（61 级，精英）在西边的草地上空盘旋：别待在它们下方。",
    ["The Pridewings"] = "巨翼双足飞龙",
    ["The Redemption of Eranikus"] = "伊兰尼库斯的救赎",
    ["The Rustleaf Foxes are thick in the woods around {npc:249234}'s camp.\nCareful: {npc:255183} (61, rare) walks the woods north of the camp, and a {npc:256830} (60, rare) can turn up there too: leave them be."] = "锈叶狐在{npc:249234}营地周围的树林里很多。\n小心：{npc:255183}（61 级，稀有）在营地北边的树林里走动，{npc:256830}（60 级，稀有）也可能在那里出现：别碰它们。",
    ["The Saltseer pirates hold his ground: Murderers, Manhunters, Cultists and Coroners, and any of them can drop an artifact. The third tablet is among them, before you reach the captain. After he dies, disrupt the barrier a second time."] = "盐视海盗占据着他的地盘：谋杀者、猎人者、教徒和验尸官，任何一个都可能掉落神器。第三块石板在他们之中，在你到达船长之前。他死后，第二次扰乱屏障。",
    ["The Saltspittle murlocs around Teronis at {area:441} drop the {item:5463}."] = "{area:441}泰洛尼斯周围的盐沫鱼人会掉落{item:5463}。",
    ["The Sawtooth Snappers (41-42) line the strand south of the post; nearly every one drops a claw. Leave the murlocs further along the shore for your next swamp visit.\nCareful: a {npc:272377} (level 60) walks the south-east strand: give it a wide berth."] = "锯齿钳嘴龟（41-42 级）分布在哨站南边的海滩上，几乎每只都会掉爪子。沿岸更远处的鱼人留到下次来沼泽时再打。\n小心：一只{npc:272377}（60 级）在东南的海滩上走动：离它远远的。",
    ["The Scourge hold the ruins of {area:16868}, east of {area:16848}: Fleshflay Raveners and Forgotten Soldiers everywhere, Eternal Sentries among them.\nCareful: Death Wailers (61, rare elites) drift over {area:16868}: keep out of their way.\nCareful: Grimroot, the elite treant (level 60), walks the slopes on the way in. He leaves you alone unless you hit him: give him room."] = "天灾军团占据着{area:16848}东边{area:16868}的废墟：到处都是剥皮掠食者和被遗忘的士兵，其中还有永恒哨兵。\n小心：死亡哀嚎者（61 级，稀有精英）在{area:16868}上空飘荡：别挡它们的路。\n小心：精英树人格林鲁特（60 级）在进去的山坡上走动。你不打他，他就不会理你：离他远点。",
    ["The Sea Sprays (46-47) wash along the shore just south of the dock: they drop the Water Elemental Cores as well as the Sea Elementals (47) do. The Wave and Deep Striders (47) wade in the water off the same beach: zap them with {item:18904} first, and shrunken they lose their elite strength.\nThe Ultra-Shrinker lasts two hours: hand both quests back to {npc:14637} before you leave the coast."] = "巨型海元素（46-47级）在码头正南方的海岸边游荡：它们和海元素（47级）一样都会掉落水元素核心。波涛巨人和深海巨人（47级）就在同一片海滩的浅水区里：先用{item:18904}缩小它们，变小后就会失去精英实力。\n索尔宾的超级压缩器只持续两小时：离开海岸前记得把两个任务都交还给{npc:14637}。",
    ["The Sea Sprays (46-48) wash along the shore just south of the dock and drop the Water Elemental Cores, as the Sea Elementals (47-49) do. The Wave and Deep Striders (47-49) wade in the water off the same beach: zap them with {item:18904} first, and shrunken they lose their elite strength.\nThe Ultra-Shrinker lasts two hours: {npc:14637} has a second round once these are done."] = "海浪（46-48 级）在码头南边的岸边冲刷，和海元素（47-49 级）一样会掉水元素核心。浪行者和深渊行者（47-49 级）在同一片海滩外的水里涉行：先用{item:18904}电击它们，缩小后就失去精英实力。\n超级缩小器持续两小时：这些做完后{npc:14637}还有第二轮。",
    ["The Shadowforge dwarves camp just north of the digsite; the crumpled map and {npc:269577}'s mining helmet lie among their tents. Tunnelers and Darkweavers carry Ryedol's pick and {npc:269577}'s artifacts. Crag Coyotes roam the slopes around it. Careful: Shadowforge Ruffians (36-37, elite) walk among them, most on the slopes between the pass and the camp: pull the Tunnelers and Darkweavers away from them."] = "暗炉矮人扎营在挖掘场正北方；揉皱的地图和{npc:269577}的采矿头盔就在它们的帐篷之间。暗炉隧道工和暗炉巫师带着雷杜尔的好运锄和{npc:269577}的文物。峭壁山狗在周围的山坡上游荡。小心：暗炉恶棍（36-37级精英）混在它们中间，大多在山口与营地之间的山坡上：把暗炉隧道工和暗炉巫师拉离它们再打。",
    ["The Spitelash naga of the {area:1221} carry {item:13815}. Tymor's runes stand among the ruins: use his {item:10445} on each."] = "{area:1221}的恶鞭纳迦身上带着{item:13815}。泰摩尔要拓印的符文分布在废墟间：对每一处使用他的{item:10445}。",
    ["The Spitelash naga of these ruins drop Truesong's Eldarath Relics. {npc:239939} (52) stands in the ruins of Eldarath, south-west of the Myrmidons: pull him alone."] = "这片废墟里的恶鞭纳迦会掉落真歌要的埃达拉斯圣物。{npc:239939}（52级）在埃达拉斯废墟中恶鞭侍从西南方：单独把他拉出来打。",
    ["The Steamsmiths at the furnaces carry the {item:18959}; the Lookouts on the southern ridges carry the Spyglass. Keep the {item:11818} if a dwarf drops it."] = "熔炉旁的黑铁锻造师身上带着{item:18959}；南部山脊上的黑铁哨兵带着望远镜。如果有矮人掉落{item:11818}，记得留着。",
    ["The Stranglethorn & Swamp guide already finished {quest:698}' first part and the {quest:1424} with you; its {quest:1430} and {npc:5593}'s murlocs are in your log. Starting here: {npc:5591} stands inside {area:75}'s great hall and {npc:1443} on its top floor."] = "荆棘谷与沼泽指南已经和你一起完成了{quest:698}的第一部分和{quest:1424}；它的{quest:1430}和{npc:5593}的鱼人任务在你的日志里。从这里开始的话：{npc:5591}站在{area:75}的大厅里，{npc:1443}在顶楼。",
    ["The Summit's Blackthorne quests"] = "峰顶的黑棘任务",
    ["The Twilight elites of {npc:8436}'s camp drop the {quest:3378} page, about one in five: keep the group together here until one drops."] = "{npc:8436}营地的暮光精英会掉落{quest:3378}书页，掉率约五分之一：队伍先别散，打到掉落为止。",
    ["The Twilight's Hammer cultists camp in the hills west of {npc:8479}. The {item:10552} drops from their Dark Shamans (47-48), Fire Guards (48-49) and Geomancers (49-50): elites, but two to five levels under you now, so one at a time is fine. The Idolaters (49-51) at the altar further north drop it too, more rarely: leave them alone."] = "暮光之锤教徒在{npc:8479}西边的山里扎营。{item:10552}由他们的黑暗萨满（47-48 级）、火焰卫兵（48-49 级）和地卜师（49-50 级）掉落：都是精英，但这时比你低二到五级，一次一个没问题。更北边祭坛的偶像崇拜者（49-51 级）也会掉，几率更低：别碰它们。",
    ["The Twilight's Hammer dig fills the north-west corner: tablet fragments lie on the ground and the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers carry them too. Every cultist can drop an {item:20404}: keep twenty, ten for {npc:15306} and ten for {npc:15194} later.\nCareful: take the texts from the Twilight Avengers and Geolords; leave the Twilight Flamereavers (60) and stay out of the hive's mouth, where the {area:2742} elites (59-60) wait.\nThe {area:2742} silithids sometimes drop {quest:8308}: keep it for Bronzebeard's Encampment in the south."] = "暮光之锤的挖掘场占据着西北角：石板碎片散落在地上，灰尘风暴和沙漠奔行者身上也会掉落。所有暮光教徒都能掉落{item:20404}：留足二十份，十份给{npc:15306}，另十份稍后给{npc:15194}。\n小心：从暮光复仇者和暮光地王身上刷密文信；避开60级的暮光烈焰掠夺者，别靠近虫巢洞口，那里守着59-60级的{area:2742}精英。\n{area:2742}的异种虫有时会掉落{quest:8308}：留着交给南边的铜须营地。",
    ["The WANTED poster by the inn"] = "旅店旁的通缉令",
    ["The WANTED poster: {npc:3467} comes on the next {area:392} stop too"] = "通缉令：{npc:3467}也是下次来{area:392}时再接",
    ["The War of the Shifting Sands"] = "流沙之战",
    ["The Wormwing harpies nest on the slopes north-west of the shrine. They drop the pinfeathers and {npc:256660}'s amulets; the bangles lie in their nests, the {object:650219} in a nest on the western slope, and {npc:260826}, who has Omnuron's spear, is among them. The corrupted knots grow on the trees just north-west of the shrine."] = "蠕翼鹰身人在神龛西北的山坡上筑巢。它们会掉针羽和{npc:256660}要的护符；手镯在它们的巢里，{object:650219}在西坡的一个巢里，拿着奥姆努隆长矛的{npc:260826}也在它们之中。被腐化的树结长在神龛西北不远的树上。",
    ["The agents' remains lie at the {area:2260} in the {zone:1423}, on this guide's ride east"] = "特工遗骸位于{zone:1423}的{area:2260}，就在本指南向东骑行的路线上",
    ["The ancients' outpost"] = "古树前哨",
    ["The bandits and thieves camp in the dunes east of {area:976}. Every Wastewander can carry a water pouch: Luglunket wants five, and Bilgewhizzle five more.\nCareful: Wastewander Rogues (level 43-44) move stealthed, so they can approach unseen."] = "强盗和小偷在{area:976}东边的沙丘里扎营。每个荒野游荡者都可能带着水袋：卢格伦克要五个，比格维兹尔还要五个。\n小心：荒野游荡者盗贼（43-44 级）潜行移动，可能悄无声息地靠近。",
    ["The bear berries grow on the slopes around the burrow: a few on the hill north of {npc:256978}, most of them east of the burrow.\nCareful: Grimroot, an elite treant (level 60), walks the slopes west of the burrow, around 16-20,58-66: give him room."] = "熊莓长在巢穴周围的山坡上：{npc:256978}北边的山上有几株，大多在巢穴东边。\n小心：精英树人格林鲁特（60 级）在巢穴西边约 16-20,58-66 的山坡上走动：离他远点。",
    ["The boat lands in {area:442}: fly straight on to {area:415}. Erelas, Jenal and Gracina take their deliveries on the {zone:1448} guide's {zone:1457} stop, which goes there anyway."] = "船在{area:442}靠岸：直接飞往{area:415}。艾瑞拉斯、耶纳尔和格拉希娜的包裹等{zone:1448}指南途经{zone:1457}时顺路再交。",
    ["The boat to {area:35} leaves from {area:392}'s dock, below the flight master. Without the {area:392} flight path: follow the road west out of the marsh into the {zone:1413} and north up the coast to {area:392}, and learn it there."] = "开往{area:35}的船从飞行管理员下方的{area:392}码头出发。如果还没开{area:392}的飞行点：沿大路向西走出沼泽进入{zone:1413}，再沿海岸向北到{area:392}并开启飞行点。",
    ["The bone pile"] = "骨堆",
    ["The bone pile wakes the {npc:264306}, an elite (level 58) that hits hard: grouping up is advised."] = "骨堆会唤醒{npc:264306}，一个打人很痛的精英（58 级）：建议组队。",
    ["The burnt buildings"] = "烧毁的建筑",
    ["The burnt buildings stand in the meadows east of {npc:255693}: the nails and brackets lie among the rubble."] = "烧毁的建筑在{npc:255693}东边的草地上：钉子和支架散落在废墟里。",
    ["The cauldron is at {area:200}"] = "大锅就在{area:200}",
    ["The cauldron sits at the {area:202}, by {npc:10739}' farm, east of Andorhal."] = "大锅位于安多哈尔东边、{npc:10739}农场旁的{area:202}。",
    ["The chimaeras roam the snowfields south and west of {area:2255}. Careful: Chillwind Chimaeras are 55-57: take only the 55s, and the Fledgling Chillwinds (53-55) by {area:2251}, which carry the horns too. Stay clear of {area:2245}'s cave: its blue dragonkin are elite."] = "奇美拉在{area:2255}南边和西边的雪原上游荡。小心：寒风奇美拉是 55-57 级：只打 55 级的，以及{area:2251}旁的幼年寒风奇美拉（53-55 级），它们也带着角。离{area:2245}的洞远点：里面的蓝龙人是精英。",
    ["The cog lies by the path south-west of the camp, on your way to {npc:256222}."] = "齿轮在营地西南的小路旁，在你去{npc:256222}的路上。",
    ["The crystals gathered at {area:37}"] = "在{area:37}收集的水晶",
    ["The crystals grow in the scar west and south of {npc:263757}. The pristine one turned up at the scar's southern end, close to the {npc:257753}, at the spot marked."] = "水晶长在{npc:263757}西边和南边的伤疤里。纯净的那块出现在伤疤南端，靠近{npc:257753}，在标记的位置。",
    ["The cult's camps fill the valley south and west of {npc:258570}. Twilight Champions drop the {item:265821} that frees a captive {npc:257450}: free them as you find them. Twilight Enforcers (elites, level 45) patrol through the camps: watch where they walk before each pull. {npc:256881} and {npc:256891} (elites, 46) hold the fortress at the valley's head: pull the cultists away from them. {npc:258023}'s Alliance camp sits at the valley's south end, and its Farholde Lookouts (level 46) attack the Horde: stay north of it."] = "教派的营地遍布{npc:258570}南边和西边的山谷。暮光勇士会掉落{item:265821}，可以释放被俘的{npc:257450}：遇到就放了他们。暮光执法者（精英，45 级）在营地之间巡逻：每次拉怪前看好它们的路线。{npc:256881}和{npc:256891}（精英，46 级）守着山谷尽头的要塞：把教徒拉离他们身边。{npc:258023}的联盟营地在山谷南端，远城守望者（46 级）会攻击部落：待在营地北边。",
    ["The drop to the ledge"] = "跳到岩架",
    ["The faerie dragons flit around the woods just west of the camp. Use the vessel on each one you kill; they carry the {item:9589} too."] = "精灵龙在营地西边的树林里飞来飞去。对你杀的每一只使用容器，它们也带着{item:9589}。",
    ["The falls and the first kitten"] = "瀑布与第一只小猫",
    ["The flight lands at {area:541}: {npc:8737} stands by the cave a few steps from the flight master, {npc:9117} inside it."] = "飞行在{area:541}降落：{npc:8737}站在离飞行管理员几步远的山洞旁，{npc:9117}在洞里。",
    ["The flight lands at {object:3202}. Stranglethorn's harder errands, carried from your first visit, fit you now: the Skullsplitter chief, Zanzil's camps, {area:35}'s pirates, the naga coast and {npc:1514}, before the {zone:1435} and the {zone:1458}. The {object:2076} beside Nimboya has the Skullsplitter chief's quest."] = "飞行在{object:3202}降落。你第一次来时带过来的荆棘谷较难任务现在适合你了：碎颅者酋长、赞吉尔的营地、{area:35}的海盗、纳迦海岸和{npc:1514}，然后再去{zone:1435}和{zone:1458}。宁博亚旁边的{object:2076}有碎颅者酋长的任务。",
    ["The flight lands at {object:3202}: {npc:2519} and {npc:2465}, then back to the flight master."] = "飞行在{object:3202}降落：先找{npc:2519}和{npc:2465}，然后回飞行管理员。",
    ["The flight lands in {area:2255}: {npc:11754} and Umi stand around the town before you ride west."] = "航班降落在{area:2255}：向西出发前，{npc:11754}和乌米就在镇上。",
    ["The flight lands in {area:976}."] = "航班降落在{area:976}。",
    ["The furbolg village fills the valley north-east of {area:2255}. Kill Shamans first; they heal. {quest:5121} (59, elite) and Xandivious (62) are in the cave at the back: stay out."] = "熊怪村落占满了{area:2255}东北的山谷。先杀萨满，他们会治疗。{quest:5121}（59 级，精英）和赞迪维厄斯（62 级）在后面的洞里：别进去。",
    ["The furnaces and southern ridges"] = "熔炉与南部山脊",
    ["The glowing tablet fragments lie on the ground around the Twilight camp in the far north-west: pick them up. The Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers there may carry them too. Careful: the biggest Rumblers and the Whirling Invaders are 58: pull them one at a time."] = "发光的石板碎片散落在极西北暮光营地周围的地上：捡起来。那里的尘暴者和沙漠隆隆者身上也可能带着。小心：最大的隆隆者和旋风入侵者是 58 级：一次拉一个。",
    ["The goblins work the hills north-east of the well, around the mine's mouth: the Workers and Supervisors outside are all {quest:764} needs. Prairie Wolf Alphas roam among the wolves on the plains on the way.\nCareful: stay out of the mine itself, where the goblins stand close together and {npc:3051} is level 12."] = "地精在水井东北方、矿洞口周围的山丘上干活：{quest:764}只需杀洞外的工人和监工就够了。路上平原的狼群中混有草原狼前锋。\n小心：别进矿洞内部，里面的地精站得很密，而且{npc:3051}有12级。",
    ["The gorillas on {area:1943} carry the pelts: keep it for the second Un'Goro visit, around 54"] = "{area:1943}的大猩猩会掉落毛皮：留着等大约54级第二次来安戈洛环形山时再做",
    ["The gorillas roam the valley around Unbagwa. The elders drop the giblets; any of them can drop a fang: if you will take {quest:348} with a group, keep ten for Unbagwa, whose Mokk (44) waits for your Stranglethorn stop at about 45.\nCareful: the Elder Mistvale Gorillas (40-41) stand close together in the valley: pull one at a time."] = "大猩猩在安巴瓦附近的山谷里游荡。老年大猩猩掉内脏；任何大猩猩都可能掉獠牙：如果你要组队做{quest:348}，留十颗给安巴瓦，他的莫克（44 级）在你约 45 级来荆棘谷时等着。\n小心：老年雾谷大猩猩（40-41 级）在山谷里挨得很近：一次拉一个。",
    ["The harpy grounds"] = "鹰身人营地",
    ["The hippogryphs nest on the hills south-west of the camp. Kill one, then use the Muisek Vessel on its body. Nearly every one also drops the sinew and metallic fragments for {quest:3128}."] = "角鹰兽在营地西南的山上筑巢。杀一只，然后对它的尸体使用穆伊塞克容器。几乎每只都会掉{quest:3128}要的筋和金属碎片。",
    ["The hunters also drop {npc:737}'s tusks and {npc:2519}'s necklaces. Collect any you still need during the cauldron hunt."] = "这些猎手也会掉{npc:737}要的獠牙和{npc:2519}要的项链。打大锅附近的怪时顺便收集你还缺的。",
    ["The last boss. The fourth tablet is near him, and its rubbing still counts after he dies."] = "最后一个首领。第四块石板在他附近，他死后拓片仍然算数。",
    ["The last kitten, {npc:255771}, plays at the southern end of {area:16868}."] = "最后一只小猫{npc:255771}在{area:16868}南端玩耍。",
    ["The libram is inside {area:190} among elite Scarlet guards, and {item:12955} among Haunting Visions at {area:201}: a group quest."] = "圣契在{area:190}内的精英血色十字军守卫中间，{item:12955}在{area:201}的亡鬼幻象中间：这是个组队任务。",
    ["The lockboxes sit in Andorhal's ruined houses around {npc:10667}'s inn. Careful: Ghouls and skeletons usually stand next to the boxes and attack when you come close. Searing ghouls also hurt anyone nearby and will break stealth. A {npc:1805}, a level 56-57 elite, stands among the houses just east of the inn: take the boxes on the west side first and keep clear of it."] = "锁箱放在{npc:10667}旅店周围安多哈尔的废屋里。小心：食尸鬼和骷髅通常站在箱子旁，你靠近时会攻击。灼热食尸鬼还会伤害附近的人并打破潜行。一只{npc:1805}（56-57 级精英）站在旅店东边不远的房屋之间：先拿西边的箱子，离它远点。",
    ["The moss for {npc:260661} grows around {area:16848}: by the outposts and on the slopes north of them."] = "{npc:260661}要的苔藓长在{area:16848}周围：前哨旁边和它们北边的山坡上。",
    ["The mouth of {area:2256}"] = "{area:2256}的入口",
    ["The naga's flooded ruins lie just past the north end of the {area:414}. The arrow cannot find its own way down into them, so it leads you to the water's edge first: from there swim north into the ruins."] = "纳迦被淹没的废墟就在{area:414}北端再往前一点。箭头没法自己找到下到废墟里的路，所以会先把你带到水边：从那里向北游进废墟。",
    ["The nearest Mosshoof Coursers graze the hills north-east of the {area:1224}, toward the {area:1219}; a larger herd roams the open ground to the south.\nCareful: the Mosshoof Coursers are 52-53: pull them one at a time from the herd's edge."] = "最近的苔蹄快步者在{area:1224}东北方向、朝向{area:1219}的山丘上吃草；更大的一群在南边开阔地上游荡。\n小心：苔蹄快步者是52-53级：从鹿群边缘一次只拉一只。",
    ["The next guide flies from {area:340} in the {area:3}: up through {area:16685}, the pass at the valley's north-west end, just north of {npc:258570}'s camp. Coming from {area:16743}, ride west through {area:16723} and keep north of the Twilight camps below the pass."] = "下一个指南从{area:3}的{area:340}起飞：穿过山谷西北端的山口{area:16685}，就在{npc:258570}营地北边。从{area:16743}过来的话，向西骑穿过{area:16723}，并保持在山口下方暮光营地的北边。",
    ["The next guide flies from {area:340} to {object:3202}; Warriors, Paladins, Rogues, Priests, Mages and Warlocks go by the {zone:1458} first, for their training and {npc:4486}."] = "下一个指南从{area:340}飞到{object:3202}；战士、圣骑士、盗贼、牧师、法师和术士先去{zone:1458}，参加训练并找{npc:4486}。",
    ["The north end of the {area:414}"] = "{area:414}的北端",
    ["The overlook"] = "瞭望台",
    ["The pass to the {zone:1419}"] = "通往{zone:1419}的山口",
    ["The pinecones lie under the healthy trees just south of the bone pile, on the scar's south-western rim, and a few east of the Crow."] = "松果在骨堆南边不远、伤疤西南边缘健康的树下，乌鸦东边也有几个。",
    ["The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge. {npc:9166} circle the slopes around it: they count for {npc:9997}.\nCareful: {npc:6584} (60), a rare devilsaur, roams the crater's west around 27,46: if you meet him, ride away."] = "水晶塔立在避难营东边的山坡上。{npc:9166}在周围山坡上盘旋，击杀它们也计入{npc:9997}的任务进度。\n小心：60级稀有魔暴龙{npc:6584}在环形山西侧约27,46一带游荡：遇到它直接骑马跑。",
    ["The relics are in the ruins just south of {quest:5250}"] = "圣物就在{quest:5250}正南方的废墟里",
    ["The rest of this guide is {npc:258570}'s camp in the west, which waits on {npc:256899}: without him the {zone:2548} end here. Back to {area:16743} from the port, where your Hearthstone is set: {npc:255993}, the wind rider master in the middle of the fort, flies to {area:340} in the {area:3}, where the next guide starts."] = "本指南剩下的是西边{npc:258570}的营地，要等打完{npc:256899}才能做：没打他的话，{zone:2548}到这里就结束了。从港口（你的炉石绑定在那里）回到{area:16743}：要塞中央的双足飞龙管理员{npc:255993}飞往{area:3}的{area:340}，下一个指南从那里开始。",
    ["The river: {item:265806}"] = "河边：{item:265806}",
    ["The road from {area:413} comes in by the flight master: {npc:3845} and {npc:4079} stand there, {npc:3996} just east of them, {npc:3691} in the inn, {npc:3894} inside the building beyond it."] = "从{area:413}来的大路在飞行管理员旁进镇：{npc:3845}和{npc:4079}就站在那里，{npc:3996}在他们东边一点，{npc:3691}在旅店里，{npc:3894}在旅店后面的建筑内。",
    ["The road in"] = "进区之路",
    ["The road south of the western pylon"] = "西侧水晶塔南面的大路",
    ["The road through {area:2249}"] = "穿过{area:2249}的大路",
    ["The road to {area:1438}"] = "通往{area:1438}的大路",
    ["The road to {area:2255}: furs and horns"] = "通往{area:2255}的大路：毛皮与奇美拉角",
    ["The road west: feathers, furs and horns"] = "西行之路：羽毛、毛皮与奇美拉角",
    ["The robot sits at the head of the river west of {area:351}. Escort it east to the shore beyond the {area:307}, then ride back west for {area:348}; its reward waits with {npc:7406} in {area:35}, later in this guide.\nCareful: Two ambushes spawn during the escort: first three wildkin owlbeasts, then three trolls. Before each, the robot halts and announces it senses danger. Oozes, stealthed wolves and a large turtle along the path can join fights, and they respawn even if cleared beforehand."] = "机器鸡停在{area:351}西侧的河源处。护送它向东穿过{area:307}到达海岸，然后向西骑回{area:348}；奖励稍后在本指南去{area:35}找{npc:7406}时领取。\n小心：护送途中有两波伏击：先是三只枭兽，再是三名巨魔。每次伏击前机器鸡都会停下并提示侦测到危险。沿途的软泥怪、潜行狼和大海龟可能会加入战斗，就算提前清过也会重新刷新。",
    ["The robot sits in a small cave on the north side of {area:1105}, just north-west of the ruins. Escort it to the dock on the {area:1108}, where the boat to Feathermoon leaves; its reward waits with {npc:7406} in {area:35}, on the {zone:1425} guide's {area:35} stop.\nCareful: Three ambushes spawn during the escort, and the robot warns you before each one. The first is 3 yetis, just after the robot leaves the cave and climbs toward the road. The second is 3 gorillas, on the path that runs along the cliff. The third is about 4 gnolls, one of them a caster, where the route turns off toward the dock."] = "机器鸡停在{area:1105}北侧、废墟西北方的小洞穴里。护送它前往开往羽月要塞的{area:1108}码头；奖励可找{area:35}的{npc:7406}领取，等{zone:1425}指南途经{area:35}这一站时再交。\n小心：护送途中有三波伏击，每次出现前机器鸡都会发出警告。第一波是3只雪人，在机器鸡刚出洞爬向大路时；第二波是3只大猩猩，在沿悬崖延伸的小路上；第三波约4只豺狼人（含1名法系），在路线拐向码头的位置。",
    ["The rock piles"] = "碎石堆",
    ["The ruins lie around the frozen lake south of {area:2253}. Pick up the four relic fragments lying in the ruins: {npc:10304} in the {zone:1423} takes them, on the next guide."] = "废墟分布在{area:2253}南面的冰湖周围。拾取散落在废墟里的四块圣物碎片：下一份指南会在{zone:1423}交给{npc:10304}。",
    ["The ruins of {area:2262} lie south of the road. {npc:10926}'s ghost plays by the ruined house at the south end."] = "{area:2262}废墟位于大路南侧。{npc:10926}的鬼魂在南端破屋旁玩耍。",
    ["The satchel lies in the mountains of the far south, past Bronzebeard's Encampment. {npc:15196}, an elite scorpid, patrols near it: grab it while he is away."] = "挎包在极南的山里，过了布隆兹贝尔德营地。精英蝎子{npc:15196}在它附近巡逻：趁他走开时拿走。",
    ["The seeds and the owl eggs lie on the slopes between the Hermit's Abode and the road you came in on: search north-east up towards {npc:266803} and {npc:266802}."] = "种子和猫头鹰蛋散落在隐士居所和你进来的那条路之间的山坡上：往东北朝{npc:266803}和{npc:266802}的方向找。",
    ["The shards lie on the ground along the west side of {area:2249}, among the Frostmaul Giants and Preservers. Careful: the giants are elites of 59-60: pick up the shards that lie clear of them, wait for a patrol to pass, and leave {npc:10198} (60, east side) alone."] = "碎片散落在{area:2249}西侧的地上，在霜槌巨人和保存者之间。小心：巨人是 59-60 级精英：捡离它们远的碎片，等巡逻的过去，别碰{npc:10198}（60 级，东侧）。",
    ["The shield lies east of the barn at {area:201}. Take your group around the barn to reach it."] = "盾牌在{area:201}谷仓东边。和队友一起绕过谷仓去拿。",
    ["The shrine is a pair of standing stones west of the Hermit's Abode, on the way back to the outpost: bury the remains there."] = "神龛是隐士居所西边的一对立石，在回前哨的路上：把遗骸埋在那里。",
    ["The shrub field"] = "灌木地",
    ["The skeletons of Andorhal, next on this guide"] = "本指南接下来的安多哈尔骷髅",
    ["The skeletons on the fields east of the {area:152} drop the fragments: take them on the ride east."] = "{area:152}东边田野上的骷髅会掉碎片：往东骑时顺路打。",
    ["The slimes are thickest in the scar's south-western corner."] = "软泥怪在伤疤西南角最密集。",
    ["The sun-bleached bones lie all over {area:16868}; the Fleshflay Raveners there carry the drop of stolen life.\nCareful: Death Wailers (61, rare elites) drift over {area:16868}: keep out of their way. Spectral Frostwyrms (61, elites) circle over the meadows around it: keep out from under them."] = "日晒的骨头散落在{area:16868}各处；那里的剥皮掠食者带着被偷走的生命之滴。\n小心：死亡哀嚎者（61 级，稀有精英）在{area:16868}上空飘荡：别挡它们的路。幽灵冰霜巨龙（61 级，精英）在周围的草地上空盘旋：别待在它们下方。",
    ["The tablet, {object:58}, lies on the sea floor of the {area:104}, west of {object:3202}. Mind your breath."] = "石板{object:58}在{object:3202}西边{area:104}的海底。注意呼吸。",
    ["The three warlocks and {npc:260440} are in and around the Ashen camp at the north of the scar.\nCareful: Awakened Fel Ash Slimes (58, elite) ooze about the scar: keep clear of them."] = "三个术士和{npc:260440}在伤疤北边的灰烬营地里外。\n小心：苏醒的邪能灰烬软泥怪（58 级，精英）在伤疤里蠕动：离它们远点。",
    ["The three wrecks"] = "三艘沉船",
    ["The three wrecks {npc:256222} named lie at the east end of the fields: use the {item:269944} beside each, the catapult and the flying machine first, then the ballista a little north of them."] = "{npc:256222}说的三处残骸在田野东端：在每处旁边使用{item:269944}，先是投石车和飞行器，然后是它们北边一点的弩车。",
    ["The tortured druids and sentinels haunt the ruined village east of the hold."] = "饱受折磨的德鲁伊和哨兵游荡在要塞东边的废弃村庄里。",
    ["The tram comes in at the {object:28027}: {npc:1416} works at the forge there."] = "矿道地铁通向{object:28027}：{npc:1416}就在那里的熔炉旁干活。",
    ["The treants wander the forest roads between the camp and the middle of {zone:1444}; there are only a few, so look along the paths. They carry the Splintered Logs too.\nCareful: a {npc:272401} (level 60) flies over the forest west of the camp: keep clear of it."] = "树人在营地和{zone:1444}中部之间的林间小路上游荡；数量不多，沿着小路找。它们也带着碎裂的原木。\n小心：一只{npc:272401}（60 级）在营地西边的森林上空飞：离它远点。",
    ["The two outposts of {area:16848}."] = "{area:16848}的两个前哨。",
    ["The two wrecks lie in the bay west of the cove. The charts and logs are inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around them. Daggerspine naga swim the whole bay.\nCareful: the charts and logs lie deep inside the wrecks: watch your breath bar and come up between them; a water breathing potion makes it easy."] = "两艘沉船躺在海湾西侧的水域里。海图和航海日志在船舱内，宝石散落在周围的海底。整片海湾都有刺脊纳迦游荡。\n小心：海图和日志藏在沉船深处，注意呼吸条，拿完记得上浮换气；喝一瓶水下呼吸药剂会轻松很多。",
    ["The untainted soil lies in the fields south and east of the outpost; Hyjal Stags graze there too, and their venison is for {npc:256222}'s stew.\nCareful: {npc:248709} (56), an elite treant, walks the fields to the south-east around 60,78: give him room."] = "未受污染的土壤在前哨南边和东边的田野里；海加尔雄鹿也在那里吃草，它们的鹿肉是{npc:256222}炖菜要的。\n小心：精英树人{npc:248709}（56 级）在东南约 60,78 处的田野里走动：离它远点。",
    ["The vial is filled in {zone:1457}, later in this guide: keep it; inside"] = "小瓶稍后在本指南去{zone:1457}时装水：先留着；在室内",
    ["The warlocks"] = "术士们",
    ["The warriors in the northern ruins (39-40) drop both tusks and necklaces. Pull from the edge; leave the chief and his two guards to the south alone."] = "北边废墟里的战士（39-40 级）会掉獠牙和项链。从边缘拉怪；别碰南边的酋长和他的两个护卫。",
    ["The way into the Deadwood camps"] = "进入死木营地的路",
    ["The western Winterfall camp sits in the hills between {npc:9298} and the tunnel. Any furbolg here can drop an {item:12771} (about one in ten: it comes within the kills these quests need): right-click it. They also drop Winterfall Ritual Totems (about one in thirty) and {item:14047}, which only matter if you are Neutral (the totem) or Friendly ({npc:11557}'s {item:14047}) with the Timbermaw: keep them then.\nCareful: the Pathfinders are 53 and the Totemics 54, but the Den Watchers inside the camp are 55: take the camp from its edge and pull one at a time."] = "西侧的冬泉熊怪营地位于{npc:9298}和隧道之间的山丘上。这里的任何熊怪都会掉落{item:12771}（掉率约十分之一，做完这些任务击杀数前通常就能掉）：拿到后右键点击。它们还会掉落冬泉仪祭图腾（掉率约三十分之一）和{item:14047}，只有木喉要塞声望达到中立（交图腾）或友善（交{npc:11557}的{item:14047}）时才用得上：届时记得留着。\n小心：冬泉探路者53级，冬泉图腾师54级，营地内部的冬泉巢穴守卫有55级：从营地边缘下手，每次只拉一只。",
    ["The western repair used up your crystals: on the way east, use the {item:255662} on the Unstable Mana Rifts again for four more Coalesced Mana Crystals."] = "修复西边的塔用光了你的水晶：往东走的路上，再对不稳定的法力裂隙使用{item:255662}，收集四块凝聚法力水晶。",
    ["The western repair used up your crystals: on the way east, use the {item:255662} on the Unstable Mana Rifts again for four more Coalesced Mana Crystals. The {item:271882} needs all four for the next repair."] = "修复西侧水晶塔消耗完了你的水晶：向东走的路上，再次对不稳定的法力裂隙使用{item:255662}，再收集四块凝聚的法力水晶。{item:271882}需要全部四块才能进行下一次修复。",
    ["The worker {npc:244517} means is a peasant just north of her; {npc:264521} stands between them."] = "{npc:244517}说的工人是她北边不远的一个农民；{npc:264521}站在她们之间。",
    ["The wreck of the Flying Osprey lies in the shallows south of the keep, beside {item:279915}."] = "飞鱼鹰号的残骸在要塞南面的浅滩里，就在{item:279915}旁边。",
    ["The wrecked caravan lies north-east of the village, east of the road to {zone:1456}."] = "损毁的商队位于村庄东北方、通往{zone:1456}的大路东侧。",
    ["The yeti hills start just south-east of {area:2255}. Every yeti drops fur. Careful: the Ice Thistle Yetis are 55-56: take the 55s one at a time, and leave the Matriarchs and Patriarchs (56-58), whose horns come on a later visit."] = "雪人的山就在{area:2255}东南。每只雪人都掉毛皮。小心：冰蓟雪人是 55-56 级：一次打一只 55 级的，别碰族母和族长（56-58 级），它们的角留到之后再来。",
    ["The {area:16849}"] = "前往{area:16849}",
    ["The {area:16867}"] = "前往{area:16867}",
    ["The {area:2240} lies on the {area:439} in south-east {zone:1441}: {npc:4454} is in the gnomes' camp beside the track, {npc:4630} and {npc:4709} by the goblins' camp. With {quest:1137} handed in, {npc:4630} has work: {npc:4630} first, then {npc:4709}, who runs off to keep Rizzle busy; then take Rizzle's plans from the gnomes' camp and bring them back to {npc:4630}."] = "{area:2240}位于{zone:1441}东南部的{area:439}：{npc:4454}在赛道旁的侏儒营地，{npc:4630}和{npc:4709}在地精营地旁。交完{quest:1137}后{npc:4630}会有新活：先找{npc:4630}，再找{npc:4709}，他会跑去缠住里兹尔；趁机从侏儒营地偷走里兹尔的计划书带回给{npc:4630}。",
    ["The {area:2479} is the druids' camp by the road in southern {zone:1448}."] = "{area:2479}是{zone:1448}南部大路旁的德鲁伊营地。",
    ["The {item:11242} grows inside a ruined building north of {npc:7765}: climb in through the break in its wall from the ledge beside it.\nOr the front door: {npc:9467} guards it, and the Bait Gregan sells draws him off when you use it beside him. Half the players in our recordings went in that way, half through the wall."] = "{item:11242}长在{npc:7765}北边一栋残破建筑内：可以从旁边岩台翻过墙壁缺口进去。\n也可以走正门：{npc:9467}守在门口，在他旁边使用格雷甘卖的诱饵就能把他引开。我们记录中一半玩家走正门，一半翻墙进去。",
    ["The {item:11242} grows inside a ruined building north of {npc:7775}'s camp, east of the harpies' {area:1114}: climb in through the broken part of its wall.\nOr the front door: {npc:9467} guards it, and the Bait Gregan sells draws him off when you use it beside him. Half the players in our recordings went in that way, half through the wall."] = "{item:11242}长在{npc:7775}营地北边、鹰身人{area:1114}东边一栋残破建筑内：可以从墙壁破口翻进去。\n也可以走正门：{npc:9467}守在门口，在他旁边使用格雷甘卖的诱饵就能把他引开。我们记录中一半玩家走正门，一半翻墙进去。",
    ["The {item:255656} lies at the western edge of the village; Magram Guardians (levels 39-41) watch over it. They leave you be unless you have fought the Magram: pick the fragment up without a fight. Every Magram you kill turns the clan against you, and back in the valley that means the Necrokhans (level 45, elites) at the western pylon as well."] = "{item:255656}在村子西边缘，玛格拉姆守卫（39-41 级）看守着它。除非你和玛格拉姆打过，否则它们不会理你：不用战斗直接捡起碎片。你每杀一个玛格拉姆都会让整个氏族与你为敌，回到山谷后，这还意味着西边水晶塔旁的死灵可汗（45 级精英）也会攻击你。",
    ["The {npc:257753}"] = "寻找{npc:257753}",
    ["The {npc:511} (26) hides in the small crypt by the {area:121}, south of {area:42}; the glass is inside."] = "{npc:511}（26级）藏在{area:42}以南、{area:121}旁的小墓穴里；眼镜就在里面。",
    ["The {object:149502} holds a {item:10575}: keep it for {npc:9459} in the {zone:1428}"] = "{object:149502}里有一个{item:10575}：留给{zone:1428}的{npc:9459}",
    ["The {object:172960} is the canyon under the {object:172982}; {npc:3216} stands at its far end. Tell him what {npc:4949} found."] = "{object:172960}就是{object:172982}下面的峡谷，{npc:3216}站在峡谷尽头。告诉他{npc:4949}的发现。",
    ["The {object:180503} lies in the outpost: read it and take its torn page back to {npc:15174}."] = "{object:180503}在前哨里：阅读它，把撕下的书页带回给{npc:15174}。",
    ["The {quest:5086} are just back through the tunnel, in {zone:1448}"] = "{quest:5086}的目标就在隧道另一侧的{zone:1448}",
    ["The {quest:5087} (57) carry their crates along the road between {area:2246} and {zone:1448}'s tunnel.\nCareful: Turning in spawns three or four level 56-57 Winterfall ambushers that attack you; you can escape them while mounted, in stealth or with {spell:5384}, and they then gather by the lake so you can take the next quest.\nCareful: the {quest:5087} are 57, over you here: pull one at a time, away from the camp."] = "{quest:5087}（57级）扛着箱子在{area:2246}与{zone:1448}隧道之间的大路上行走。\n小心：交任务会刷出三四名56-57级的冬泉伏击者攻击你；可以骑马逃脱、潜行或用{spell:5384}脱战，之后它们会聚集在湖边，你就可以接下一步任务了。\n小心：{quest:5087}有57级，比你此时高：把它们远离营地逐个拉着打。",
    ["The {quest:94965}: Snufflesnout"] = "{quest:94965}：嗅鼻",
    ["The {quest:94965}: {npc:257059}"] = "{quest:94965}：寻找{npc:257059}",
    ["The {zone:2548} lie south of the {area:3}. Fly from {area:75} to {area:340}: the way down into the zone starts there."] = "{zone:2548}在{area:3}南边。从{area:75}飞到{area:340}：进入这片区域的路从那里开始。",
    ["Then a {item:4389} ({skill:202}, or the engineering supply vendors): this step shows only when you carry one."] = "然后是一个{item:4389}（{skill:202}，或工程学材料商人）：只有你身上带着时才显示这一步。",
    ["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:12866} stands by the entrance of {area:1316}, a few hundred yards north-east of the top of the {area:485}; the Razorfen Battleguards, Thornweavers and Death's Head Cultists (33-34, elite) hold the thorny slopes around her. Skip it if you are alone."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人一起做。{npc:12866}站在{area:485}顶端东北几百码处的{area:1316}入口旁；周围的荆棘山坡上布满剃刀沼泽护卫者、剃刀沼泽织棘者和亡首教徒（33-34级精英）。单人就跳过。",
    ["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:1388} is a level 12 elite: take him on with a group. Alone, skip it: the {area:38} quests ahead make up the experience."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人一起做。{npc:1388}是12级精英，组队再打。单人就跳过：前面{area:38}的任务足够补回这些经验。",
    ["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:9461} is a level 54 elite: most classes solo it at level 56, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人一起做。{npc:9461}是54级精英：大多数职业56级可以单挑，但你可能需要帮忙。独自一人且打不过就跳过。",
    ["Thorium Plated Daggers"] = "瑟银匕首",
    ["Through the pink portal at {area:702}, up into {zone:1457}."] = "穿过{area:702}的粉色传送门，上去进入{zone:1457}。",
    ["Through {area:1769}'s tunnel to its {zone:1452} end."] = "穿过{area:1769}的隧道前往{zone:1452}一端。",
    ["Through {area:1769}'s tunnel, just north of {npc:9298}, to {zone:1448}."] = "穿过{npc:9298}正北方的{area:1769}隧道前往{zone:1448}。",
    ["Top up here to about level 59.7 before the last hand-ins: Umi, Vizzie, Mau'ari, {area:2244}, {npc:9298}, {npc:11556}, {npc:10306} and {npc:9116} take you the rest of the way to 60. The Rabid Shardtooths (59) of {area:2249}, just north of the strange source, give far more experience than the furbolgs by {area:1769}. Or, with a group, run the {area:2057} dungeon or the {area:2279} dungeon instead."] = "在最后交任务前先在这里刷到约 59.7 级：乌米、维齐、毛阿里、{area:2244}、{npc:9298}、{npc:11556}、{npc:10306}和{npc:9116}会带你升到 60 级。{area:2249}的狂暴碎牙（59 级）就在奇怪的来源北边，经验比{area:1769}旁的熊怪多得多。或者组队去刷{area:2057}或{area:2279}副本。",
    ["Top up here to level 10: your class quest at {area:362} needs level 10.\nThe prickly pears for {quest:96825} grow by these huts: pick them while you grind."] = "在这里刷怪升到10级：你在{area:362}的职业任务需要10级。\n{quest:96825}要的仙人掌果就长在这些小屋旁：刷怪时顺手采摘。",
    ["Troll Temper"] = "巨魔回火剂",
    ["Turn west here"] = "在这里往西拐",
    ["Tusks and necklaces on the Skullsplitter hunt"] = "狩猎劈颅巨魔：獠牙与项链",
    ["Twilight Ritual Circle destroyed"] = "暮光仪式法阵已摧毁",
    ["Tymor in {zone:1455}, on the {zone:1422} guide's {zone:1455} stop: keep it"] = "交给{zone:1455}的法师泰摩尔，等{zone:1422}指南途经{zone:1455}时再交：先留着",
    ["Umi's next task scares three goblins in {area:2255}, {area:976} and Un'Goro, behind the route now: skip it."] = "乌米的下一步任务要吓唬{area:2255}、{area:976}和安戈洛环形山的三名地精，那些地方已经在路线后面了：跳过。",
    ["Umi's third prank targets goblins in {area:976}, Un'Goro and {area:2255}: keep it. {zone:2482} is next: its way in starts here in {area:2255}; {area:976}, Linken's sword and {zone:1451} follow it."] = "乌米的第三个恶作剧针对{area:976}、安戈洛和{area:2255}的地精：保留它。下一站是{zone:2482}：入口从{area:2255}这里开始；之后是{area:976}、林肯的剑和{zone:1451}。",
    ["Umi: keep it, the Pristine Yeti Horns come on the {zone:1423} guide's {area:2255} stop at about 56"] = "乌米：保留这个任务，纯净的雪人角在约 56 级的{zone:1423}指南的{area:2255}站再做",
    ["Uncracked Scarab Shell"] = "未破裂的甲虫壳",
    ["Under 40 on your first {area:35} visit? {npc:2491}, in the inn, and \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor, have their quests for you now."] = "第一次来{area:35}时还不到 40 级？旅店里的{npc:2491}和顶楼的「海狼」麦金利现在有任务给你。",
    ["Under 55 on the first {area:152} stop? Derrington's {quest:838} is offered now: Dithers' {quest:964} come from the skeletons on the ride back west from {area:201}."] = "第一次到{area:152}时还不到 55 级？德灵顿的{quest:838}现在可以接了：迪瑟斯的{quest:964}来自从{area:201}往西骑回去时路上的骷髅。",
    ["Unfinished {area:43} errands"] = "未完成的{area:43}任务",
    ["Unstable Mana Rifts: mana for the eastern pylon"] = "不稳定的法力裂隙：为东侧水晶塔收集法力",
    ["Unstable Mana Rifts: mana for the western pylon"] = "不稳定的法力裂隙：为西侧水晶塔收集法力",
    ["Up to the {area:16849}"] = "上山前往{area:16849}",
    ["Use the west face of the western pylon, where you repaired it. Approach on the road from the south and pull one {npc:252711} back to you. Wait for the elite patrols to pass; do not follow a Protector around the east side."] = "使用西边水晶塔的西面，也就是你修复它的地方。从南边沿路过来，拉一个{npc:252711}到你这边。等精英巡逻过去，别跟着守护者绕到东边。",
    ["Use the {item:12284} on a {npc:7047} on the slopes east of {area:251} just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves.\nCareful: a {npc:8981} (level 56, rare) walks the slopes by the broodlings, Volchan (60, a rare fire elemental) roams the hills east of {area:251}, and the {npc:7040} and Wyrmkin around them are elite: use the Incarcinatrix on a broodling at the edge and look around before each pull."] = "在{area:251}东侧山坡上对濒死的{npc:7047}使用{item:12284}，然后拾取留下的精华。\n小心：{npc:8981}（56级稀有）在小龙附近的山坡巡逻，60级稀有火元素沃尔查在{area:251}东边的山丘游荡，周围的{npc:7040}和龙人也是精英：挑边缘的小龙使用龙灵采集器，每次拉怪前先观察四周。",
    ["Use the {item:12815} at the foot of each of the four watchtowers around the edge of Andorhal, north of the camp, on the way to {area:199}.\nCareful: Skeletal Warlords and Flesh Golems (57, elites) walk Andorhal's streets, and the {npc:7572} (59, elite) wanders between Andorhal and Northridge: keep to the towers at the town's edge and let them pass."] = "去往{area:199}的路上，在营地北边安多哈尔外围四座哨塔的塔基处分别使用{item:12815}。\n小心：57级精英骷髅军官和血肉傀儡在安多哈尔街道上巡逻，59级精英{npc:7572}也在安多哈尔和北山伐木场之间游荡：贴着城镇边缘的哨塔走，等它们过去。",
    ["Use the {item:255662} on the Unstable Mana Rifts, the floating sparks along the road north: each pylon takes four Coalesced Mana Crystals, and the repair uses them up."] = "对不稳定的法力裂隙使用{item:255662}，它们是往北路边漂浮的火花：每座水晶塔需要四块凝聚法力水晶，修复时会用掉。",
    ["Use {item:12928} on {npc:10977}"] = "对{npc:10977}使用{item:12928}",
    ["Venture Co. Copter Pad"] = "风险投资公司直升机停机坪",
    ["Venture Co. Workers"] = "风险投资公司工人",
    ["Vessel Workstation"] = "容器工作台",
    ["Vimes's next errand, The Deserters, is for the {zone:1445} visit at 39: leave it."] = "维米斯队长的后续任务「逃兵」留到39级再来{zone:1445}时做：现在先别管。",
    ["WANTED poster"] = "通缉令",
    ["Walk through {area:1769}'s tunnel to its {zone:1452} end."] = "步行穿过{area:1769}的隧道前往{zone:1452}一端。",
    ["Wanted: {npc:15196}"] = "通缉：{npc:15196}",
    ["Warriors, Paladins, Rogues, Priests, Mages and Warlocks (not Hunters, Shamans or Druids): {npc:4486} stands beside the flight master. The Dabyrie family's farm lies on the road east through Arathi later in this guide, and your level 40 training brings you back to this flight master from {area:340}: she takes the heads then."] = "战士、圣骑士、盗贼、牧师、法师和术士（不包括猎人、萨满祭司和德鲁伊）：{npc:4486}站在飞行管理员旁边。达比里家族的农场在本指南后面穿过阿拉希往东的路上，你 40 级训练时会从{area:340}回到这个飞行管理员：那时再交头颅。",
    ["Watch Ott craft the blade"] = "看奥特打造这把剑",
    ["West across the Cradle to {npc:255693}, another of the wild gods."] = "往西穿过摇篮找另一位荒野之神{npc:255693}。",
    ["West across the foothills to {area:287} town: the smithy stands in the middle of it. {npc:2404} and his apprentices work at the forge; the {object:1736} is stacked beside it. {npc:2449} walks the west side of the town; {npc:2451} works the field south-east of the town."] = "向西穿过丘陵前往{area:287}镇：铁匠铺在镇子中间。{npc:2404}和他的学徒在铁砧旁干活，{object:1736}就堆在旁边。{npc:2449}在镇子西边走动，{npc:2451}在镇子东南的田里干活。",
    ["West across the foothills, past the ancients' outpost, to the {npc:257753} at the southern end of {area:17050}."] = "往西越过山麓，经过古树前哨，到{area:17050}南端的{npc:257753}。",
    ["West across the slope from the scar: {npc:278305} waits alone."] = "从伤疤往西越过山坡：{npc:278305}独自等着。",
    ["West across the south of the crater: Dinosaur Bones lie on the ground in the south-west, among the stegodons: those are elite, pick the bones up around them and take the rest from the Diemetradons. The expedition's {item:11112} lies in the south-west jungle.\nCareful: Gruff (57), a rare devilsaur, prowls the south around 38,75: if you meet him, ride away."] = "向西横穿环形山南部：恐龙骨头散落在西南部的剑龙群中——剑龙是精英，绕着它们捡地上的骨头，剩下的从双帆龙身上打。探险队的{item:11112}在西南丛林里。\n小心：57级稀有魔暴龙格鲁夫在南部约38,75一带潜行：遇到它直接骑马跑。",
    ["West across the zone to {npc:1855}'s hut on the way back to {area:3197}."] = "返回{area:3197}途中向西横穿该地区，前往{npc:1855}的小屋。",
    ["West along the north shore: the {quest:4725} lies on the beach north of {quest:954}, among Reef Crawlers and Greymist Warriors (15). Then south-west down to {area:442}."] = "沿北海岸向西：{quest:4725}位于{quest:954}北面的海滩上，周围是暗礁蟹和灰雾战士（15级）。随后向西南前往{area:442}。",
    ["West along the southern slopes to {area:17144}: {npc:249549}, a gnome test pilot, hangs tangled up in a tree. A sturdy branch lies just south of him."] = "沿南边的山坡往西到{area:17144}：侏儒试飞员{npc:249549}缠在一棵树上。一根结实的树枝就在他南边。",
    ["West from the compound, on the way to Un'Goro's ramp: {quest:3362}'s Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers (49-50) are {npc:7876}'s, carried from your second {zone:1446} visit. They wander a lot: pull them one at a time. {npc:7876} takes them on the next guide's {area:976} stop."] = "从营地往西，在去安戈洛坡道的路上：{quest:3362}的扭曲蓟灌怪和塑根者（49-50 级）是{npc:7876}要的，从你第二次来{zone:1446}时带过来。它们游荡很远：一次拉一个。{npc:7876}在下一个指南的{area:976}站收下。",
    ["West from the {area:1076} along the road, past the Pridewing slopes: the courier waits by the road on their west side. His supplies drop from the Pridewings, and {npc:16458} at {area:467}, at the end of the road north, takes them."] = "从{area:1076}沿大路向西，经过巨翼双足飞龙的山坡：信使在山坡西侧的路边等候。他的补给品由巨翼双足飞龙掉落，带去北边大路尽头{area:467}的{npc:16458}处即可。",
    ["West from the {object:32383} into the {object:32362}: {npc:5149}, {npc:6179} and {npc:6178} are in the {object:32386}, {npc:6179} and {npc:6178} on its upper floor: the stairs up start just north-east of {npc:5149}. {npc:6175}, a beggar, wanders the city. John needs ten {item:2589}. Bring what you have; if you’re short, Rockjaw Skullthumpers at Gol’Bolar Quarry drop it."] = "从{object:32383}向西进入{object:32362}：{npc:5149}、{npc:6179}和{npc:6178}都在{object:32386}里，其中{npc:6179}和{npc:6178}在二楼，上楼的楼梯就在{npc:5149}东北方。乞丐{npc:6175}在城里四处游荡。约翰需要十块{item:2589}，把身上带的都交给他；如果不够，古博拉采掘场的石腭击颅者会掉落。",
    ["West from {area:413} to the coast, then north to the {area:414}. {npc:3846} camps on the beach; Wrathtail nagas fill the shore."] = "从{area:413}向西到海岸，再向北前往{area:414}。{npc:3846}在海滩上扎营，岸边到处都是怒尾纳迦。",
    ["West into the middle of the zone: Marduk's sword lies in the {area:2623} and Horgus' skull at {area:2624}, north of it, each where ghosts fight; grown Plaguehounds hunt the plains between."] = "向西进入地区中部：马杜克的剑在{area:2623}，霍古斯的颅骨在它北边的{area:2624}，两处都有鬼魂在激战；中间的平原上有成年瘟疫犬游荡。",
    ["West into the {area:596} first: {npc:11438}'s {object:176751} lie among the skeletons on its western side. Just north of them an {object:417353} starts {quest:79229}, also for {npc:11438}."] = "先向西进入{area:596}：{npc:11438}要的{object:176751}散落在西侧的骸骨之间。就在它们北边，一处{object:417353}可开启{quest:79229}，同样交给{npc:11438}。",
    ["West of Andorhal to {area:199}: {npc:11075} (53) guards the cauldron among the Jabbering Ghouls (54).\n{npc:10778}'s ghost wanders by the farmhouse at the field's edge, upstairs; her parcel lies inside the house: take it for {zone:1453}, at the end of this guide."] = "从安多哈尔向西前往{area:199}：{npc:11075}（53级）在喋喋不休的食尸鬼（54级）中间守着大锅。\n{npc:10778}的鬼魂在田野边缘的农舍楼上游荡，她的包裹就在屋里：拿上留着，本指南最后回{zone:1453}时交。",
    ["West of Freewind Post, below {area:2097}, the harpies of {area:487} (28-30). {npc:4490} (31) walks among them: thin out the harpies around her before you pull her, for {npc:2986}'s claw. {npc:4877}'s harpies and {quest:98069} (on the ground along the foot of the cliff and in the cave up on top) are here for a character who didn't do them in the {zone:1440} & {zone:1441} guide."] = "乱风岗西边、{area:2097}下方是{area:487}的鹰身人（28-30 级）。{npc:4490}（31 级）在它们之中走动：先清掉她周围的鹰身人再拉她，拿{npc:2986}要的爪子。{npc:4877}的鹰身人任务和{quest:98069}（在悬崖脚下的地上和崖顶的洞里）是给没在{zone:1440}和{zone:1441}指南里做过的角色准备的。",
    ["West of Rog'mar the Twilight cult holds the farm town of {area:16723}. {npc:259158}, a kobold who wants out, waits in a cage at the arrow."] = "罗格玛西边，暮光教派占据着农庄{area:16723}。{npc:259158}，一个想逃出去的狗头人，被关在箭头指着的笼子里。",
    ["West of the compound the cactus creatures fill the valley; only the Dew Collectors (47-48) carry a dew gland. Most mobs in {zone:1446} can drop OOX-17/TN's distress beacon, rarely: keep it if you see one.\nCareful: The other thistleshrub mobs in the area are level 48-50 and wander a lot, so you can easily pull extra mobs: take the Dew Collectors at the valley's edge, and leave {quest:2864}'s Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers (49-50) for the {area:1938} ride into Un'Goro at about 51."] = "营地西边的山谷里满是仙人掌怪，只有露水收集者（47-48 级）带着露水腺。{zone:1446}的大多数怪都有很小几率掉落 OOX-17/TN 的求救信标：看到就留着。\n小心：这一带其他蓟灌怪是 48-50 级，而且游荡很远，很容易多拉怪：在山谷边缘打露水收集者，{quest:2864}的扭曲蓟灌怪和塑根者（49-50 级）留到约 51 级骑进安戈洛时在{area:1938}打。",
    ["West of the outpost to {area:17050}: the {npc:257753} perches at its southern end."] = "从前哨往西到{area:17050}：{npc:257753}栖息在它的南端。",
    ["West past the camp, Crystal Spine Basilisks (34-35) sit on the rocks; every Bloodscalp in the village beyond can drop an ear.\nLeave {npc:729}, the level 37 tiger on the hilltop south-west of the camp, for now: he is two over you here, and this guide comes back to him at its end, from level 36.\nCareful: The raptor nest has young raptors that join the fight when you attack the adults."] = "越过营地往西，水晶刺蜥蜴（34-35 级）趴在岩石上；再往前的村子里每个血顶巨魔都可能掉耳朵。\n营地西南山顶上的{npc:729}（37 级的老虎）先别打：他这时比你高两级，本指南最后 36 级起会回来打他。\n小心：迅猛龙巢里有小迅猛龙，你攻击成年迅猛龙时它们会加入战斗。",
    ["West past the fortress to the coast at {area:598}: the Slitherblade Myrmidons, Naga and Sorceresses hold the beach. Pull them one at a time; the Sea Witches and Oracles (34-36) cast from range."] = "越过要塞向西到{area:598}的海岸：滑刃侍从、纳迦和女巫占据着海滩。一次拉一个；海巫和神谕者（34-36 级）会远程施法。",
    ["West through the {area:2277} to {area:2627}: fill the {item:15042} at the big termite mounds, and kill the Frenzied Plaguehounds and the Carrion Devourers on the way.\nCareful: the Frenzied Plaguehounds are 57-58: pull them one at a time."] = "向西穿过{area:2277}前往{area:2627}：在大白蚁丘处装满{item:15042}，沿途顺便击杀狂怒的瘟疫犬和腐肉吞噬者。\n小心：狂怒的瘟疫犬有57-58级：每次只拉一只。",
    ["West to the Alliance outpost."] = "往西去联盟前哨。",
    ["West to the Horde outpost: {npc:244511}, then {npc:244512} and {npc:265788} beside him."] = "往西去部落前哨：{npc:244511}，然后是他旁边的{npc:244512}和{npc:265788}。",
    ["West to the bone pile by the slime pools: throw the warlocks' bones on it, then hand the quest in at the pile itself. Handing it in wakes the {npc:264306}, an elite (level 58) that hits hard: unless you are grouped for it, hand in and ride clear at once."] = "往西到软泥池旁的骨堆：把术士的骨头扔上去，然后在骨堆那里交任务。交任务会唤醒{npc:264306}，一个打人很痛的精英（58 级）：除非你为它组了队，否则交完立刻骑走。",
    ["West to the coast: the naga explorers wade along the shore and carry the reed bundles; the {object:759} bubbles in the hills just east of them.\nFollow the coast south. If you still need the {area:43} pirates, take the road past the {area:35} tunnel to the beach before going into town."] = "向西到海岸：纳迦探险者在岸边涉水，身上带着芦苇捆；{object:759}在它们东边的山里冒泡。\n沿海岸往南。如果你还需要{area:43}的海盗，先走经过{area:35}隧道的路去海滩，再进镇子。",
    ["West to the outpost."] = "往西去前哨。",
    ["West to the overlook above the valley: the veteran's old scabbard lies there. Hand his quest in at the scabbard and take the next from it, then use the scabbard in your bags to call his spirit and listen to his story."] = "往西到俯瞰山谷的瞭望点：老兵的旧剑鞘在那里。在剑鞘处交他的任务并接下一个，然后使用背包里的剑鞘召唤他的灵魂，听他讲故事。",
    ["West to the shore: the Drysnap Crawlers and Pincers (33-35) on the beach and the clam beds around the wreck carry {item:15878}, about one in seven."] = "向西前往海岸：海滩上的枯钳龙虾人和枯钳巨螯龙虾人（33-35级）以及沉船周围的巨蚌都有几率出{item:15878}，掉率约七分之一。",
    ["West to the wyverns' cliffs at {area:482}. Every wyvern there can drop a venom sac."] = "向西前往{area:482}的双足飞龙悬崖。那里的每只双足飞龙都可能掉落毒囊。",
    ["Western pylon found"] = "已找到西边的水晶塔",
    ["With the {item:11243} from Gregan"] = "带上格雷甘给的{item:11243}",
    ["With your group: {npc:15196} walks the mountains around the satchel. Pull him away from the other scorpids."] = "和你的队伍一起：{npc:15196}在挎包周围的山里走动。把他从其他蝎子身边拉开。",
    ["With your group: {npc:9026} (52, elite) guards the way to the {area:1584} portal, down the walkways inside the mountain."] = "和你的队伍一起：{npc:9026}（52 级，精英）守着通往{area:1584}传送门的路，在山里的走道下方。",
    ["With {npc:258626} beaten, {npc:257062} sends you to {npc:257058}, who keeps the Ring's beasts a few steps north-east of the ring; {npc:263440}, just south of the ring, wants good rock. {npc:257058}'s boar treat needs Sweetberries from the pirates' slopes north of {area:16727} and {item:265806} from the river between {area:16743} and {area:16726}: this guide gathers both and brings you back here after the port, for the Ring's last two bouts."] = "打败{npc:258626}后，{npc:257062}让你去找{npc:257058}，他在擂台东北几步远的地方照看擂台的野兽；擂台南边不远的{npc:263440}想要好石头。{npc:257058}的野猪零食需要{area:16727}北边海盗山坡上的甜浆果，以及{area:16743}和{area:16726}之间河里的{item:265806}：本指南会收集这两样，去完港口后带你回到这里打擂台最后两场。",
    ["With {quest:91923} handed in, {npc:248366} offers {quest:95766}: the {npc:257753} at {area:17050} takes it later in this guide."] = "交完{quest:91923}后，{npc:248366}会提供{quest:95766}：本指南稍后在{area:17050}交给{npc:257753}。",
    ["Without the flight to {zone:1453} at 56 earlier in this guide: {npc:10778}'s parcel goes to {npc:10782} in the {object:2096}, then {npc:3520} takes her own errand on the canals. {npc:14722} takes sixty Silk, sixty Mageweave and sixty {item:14047}: hand in what you carry (or buy at the Auction House), skip the rest."] = "如果本指南前面56级时没飞回{zone:1453}：先把{npc:10778}的包裹交给{object:2096}的{npc:10782}，再去运河边向{npc:3520}交她自己的差事。{npc:14722}收六十块丝绸、六十块魔纹布和六十块{item:14047}：把身上有的交了（或去拍卖行买），其余跳过。",
    ["Without the {zone:1428} guide's {area:3197} quests: {npc:10838} stands in the middle of the camp. His {quest:5092} opens the camp's chain."] = "如果没做{zone:1428}指南里的{area:3197}任务：{npc:10838}站在营地中央，他的{quest:5092}会开启营地任务链。",
    ["Without the {zone:1428} guide's {area:3197} quests: {npc:10877} walks the ring of {zone:1455} and sends you to {npc:10838}, whose camp this guide visits next. Chillwind's chain starts with it."] = "如果没做{zone:1428}指南里的{area:3197}任务：{npc:10877}在{zone:1455}的环道上巡逻，他会派你去找{npc:10838}——本指南接下来就去他的营地。冰风岗的任务链由此开启。",
    ["Work west back through {area:16866}: the Felguard Sentinels and Defiling Hounds are everywhere, the hounds carry the essence, and the Horde base's rubble (wire, scrap and dung) lies all over it. Light the two bonfires on your way, scout the Horde tower in the middle, take Azgalor's ashes west of the tower, and pick up the abandoned supplies, a few just north-west of {npc:259695} and the rest in the western half: {npc:259695}'s tuft of fur, used on a demon, distracts it while you take them.\nHorde: the demons here also drop the Scraps of Horde Heraldry for {npc:265788}, the old {item:253249} stands in the camp north of the south bonfire, and the {object:656786} at the camp's eastern edge start {quest:96998}.\nCareful: Legion Hulks (60, rare elites) stomp through {area:16866}'s camps: give them room. {npc:255183} (61, rare) walks the camp north of the south bonfire: keep away from her.\nCareful: Doomguards (elites, 58-59) stand among the demons, and {npc:267439} (elite, 61) walks the camp: pull the hounds and sentinels to you, away from them."] = "往西穿过{area:16866}回去：邪能卫士哨兵和亵渎猎犬到处都是，猎犬带着精华，部落基地的瓦砾（铁丝、废料和粪便）散落各处。路上点燃两堆篝火，侦察中间的部落塔楼，在塔楼西边拿阿兹加洛的骨灰，再捡起被丢弃的补给，几个在{npc:259695}西北不远，其余的在西半边：对恶魔使用{npc:259695}的一撮毛能分散它的注意力，让你拿补给。\n部落：这里的恶魔还会掉{npc:265788}要的部落纹章碎片，旧的{item:253249}立在南边篝火北边的营地里，营地东边缘的{object:656786}会开始{quest:96998}。\n小心：军团巨兽（60 级，稀有精英）在{area:16866}的营地间践踏而过：离它们远点。{npc:255183}（61 级，稀有）在南边篝火北边的营地里走动：离她远点。\n小心：末日守卫（精英，58-59 级）站在恶魔之间，{npc:267439}（精英，61 级）在营地里走动：把猎犬和哨兵拉到你这边来，远离它们。",
    ["You missed Darthalia's first errands, from the 23-25 {area:287} guide: they come first now. They are a few levels below you and quick, and they open the rest of the {quest:527} in this guide."] = "你错过了达萨利亚最早的几个任务（在 23-25 级的{area:287}指南里）：现在先做它们。它们比你低几级，做得很快，而且能解锁本指南里{quest:527}的其余部分。",
    ["You missed this on the Un'Goro guide's loop: through the pass and east along the northern cliffs to {area:541}. {npc:9997} stands beside the flight master."] = "你在安戈洛指南那一圈错过了这个：穿过山口，沿北边的悬崖往东到{area:541}。{npc:9997}站在飞行管理员旁边。",
    ["You missed this on the Un'Goro guide's loop: {npc:10302} the goblin sits at {area:543}, just east of the pylon."] = "你在安戈洛指南那一圈错过了这个：地精{npc:10302}坐在{area:543}，就在水晶塔东边。",
    ["You missed this on the route's earlier visit here: take it now, before the Bloodsail camp. Its gorillas live on the hills just above the camp."] = "之前路线经过这里时你漏掉了这个任务：现在去血帆海盗营地之前先接上。任务要打的大猩猩就在营地上方的山丘上。",
    ["You reached 50 in {zone:1447}: fly back to {area:1637} for {quest:4493} and your level 50 training, then on to {zone:1456}."] = "你在{zone:1447}升到了 50 级：飞回{area:1637}接{quest:4493}并进行 50 级训练，然后继续前往{zone:1456}。",
    ["Your Hearthstone is set at {zone:1455} (the {zone:1425} guide binds it there): hearth back to the inn from Un'Goro."] = "你的炉石绑定在{zone:1455}（{zone:1425}指南曾要求绑在那里）：直接从安戈洛环形山炉石回旅店。",
    ["Your trainer is in {area:1638}, on the way to {area:1099}."] = "你的训练师在{area:1638}，在去{area:1099}的路上。",
    ["Your {area:718} quests, if you have not taken them yet: {npc:3446} beside the WANTED poster, {npc:3665} on the dock by the flight master. The run is later in this guide, after {npc:3396}."] = "你的{area:718}任务，如果还没接：通缉令旁的{npc:3446}，以及飞行管理员旁码头上的{npc:3665}。下副本在本指南后面，{npc:3396}之后。",
