    ["the {object:2076} beside {npc:2519}: {quest:1261}, for {npc:4791} in {area:496} on the Dustwallow guide, where the crabs drop the pendant"] = "{npc:2519}旁边的{object:2076}：{quest:1261}，交给尘泥沼泽指南里{area:496}的{npc:4791}，那里的螃蟹会掉吊坠",
    ["the {zone:1458}'s classes trained there on the way"] = "{zone:1458}的职业顺路在那里训练",
    ["{area:1108}: the giants' hills"] = "{area:1108}：巨人山丘",
    ["{area:1108}: the water and the shore"] = "{area:1108}：水域与海岸",
    ["{area:135} is the troll cave in the hills south-west of {area:137}. Kill Headhunters at its mouth, then walk through the cave to its far end: Fully explore {area:135} ticks only in there, not on the hill above it.\nCareful: the Frostmane Hideskinners inside the Hold are level 9-10 and stand in pairs: pull them one at a time back to the mouth."] = "{area:135}是{area:137}西南山丘里的巨魔洞穴。先在洞口击杀猎头者，再一路走到洞穴最深处：完全探索{area:135}只有在洞内深处才会触发，在洞顶山丘上不算。\n小心：洞内的霜鬃剥皮者为9-10级且成对站位：把它们逐个拉回洞口打。",
    ["{area:1763} is the ruined temple north of the glen.\nCareful: the {npc:11141} (53, elite) haunts the west end of {area:1763}, around 35,60: work the south-east, where the arrow points, and pull the cultists and hounds away from him."] = "{area:1763}是林地北边的废墟神殿。\n小心：53级精英{npc:11141}盘踞在{area:1763}西端约35,60一带：在箭头所指的东南侧活动，把教徒和恶犬拉离它再打。",
    ["{area:1769}, {zone:1448} side"] = "{area:1769}，{zone:1448}一侧",
    ["{area:1770} is the cave at the back of {area:1763}, west of the road. Use the {item:12906} on the four braziers inside.\nCareful: Shadow Council mobs of level 53-55 fill the cave and often come in large linked groups, many with stuns: pull at the edge of each group and fight one pack at a time.\nThe Jaedenar Darkweavers, Warlocks and Enforcers in here drop a {item:13140}, about one kill in thirty: keep killing them until it drops. It opens the cell of {npc:11018}, the night elf held in the cave."] = "{area:1770}是{area:1763}后方、大路西侧的洞穴。对里面的四个火盆使用{item:12906}。\n小心：洞内挤满了53-55级的暗影议会怪物，往往成群联动且不少会昏迷技能：从边缘引怪，一次只打一组。\n这里的加德纳尔暗法师、加德纳尔术士和加德纳尔执行者会掉落{item:13140}，掉率约三十分之一：一直刷到掉为止，它用来打开洞内关押暗夜精灵{npc:11018}的牢门。",
    ["{area:1997} flight master"] = "{area:1997}的飞行管理员",
    ["{area:199}'s cauldron, later in this guide"] = "{area:199}的大锅，本指南稍后前往",
    ["{area:1}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1}：沿途遇到就顺手击杀",
    ["{area:201}'s cauldron, on this guide's ride north-east"] = "{area:201}的大锅，在本指南向东北骑行的路线上",
    ["{area:2407} stands by the road south of the fortress, on the way to {npc:11596}'s camp. {npc:11438} collects {object:176751}; they lie among the skeletons of the {area:596}, where {npc:11596}'s kodos are."] = "{area:2407}位于要塞南面的大路旁，就在去往{npc:11596}营地的路上。{npc:11438}收购{object:176751}，它们散落在{area:596}的骸骨堆中，也就是{npc:11596}要驯服的科多兽所在之处。",
    ["{area:2437} is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 13 to 18, and a full run takes 30 to 45 minutes. Its portal is in the {object:172960}, beside {npc:3216}.\nInside: past Oggleflint and his troggs, {npc:11520} waits in the lava cave and drops his heart. {npc:11518} and Bazzalan, further in, are for {quest:5726}' Ragefire part, which this route leaves out."] = "{area:2437}是五人副本，约 13 到 18 级，完整打一次要 30 到 45 分钟。入口传送门在{object:172960}，{npc:3216}旁边。\n副本内：过了奥格弗林特和他的穴居人，{npc:11520}在熔岩洞里，掉落他的心脏。更深处的{npc:11518}和巴札兰属于{quest:5726}的怒焰部分，这条路线不做。",
    ["{area:3197}: the cauldrons"] = "{area:3197}：天灾之锅",
    ["{area:340}'s poster"] = "{area:340}的通缉海报",
    ["{area:3425}'s last hand-ins can leave a player who followed only this route short of 60 (up to about a level for the slowest; most players less).\nWith a group: run the {area:2057} dungeon or the {area:2279} dungeon, in the Plaguelands by {area:3197} and {area:2268}.\nAlone: the Twilight's Hammer camps of {zone:1451}'s north-west (Twilight Avengers 57-59 and Geolords 58-60; leave the Flamereavers, 60) and the Stonelash Flayers and Rock Stalkers (57-59) around {area:3425} are at your level. {area:3425}'s repeatable quests open only at 60."] = "只走本路线的玩家交完{area:3425}最后一批任务后，距离60级可能还差一点（最慢的最多差近一级，多数玩家差得更少）。\n组队：去瘟疫之地{area:3197}和{area:2268}附近的{area:2057}或{area:2279}地下城。\n单人：{zone:1451}西北的暮光之锤营地（暮光复仇者57-59级、暮光地王58-60级，避开60级的暮光烈焰掠夺者）以及{area:3425}周围的石鞭掠夺者和石行蜘蛛（57-59级）都适合你的等级。{area:3425}的可重复任务要到60级才开放。",
    ["{area:367}, in southern {zone:1411}."] = "{area:367}，在{zone:1411}南部。",
    ["{area:431} is just north up the road. Coming in from the south, the flight master and {npc:12696}'s hunt board at {area:428} come first, then the vendors. {npc:12867} at the lumber camp offers {quest:6503}: leave it for the next {zone:1440} visit, at 26."] = "{area:431}就在大路北边。从南边过来，先到{area:428}的飞行管理员和{npc:12696}的狩猎告示板，然后是商人。伐木营地的{npc:12867}提供{quest:6503}：留到下次来{zone:1440}时再做，26 级。",
    ["{area:467} flight master"] = "{area:467}飞行管理员",
    ["{area:541} flight master"] = "{area:541}飞行管理员",
    ["{area:541}: {npc:9997} beside the flight master, {npc:9117} below ground."] = "{area:541}：飞行管理员旁的{npc:9997}，地下的{npc:9117}。",
    ["{area:720} lies off the {area:391} just south of {area:392}: wade over the sand bar shallows. {npc:6236} sends four challengers and then {npc:6238} (level 33) at you, one at a time."] = "{area:720}位于{area:392}正南方{area:391}外海：趟过沙洲浅滩即可到达。{npc:6236}会依次派出四名挑战者，最后派出{npc:6238}（33级）与你单挑。",
    ["{area:976} and the {zone:1427} at 47-49: the Wastewander camps, {npc:5955}'s escort and {area:1446}."] = "{area:976}和{zone:1427}，47-49 级：荒野游荡者营地、{npc:5955}的护送和{area:1446}。",
