    ["{item:14047}, for {npc:11557}, if you are Friendly with the Timbermaw"] = "{item:14047}，如果木喉要塞声望达到友善，可交给{npc:11557}",
    ["{item:14544}, from the same cultists; below ground"] = "{item:14544}，同样由这些教徒掉落；在地下",
