    ["{item:1946}: the {npc:511}, in the crypt of the cemetery just below"] = "{item:1946}：就在下方墓地的墓穴里，由{npc:511}掉落",
    ["{item:253247}: raise it beside Ylva, then hold the spot until {npc:269185} comes"] = "{item:253247}：在伊尔瓦身旁插起旗帜，守住阵地直到{npc:269185}现身",
    ["{item:254432}, from the same centaurs"] = "{item:254432}，来自同样的半人马",
