    ["{npc:1075} stands beside {npc:1071} in the dwarves' camp at {area:205}, east of the road; keep out of the {object:147516} ruins west of it, where Modr (32, elite) walks."] = "{npc:1075}站在大路东边{area:205}的矮人营地里，就在{npc:1071}旁边；别进西边的{object:147516}废墟，莫德尔（32级，精英）在里面巡逻。",
    ["{npc:10778}, upstairs in the farmhouse"] = "{npc:10778}，在农舍楼上",
