    ["{npc:10924}: for {npc:11079} in {area:2253}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{npc:10924}：交给{area:2253}的{npc:11079}，本指南稍后会去；先留着",
    ["{npc:11016}: lead her out of {area:1770}"] = "{npc:11016}：带她离开{area:1770}",
    ["{npc:11019}, at the Sanctuary's east side, takes {npc:11018}'s report."] = "圣所东侧的{npc:11019}收下{npc:11018}的报告。",
    ["{npc:11019}: {npc:9518}, in {area:1763}, on the last guide's ride north through {zone:1448}"] = "{npc:11019}：{area:1763}的{npc:9518}，在最后一个指南往北骑穿过{zone:1448}时",
    ["{npc:11038} offers {quest:5281} from level 55; under it, the next {spell:437801} stop offers it again."] = "{npc:11038}从 55 级起提供{quest:5281}；不到 55 级的话，下一个{spell:437801}站会再次提供。",
    ["{npc:11038}'s {npc:12250} is a group quest in the {area:2261} (a level 54 elite)."] = "{npc:11038}给的{npc:12250}是{area:2261}的组队任务（54级精英）。",
    ["{npc:11038}, by the graves south of the chapel: {npc:11140} is in {area:2627}, at the end of this ride: keep it"] = "{npc:11038}，在教堂南边的坟墓旁：{npc:11140}在{area:2627}，就在这趟行程的终点，先留着",
    ["{npc:11038}, if you didn't take {quest:5281} on the last stop"] = "{npc:11038}，如果你上一站没接{quest:5281}",
    ["{npc:11038}: for {npc:11140} in {area:2627} later in this guide"] = "{npc:11038}：交给本指南后面{area:2627}的{npc:11140}",
    ["{npc:11063} at {area:2268}, on this guide's second ride east: keep it"] = "{area:2268}的{npc:11063}，本指南第二趟往东走时会去：先留着",
    ["{npc:11063}'s Heroes of Darrowshire needs a group in {area:190} and a ride back here at the end: leave it."] = "{npc:11063}的「达隆郡的英雄」需要组队去{area:190}，最后还要骑回这里：别接。",
    ["{npc:11118} is in {area:2255}'s inn. She has more mail for you in {zone:1452}, outside this guide."] = "{npc:11118}在{area:2255}的旅店里。她在{zone:1452}还有你的信，不在本指南范围内。",
    ["{npc:11118}, in the inn: {quest:93406}"] = "旅店里的{npc:11118}：{quest:93406}",
    ["{npc:11118}, in {area:2255}'s inn, has more mail for you: the Ice Thistle Yetis in the hills south-east of town carry it. Keep it for the last guide, whose ride back north from {area:2249} crosses those hills."] = "{area:2255}旅店里的{npc:11118}又有你的信：镇子东南山里的冰蓟雪人带着它。留到最后一个指南，它从{area:2249}往北骑回来时会经过那些山。",
    ["{npc:11138}, the Alliance flight master"] = "{npc:11138}，联盟飞行管理员",
    ["{npc:11140} the ghost stands by a hut in {area:2627}, in the north-west corner; {npc:12384} sits inside the hut.\nCareful: Terrordale Spirits (59-60) drift through the north-west corner just north of {npc:11140}'s hut, and Crypt Horrors (57-58) and Crypt Walkers (55-56) stand around it; some of them root you. Walk in slowly and pull one at a time.\nCareful: a {npc:16184} (60, elite) walks {area:2627} and the {area:2626} south-west of it. Look for him before you ride in, and wait for him to pass."] = "幽灵{npc:11140}站在{area:2627}西北角的一间小屋旁；{npc:12384}坐在屋里。\n小心：恐惧谷的灵魂（59-60级）在{npc:11140}小屋正北方的西北角一带游荡，周围还有地穴恐魔（57-58级）和地穴巡逻者（55-56级），其中一些会把你定身。慢慢走进去，一次拉一个。\n小心：有一只{npc:16184}（60级，精英）在{area:2627}及其西南方的{area:2626}巡逻。骑进去前先留意他的位置，等他走过再去。",
    ["{npc:11406}: for {npc:8405} in {zone:1447}, at the end of this guide: keep it"] = "{npc:11406}：交给{zone:1447}的{npc:8405}，本指南最后会去：先留着",
    ["{npc:11438}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't give it"] = "{npc:11438}，如果第一次来{zone:1443}时还没接到",
    ["{npc:11438}: Tokal waits in {area:35}, at the end of the next guide"] = "{npc:11438}：托卡尔在{area:35}等你，下一份指南的最后会去",
    ["{npc:11556} stands at the {zone:1452} end of the tunnel"] = "{npc:11556}站在隧道通往{zone:1452}的一端",
    ["{npc:11557}, just inside the cave beside {npc:11558}, takes thirty {quest:6031} from Friendly with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there."] = "{npc:11557}就在洞口里面、{npc:11558}旁边，木喉要塞声望达到友善后收三十块{quest:6031}；跟着声望指南就能刷到友善。",
    ["{npc:11557}: keep 30 {quest:6031} for him; below ground"] = "{npc:11557}：为他留 30 个{quest:6031}；在地下",
    ["{npc:11558} stands just inside the {area:1769} cave: she needs Neutral with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there."] = "{npc:11558}站在{area:1769}洞口里面：需要木喉要塞声望达到中立；跟着声望指南就能刷到。",
    ["{npc:11558} takes the totem; the quest needs Neutral with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there."] = "{npc:11558}收这个图腾；任务需要木喉要塞声望达到中立；跟着声望指南就能刷到。",
    ["{npc:11610}'s last errand looks over {area:190}, among Scarlets of 58-60: leave it."] = "{npc:11610}的最后一个任务要看守{area:190}，周围是 58-60 级的血色十字军：别接。",
    ["{npc:11613} (56) walks the Northridge camp east of {npc:11610}; {npc:11611} (57) guards the tower at {area:190}'s southern approach.\nCareful: Guards stand at the tower's base and one more circles it on patrol. Clear them before you engage Durgen so they don't join the fight."] = "{npc:11613}（56级）在{npc:11610}东边的北山营地里巡逻；{npc:11611}（57级）守着{area:190}南面入口处的哨塔。\n小心：塔底站着守卫，还有一名绕塔巡逻。和杜尔根开打前先把他们清掉，免得引到一起。",
    ["{npc:11615}: his termites are in {area:2627}, later in this guide"] = "{npc:11615}：他要的白蚁在{area:2627}，本指南后面会去",
    ["{npc:11616}: the termites come later, in the {area:2277}"] = "{npc:11616}：白蚁稍后再去{area:2277}打",
    ["{npc:11754}, for {npc:9298}: walks around {area:2255}, look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:11754}，给{npc:9298}的任务目标：在{area:2255}周围游荡，留意地图圈内的区域",
    ["{npc:11755}: for {npc:10301} in {area:2253}, just back up the road"] = "{npc:11755}：交给{area:2253}的{npc:10301}，顺路回去就能交",
    ["{npc:11758} stands a few steps from Bilgewhizzle: the {area:983}."] = "{npc:11758}站在离比格维兹尔几步远的地方：{area:983}。",
    ["{npc:11758}: the {area:983} is on this guide's western loop"] = "{npc:11758}：{area:983}在本指南的西边一圈",
    ["{npc:11802} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:11802}站在他那栋楼的楼上：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
    ["{npc:11863}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't give it"] = "{npc:11863}，如果第一次来{zone:1443}时还没接到",
    ["{npc:11863}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't take the sceptre back to him"] = "{npc:11863}，如果第一次来{zone:1443}时还没把权杖交还给他",
    ["{npc:11863}: {npc:12369} (38) rises at the {object:177673}, for the south loop at the end of 30-40 (06b): keep it"] = "{npc:11863}：{npc:12369}（38级）会在{object:177673}处现身，等30-40级（06b）最后走南环线时再打：先留着",
    ["{npc:11886} lurks in the {area:2261}, the crypt just south of the {area:2260}.\nCareful: about four non-elite adds come with Mercutio. They walk to the grave instead of appearing on the spot."] = "{npc:11886}潜伏在{area:2261}，那是{area:2260}南边不远的墓穴。\n小心：大约四个非精英小怪会和墨丘提奥一起来。它们会走到坟墓那里，而不是直接刷新在原地。",
    ["{npc:1212}, in the Cathedral of Light"] = "{npc:1212}，在光明大教堂里",
    ["{npc:12340} stands at the village's south end, near {npc:12031}. At your level his {quest:6143} fits the walk north along the coast: the southern half of {area:598}, from level 34."] = "{npc:12340}站在村子南端，靠近{npc:12031}。以你的等级，他的{quest:6143}正好顺着沿海岸往北走的路线：{area:598}的南半部分，34 级起。",
    ["{npc:12340}, near {npc:12031}"] = "{npc:12340}，靠近{npc:12031}",
    ["{npc:12384} lives in the ruined hut in {area:2627}, and his receipt book lies in the ruined inn nearby. {npc:11140} stands by {npc:12384}' hut.\nCareful: a {npc:16184} (60, elite) walks {area:2627} and the {area:2626} south-west of it. Look for him before you ride in, and wait for him to pass."] = "{npc:12384}住在{area:2627}的破屋里，他的收据簿就在附近废弃的旅店中。{npc:11140}站在{npc:12384}的小屋旁。\n小心：有一只{npc:16184}（60级，精英）在{area:2627}及其西南方的{area:2626}巡逻。骑进去前先留意他的位置，等他走过再去。",
    ["{npc:1239}: a flagon of the inn's mead"] = "{npc:1239}：要一壶旅店卖的蜜酒",
    ["{npc:1239}: the Cursed Crew is for your next {zone:1437} visit, at about 29"] = "{npc:1239}：“被诅咒的船员”等下次再来{zone:1437}（约29级）时再做",
    ["{npc:1239}: {npc:1160} (30) is for the end of this visit, from level 29"] = "{npc:1239}：{npc:1160}（30级）等这次行程快结束、到29级后再打",
    ["{npc:13220} stands at {area:3077}, where the pass comes out."] = "{npc:13220}站在{area:3077}，就在山口出来的地方。",
    ["{npc:13220}'s next task goes to {zone:1450}: skip it."] = "{npc:13220}的后续任务要去{zone:1450}：跳过。",
    ["{npc:13841} camps beside the road north to {area:3197}."] = "{npc:13841}驻扎在向北通往{area:3197}的大路旁。",
    ["{npc:13843}: for {npc:13841}, on the way to {area:3197}"] = "{npc:13843}：交给{npc:13841}，就在去{area:3197}的路上",
    ["{npc:1416}: {quest:322}, from {npc:1217} in Menethil"] = "{npc:1416}：{quest:322}，在米奈希尔的{npc:1217}处接取",
    ["{npc:14724} and {npc:14723} each take sixty Wool, sixty Silk and sixty Mageweave, then sixty {item:14047}: hand in what you carry (or buy at the Auction House), skip the rest."] = "{npc:14724}和{npc:14723}各自收六十块毛料、六十块丝绸和六十块魔纹布，随后再收六十块{item:14047}：身上有（或去拍卖行买得到）的就交，其余跳过。",
    ["{npc:15170}, if Brann's letter dropped for you"] = "{npc:15170}，如果你掉了布莱恩的信",
    ["{npc:15174}, the innkeeper, takes the {object:180503}'s torn page."] = "旅店老板{npc:15174}收下{object:180503}撕下的书页。",
    ["{npc:15181} (from level 58): Bronzebeard's Encampment comes later, on the way south"] = "{npc:15181}（58级起可接）：铜须营地稍后往南走时再去",
    ["{npc:15182}, Captain of the Guard, pays out for {npc:15196}'s pincer."] = "卫兵队长{npc:15182}为{npc:15196}的钳子付赏金。",
    ["{npc:15187}, by the flight master where you land: for {npc:15191} in {zone:1451}, on the last guide; keep it"] = "{npc:15187}，就在落地处的飞行管理员旁：交给{zone:1451}的{npc:15191}，最后一份指南会去；先留着",
    ["{npc:15193}'s champion holds the {area:2260} farmhouse, north of the {area:2261}. His Ranger hunt (Rangers 59-60, in the north) is above you on this trip: leave it."] = "{npc:15193}的勇士占据着{area:2261}北边的{area:2260}农舍。他的游侠狩猎（游侠 59-60 级，在北边）这一趟对你来说太高：别接。",
    ["{npc:15196}, Terror of the Sands, is a level 59 elite scorpid patrolling the mountains by {npc:15190}'s satchel, at your level: a group choice. The wanted poster stands in the middle of the Hold; {npc:15182} pays out."] = "沙之恐惧{npc:15196}是 59 级精英蝎子，在{npc:15190}的挎包附近的山里巡逻，和你同级：组不组队自己决定。通缉令立在要塞中央，{npc:15182}付赏金。",
    ["{npc:15306}: his Twilight texts come from the dig"] = "{npc:15306}：他要的暮光密文来自挖掘场",
    ["{npc:16458}, in the inn"] = "{npc:16458}，在旅店里",
    ["{npc:1646} stands in {object:2098}, west of the {object:2096}: his compass is in his old house in {zone:1436}, on the way. His reply to {npc:3649} goes back to {area:442} with you."] = "{npc:1646}站在{object:2096}西边的{object:2098}：他的指南针就在顺路经过的{zone:1436}旧屋里。他给{npc:3649}的回信随身带回{area:442}。",
    ["{npc:1646}: {npc:3649}'s letter"] = "{npc:1646}：{npc:3649}的信",
    ["{npc:1646}: {quest:97926}, for {npc:3649} on your next {zone:1439} visit"] = "{npc:1646}：{quest:97926}，等下次去{zone:1439}时交给{npc:3649}",
    ["{npc:1748}, in {object:2117}"] = "{npc:1748}，在{object:2117}里",
    ["{npc:1855}'s next errand, Of Lost Honor, leads into the Mossflayer trolls (57-59) of the far north-east: leave it."] = "{npc:1855}的下一个任务「失落的荣誉」要去极东北的苔藓剥皮者巨魔（57-59 级）那里：别接。",
    ["{npc:1937}: bear hearts from the Grizzled Bears all over the forest, the spiders' blood in the north-west hills later"] = "{npc:1937}：熊心来自森林各处的灰熊，蜘蛛血之后到西北的山上收集",
    ["{npc:2055}, beside Zinge"] = "{npc:2055}，在津格旁边",
    ["{npc:215643}, whom Bibbly sent you to find, waits by the {object:56910}. He asks for a {item:4600}: {npc:2832} sells it in the tavern, a few steps away."] = "比布里让你找的{npc:215643}在{object:56910}旁等候。他要一杯{item:4600}：走几步进酒馆向{npc:2832}买就行。",
    ["{npc:216289}: ready to watch"] = "{npc:216289}：准备观看",
    ["{npc:2276}, inside, if the {zone:1424} guide didn't take it: the Syndicate camp is on the way to Arathi"] = "{npc:2276}（屋内），如果{zone:1424}指南里还没接：辛迪加营地就在前往阿拉希高地的路上",
    ["{npc:228216} stands between {area:2255}'s two flight masters. Her crate holds fragile cells that fizzle out in time and when knocked about: fly straight back to the {area:16853} and take it to {npc:249235} without detours or fights (about four minutes in the recording). If it fizzles out anyway, {npc:228216} fills it again."] = "{npc:228216}站在{area:2255}两个飞行管理员之间。她的箱子里装着易碎的电池，时间一长或者被磕碰就会失效：直接飞回{area:16853}，不绕路也不打架，把它交给{npc:249235}（录像里大约四分钟）。如果还是失效了，{npc:228216}会再装一箱。",
    ["{npc:239822}: {quest:88809}, the relics drop from the naga of the {area:1221} ahead"] = "{npc:239822}：{quest:88809}，遗物由前方{area:1221}的纳迦掉落",
    ["{npc:239822}: {quest:92345}, for {npc:4217} in {zone:1457}, on the {zone:1448} guide: keep it"] = "{npc:239822}：{quest:92345}，交给{zone:1457}的{npc:4217}，{zone:1448}指南会去：先留着",
    ["{npc:2410}'s quests in the inn and Alliance Relations in {zone:1454}, the next guide's first stop, are offered from level 30. Still short of 30 after these hand-ins? The Snapjaws (29-31) line the river just east and south of {area:272}: kill them until level 30, then walk back into town. Or, with a group, run the Excavation Site dungeon (in the {zone:1437}) instead."] = "旅店里{npc:2410}的任务和{zone:1454}的「联盟关系」（下一个指南的第一站）从 30 级起可以接。交完这些还不到 30 级？钳嘴龟（29-31 级）就在{area:272}东边和南边的河边：杀到 30 级再走回镇里。或者组队去刷挖掘场副本（在{zone:1437}）。",
    ["{npc:2418}, beside {npc:2393}: Hillsbrad Human Skulls, from the townsfolk and miners this guide fights next"] = "{npc:2418}，在{npc:2393}旁边：希尔斯布莱德人类头骨，来自本指南接下来要打的镇民和矿工",
    ["{npc:243815}: {quest:93197}: for {npc:11118} in {area:2255}, at the end"] = "{npc:243815}：{quest:93197}：最后交给{area:2255}的{npc:11118}",
    ["{npc:244511}: for {npc:254915} at the Summit, next"] = "{npc:244511}：接下来交给峰顶的{npc:254915}",
    ["{npc:244511}: {quest:96999}, for {npc:3187} in {area:367}, {zone:1411}; take it only if you'll pass by"] = "{npc:244511}：{quest:96999}，交给{zone:1411}{area:367}的{npc:3187}；只有你会路过那里时再接",
    ["{npc:244512}'s poultice is for two of the outpost's wounded: {npc:265895} lies at the north end of {area:16848}, {npc:265862} just south of {npc:244512}."] = "{npc:244512}的药膏是给前哨的两个伤员的：{npc:265895}躺在{area:16848}北端，{npc:265862}就在{npc:244512}南边不远。",
    ["{npc:244512}: {quest:96616}, on the way back from {area:16868}"] = "{npc:244512}：{quest:96616}，在从{area:16868}回来的路上",
    ["{npc:244517}: for {npc:254915} at the Summit, next"] = "{npc:244517}：接下来交给峰顶的{npc:254915}",
    ["{npc:2449}, on the west side of the town"] = "{npc:2449}，在镇子西边",
    ["{npc:2465}: for the {zone:1434} & {zone:1435} guide, at about 40"] = "{npc:2465}：用于{zone:1434}和{zone:1435}指南，约 40 级",
    ["{npc:2486}, beside the inn: Unbagwa's part on the {zone:1444} guide's {object:3202} stop"] = "{npc:2486}，在旅店旁边：安巴瓦的部分在{zone:1444}指南的{object:3202}站",
    ["{npc:2486}, beside the inn: {quest:348}"] = "{npc:2486}，在旅店旁边：{quest:348}",
    ["{npc:2486}, by the inn"] = "{npc:2486}，在旅店旁",
    ["{npc:248709} is an elite corrupted ancient (level 56) in the middle of the shrub field, back east: grouping up is advised."] = "{npc:248709}是精英腐化古树（56 级），在往东回去的灌木地中央：建议组队。",
    ["{npc:248709} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "{npc:248709}是精英：建议组队。",
    ["{npc:2491} and {npc:2486}"] = "{npc:2491}和{npc:2486}",
    ["{npc:2491}, in the inn, and \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor, offer these quests from level 40: pick them up now. Under 40, the {zone:1444} & {zone:1446} guide's {area:35} stop offers them again."] = "旅店里的{npc:2491}和顶楼的「海狼」麦金利从 40 级起提供这些任务：现在就接。不到 40 级的话，{zone:1444}和{zone:1446}指南的{area:35}站会再次提供。",
    ["{npc:249234}'s camp"] = "{npc:249234}的营地",
    ["{npc:249235}'s workshop"] = "{npc:249235}的工坊",
    ["{npc:2494}' Akiris by the Bundle waits for the level-48 {area:35} stop (its naga are 43-44): leave it for now."] = "{npc:2494}的“一捆海蛇草”留到48级再来{area:35}时再做（那里的纳迦是43-44级）：现在先别接。",
    ["{npc:2496}, on the balcony"] = "{npc:2496}，在阳台上",
    ["{npc:2496}: Cozzle's footlocker is in his house by {area:37}, on your way north to Nesingwary"] = "{npc:2496}：科兹尔的小箱子在{area:37}旁他的房子里，在你往北去奈辛瓦里的路上",
    ["{npc:2496}: for Pozzik at the {area:2240}, on the {zone:1444} & {zone:1446} guide's way"] = "{npc:2496}：交给{area:2240}的波齐克，在{zone:1444}和{zone:1446}指南的路上",
    ["{npc:2497}: for the {zone:1434} & {zone:1435} guide, at about 40"] = "{npc:2497}：用于{zone:1434}和{zone:1435}指南，约 40 级",
    ["{npc:2497}: {quest:2932}, for the {zone:1425}, around level 48"] = "{npc:2497}：{quest:2932}，用于{zone:1425}，约 48 级",
    ["{npc:2498}'s Zanzil's Secret waits for the same stop (Zanzil's village is 43-44): leave it for now."] = "{npc:2498}的“赞吉尔的秘密”同样留到那次再做（赞吉尔的村子怪是43-44级）：现在先别接。",
    ["{npc:250660}'s next errand sends you into the Venture Co. house at {area:37}, among Venture Co. Agents (39): leave it."] = "{npc:250660}的后续跑腿要你进{area:37}的风险投资公司屋子，里面全是风险投资公司特工（39级）：先别接。",
    ["{npc:2519}, if you didn't take it on the first stop: the trophy skulls stand in the Skullsplitter ruins, later on this loop"] = "{npc:2519}，如果你第一站没接：战利品头骨在碎颅者废墟里，在这一圈后面",
    ["{npc:2519}: {quest:598}, the trophy skulls stand in the Skullsplitter ruins, on this guide's second loop"] = "{npc:2519}：{quest:598}，战利品头骨在碎颅者废墟里，在本指南的第二圈",
    ["{npc:252711}, pulled to the arrow's spot, then {spell:1289727} on the pylon's west side"] = "{npc:252711}，拉到箭头处，然后在水晶塔西侧使用{spell:1289727}",
    ["{npc:2535} and Jon-Jon"] = "{npc:2535}和乔乔",
    ["{npc:254131} and {npc:260825} stand together at the {area:16867}."] = "{npc:254131}和{npc:260825}一起站在{area:16867}。",
    ["{npc:254501}, above Fenwick's head"] = "{npc:254501}，在芬威克头顶上方",
    ["{npc:254915}, at the Summit, for {npc:263406}'s message."] = "峰顶的{npc:254915}，交{npc:263406}的口信。",
    ["{npc:254915}, next to {npc:40833} at the Summit."] = "峰顶{npc:40833}旁边的{npc:254915}。",
    ["{npc:255683} and {npc:267109}"] = "{npc:255683}和{npc:267109}",
    ["{npc:255773}, the second kitten, plays just west of {npc:249234}'s camp."] = "第二只小猫{npc:255773}在{npc:249234}营地西边玩耍。",
    ["{npc:256222}'s shrine"] = "{npc:256222}的祭坛",
    ["{npc:256222}, the hermit, lives at the Hermit's Abode a little further south-west. He takes the cog too."] = "隐士{npc:256222}住在再往西南一点的隐士居所。他也收齿轮。",
    ["{npc:256899}, the two-headed ogre at the western edge of {area:16723}, is an elite (level 41): grouping up is advised. {npc:260931} wants both his heads, and the rest of the zone's ogre story waits on them: {quest:95420}, {npc:255829}'s quests and the {quest:94668} in {area:16726}, then {npc:258570}'s camp in the west (about 21,000 XP in all). Skip him and the guide leaves those out."] = "{npc:256899}是{area:16723}西边缘的双头食人魔，精英（41 级）：建议组队。{npc:260931}要他的两颗头，这片区域其余的食人魔剧情都要等他：{quest:95420}、{npc:255829}的任务和{area:16726}的{quest:94668}，然后是西边{npc:258570}的营地（总共约 21000 经验）。跳过他的话，指南会把这些都略过。",
    ["{npc:257058} and {npc:263440}"] = "{npc:257058}和{npc:263440}",
    ["{npc:257058}'s {item:265808} bushes grow on these slopes among the raiders' powder kegs, the last one a little to the north."] = "{npc:257058}要的{item:265808}灌木长在这些山坡上的掠夺者火药桶之间，最后一株稍微偏北。",
    ["{npc:257059} (45) is elite: a hard one-on-one fight in the ring, where nobody can help you. Come in rested, with full health and mana."] = "{npc:257059}（45 级）是精英：在擂台里一对一硬战，没人能帮你。带着休息经验、满血满蓝再上。",
    ["{npc:258048} waits at the back of the cave by the Twilight ogres' camp north-east of {npc:256728}: go all the way in to find him, then take him home to {area:16726} and keep the cultists off him. If he falls, take the quest from him again."] = "{npc:258048}在{npc:256728}东北暮光食人魔营地旁的洞穴深处等着：一直走到最里面找到他，然后护送他回{area:16726}，别让教徒伤到他。他死了的话，再从他那里接一次任务。",
    ["{npc:258048}, in the cave"] = "{npc:258048}，在洞里",
    ["{npc:258626} is a level 43 elite, at or above your level here: a hard one-on-one fight in the ring, where nobody can help you. Take it only rested, with full health and mana; {npc:257058}'s and {npc:263440}'s errands and the last two bouts come after him."] = "{npc:258626}是 43 级精英，这时和你同级或比你高：在擂台里一对一硬战，没人能帮你。只在有休息经验、满血满蓝时打；{npc:257058}和{npc:263440}的任务以及最后两场比赛都在他之后。",
    ["{npc:259158} in his cage"] = "笼子里的{npc:259158}",
    ["{npc:259158}: {quest:94961}, in his cage"] = "{npc:259158}：{quest:94961}，就在他的笼子里",
    ["{npc:260026} waits beside the road east of the pass.\nThis guide is written for levels 41-45: the route comes here at about 41, after {zone:1434}. The port's second wave and the Western Front's camps in the north are 43-45, with elite Twilight Enforcers (45) on patrol and {npc:256881} (46, elite) for groups only: below 41, do Stranglethorn first."] = "{npc:260026}在山口东边的大路旁等候。\n本指南适用于41-45级：路线会在打完{zone:1434}、约41级时来到这里。港口的第二波任务以及北边西部前线的营地都是43-45级，还有精英暮光执行者（45级）巡逻，{npc:256881}（46级，精英）只适合组队打：低于41级请先去荆棘谷。",
    ["{npc:260626}, the flight mistress"] = "飞行管理员{npc:260626}",
    ["{npc:261366}, the hermit on the ridge behind {npc:3682}: on the next {area:383} visit, with {npc:3452}"] = "{npc:261366}，{npc:3682}身后山脊上的隐士：下次去{area:383}时和{npc:3452}一起做",
    ["{npc:261366}, the hermit, stands on the ridge behind {npc:3682}'s camp."] = "{npc:261366}，那位隐士，站在{npc:3682}营地身后的山脊上。",
    ["{npc:263190}'s spears, on the Freshwater Crocolisks in the river"] = "{npc:263190}要的长矛，在河里的淡水鳄鱼身上",
    ["{npc:263406}, {npc:249052} and {npc:267121}"] = "{npc:263406}、{npc:249052}和{npc:267121}",
    ["{npc:263757}: decide his fate"] = "{npc:263757}：决定他的命运",
    ["{npc:264089} and the veteran"] = "{npc:264089}和老兵",
    ["{npc:264521} and {npc:244517}"] = "{npc:264521}和{npc:244517}",
    ["{npc:264}: the Plague Spreaders, with {npc:289}'s ghouls on the next trip west"] = "{npc:264}：打瘟疫食尸鬼，下次往西走时和{npc:289}的食尸鬼一起顺便清",
    ["{npc:265788}: {quest:91794}: the flag and the heraldry are in {area:16866}, later in this guide; keep it"] = "{npc:265788}：{quest:91794}：旗帜和纹章在本指南后面的{area:16866}；先保留",
    ["{npc:265895} and {npc:265862}"] = "{npc:265895}和{npc:265862}",
    ["{npc:266524}: {npc:266508} is in the {area:1440} caverns, on this loop"] = "{npc:266524}：{npc:266508}就在这趟环线会经过的{area:1440}洞穴里",
    ["{npc:266803} (Alliance) and {npc:266802} (Horde) wait together by the road a little inside the zone."] = "{npc:266803}（联盟）和{npc:266802}（部落）一起等在刚进区域不远的路边。",
    ["{npc:267} works in {area:42}'s town hall, a short walk from the flight master; {npc:661} stands just east of it."] = "{npc:267}在{area:42}的市政厅办公，离飞行管理员不远；{npc:661}就在市政厅东边。",
    ["{npc:267}: for {npc:295} in {area:87}, on the walk north to {zone:1453}"] = "{npc:267}：交给{area:87}的{npc:295}，往北去{zone:1453}的路上会经过",
    ["{npc:267}: {quest:66}, the footlocker in {zone:1436}'s {area:20}, at the west end of your next {zone:1431} loop (the {zone:1431} guide)"] = "{npc:267}：{quest:66}，提箱在{zone:1436}的{area:20}，下次走{zone:1431}环线（{zone:1431}指南）最西端时会去",
    ["{npc:268684} and {npc:268682} sit behind Grommash Hold in the {object:172957}; the Smooth Boulders lie around them. The next guide walks from here to {area:362}, then {area:379} and the Crossroads."] = "{npc:268684}和{npc:268682}坐在格罗姆什要塞后面的{object:172957}里，光滑的巨石散落在他们周围。下一个指南从这里走到{area:362}，然后是{area:379}和十字路口。",
    ["{npc:268684} and {npc:268682} sit behind Grommash Hold; the Smooth Boulders lie around them."] = "{npc:268684}和{npc:268682}坐在格罗玛什要塞后方；光滑的巨石散落在他们周围。",
    ["{npc:268705} stands by the path out of {area:2408}, on your way east: her Hatefury satyrs are at {area:603}, past {area:599} later on this visit."] = "{npc:268705}站在离开{area:2408}的小路旁，在你往东走的路上：她要的怒怨萨特在{area:603}，这次过了{area:599}之后再去。",
    ["{npc:272}: the six legs from the {area:1097}"] = "{npc:272}：收集{area:1097}掉落的六条腿",
    ["{npc:2784} holds court in the {object:171709}."] = "{npc:2784}在{object:171709}坐镇。",
    ["{npc:2817} buys nine Blue Pearls (Giant Clams on the sea floor, or the Auction House): this step shows only when you carry them."] = "{npc:2817}收购九颗蓝珍珠（海底的巨蚌掉落，或拍卖行买）：只有你身上带着时才显示这一步。",
    ["{npc:2921} wants a {item:3829} ({skill:171} or the Auction House): this step shows only when you carry one."] = "{npc:2921}要一个{item:3829}（{skill:171}或拍卖行）：只有你身上带着时才显示这一步。",
    ["{npc:2986} stands on a mesa top east of the Galak camps. Taking his {quest:1149} puts you on a high cliff far to the west: follow the stone path to the end of the wooden planks and step off there, and you land safely. Jump from anywhere else and you fall to your death."] = "{npc:2986}站在加拉克营地东边的一座平顶山上。接他的{quest:1149}会把你送到远在西边的一处高崖上：沿石路走到木板尽头，从那里跳下去就能安全落地。从别的地方跳会摔死。",
    ["{npc:3142}: {quest:99051}, from {zone:1411}'s naga beach"] = "{npc:3142}：{quest:99051}，来自{zone:1411}的纳迦海滩",
    ["{npc:3142}: {quest:99051}, if not handed in yet"] = "{npc:3142}：{quest:99051}，如果还没交的话",
    ["{npc:3169}, inside: for {npc:5810} at {area:379}, on the way out"] = "{npc:3169}（屋内）：交给{area:379}的{npc:5810}，出去的路上顺便交",
    ["{npc:3230}, in Grommash Hold: {quest:831}"] = "{npc:3230}，在格罗玛什要塞内：{quest:831}",
    ["{npc:3293} camps beside the road north to {zone:1454}, below {area:370}. The stolen sacks lie along the road just east of him."] = "{npc:3293}在{area:370}下方、向北通往{zone:1454}的路旁扎营。被偷的麻袋就散落在他东边的路边。",
    ["{npc:3294}, by the inn: for {npc:5875} in {zone:1454}"] = "{npc:3294}，在旅店旁：交给{zone:1454}的{npc:5875}",
