    ["{npc:8026}: for {npc:3453} in {area:392}, on your {zone:1445} trip at about 33 (30-40)"] = "{npc:8026}：交给{area:392}的{npc:3453}，约33级（30-40）去{zone:1445}时顺路交",
    ["{npc:8075} (level 50, elite) roosts on the cliff just north of the harpies' nests. Clear the harpies around her first."] = "{npc:8075}（50 级，精英）栖息在鹰身人巢穴北边的悬崖上。先清掉她周围的鹰身人。",
    ["{npc:8115}, if you don't carry it yet: the materials come on this loop"] = "{npc:8115}，如果你身上还没有：材料在这一圈里收集",
    ["{npc:8115}: for {zone:1454}, around level 47"] = "{npc:8115}：用于{zone:1454}，约 47 级",
    ["{npc:8390}, the Apothecarium: a {item:10695} comes with the quest. Keep four bag slots free and open it for Empty Vials Labeled #1 to #4, filled in {zone:1447} later"] = "{npc:8390}，在炼金房：接任务会附带一个{item:10695}。留出四个背包空位打开它，取出空瓶子#1到#4，稍后在{zone:1447}装满",
    ["{npc:8479}: {quest:3452}, for the next guide's crossing of the gorge at about 52 (its Twilight cultists, elites 47-50, are at your level now)"] = "{npc:8479}：{quest:3452}，用于下一个指南约 52 级时穿过峡谷（那里的暮光教徒是 47-50 级精英，现在和你同级）",
    ["{npc:8496}: the ash is in Un'Goro; inside"] = "{npc:8496}：灰烬在安戈洛环形山收集；在屋内",
    ["{npc:8579}: the screechers live in {zone:1444}, on this guide's west sweep"] = "{npc:8579}：尖啸者生活在{zone:1444}，在本指南往西扫荡的路上",
    ["{npc:8659} takes the ravasaur claws from Un'Goro; he stands at the top of a tower in the Drag."] = "{npc:8659}收安戈洛环形山的暴掠龙爪子；他站在暗巷区一座塔的顶层。",
    ["{npc:8659}, at the top of a tower in the Drag"] = "{npc:8659}，在暗巷区一座塔的顶层",
    ["{npc:8659}, at the top of a tower in the Drag, has {quest:4300} for later; then your class trainer before you leave for {zone:1447}."] = "暗巷区塔顶的{npc:8659}这里有{quest:4300}留着稍后做；出发去{zone:1447}前顺便找职业训练师学技能。",
    ["{npc:8659}, in the {object:172960}, has {quest:4300} for later; then your class trainer before you leave for {zone:1447}."] = "{object:172960}里的{npc:8659}有之后要做的{quest:4300}；离开去{zone:1447}之前先找你的职业训练师。",
    ["{npc:8659}: his payment goes back to {npc:8587}, on the flight out"] = "{npc:8659}：他的报酬要带回给{npc:8587}，在飞出去的路上",
    ["{npc:8737} in {area:541}, Un'Goro: keep it"] = "安戈洛环形山{area:541}的{npc:8737}：先留着",
    ["{npc:8997}, a short walk west of {npc:3693}: Argos's message from {zone:1453}"] = "{npc:8997}，在{npc:3693}西边走几步：从{zone:1453}带来的阿古斯的口信",
    ["{npc:9047} waits in the {area:1658}, west of the druids' building."] = "{npc:9047}在德鲁伊建筑西边的{area:1658}等候。",
    ["{npc:9047}, in the {area:1658}: {quest:3764}"] = "{npc:9047}，在{area:1658}：{quest:3764}",
    ["{npc:9084} stands in {area:340} beside the Hierophant. His {quest:3906} is {npc:9026} (52, elite), at the {area:1584} portal inside {area:254}, on the way through the mountain: a fight for a group."] = "{npc:9084}站在{area:340}的大祭司旁边。他的{quest:3906}是{npc:9026}（52 级，精英），在{area:254}里{area:1584}的传送门旁，穿过山的路上：需要组队打。",
    ["{npc:9116}'s Aquementas leads on to {zone:1446} and Un'Goro: leave it."] = "{npc:9116}的「阿奎门塔斯」接下来要去{zone:1446}和安戈洛：别接。",
    ["{npc:9116}'s next task, Silver Heart, sends you to the Irontree Stompers in the north and back here: skip it."] = "{npc:9116}的后续任务“银爪铁心”要你去北边打铁木践踏者再跑回来：跳过。",
    ["{npc:9116}'s next task, {npc:222647}, ends with {npc:3848} at {area:2358}, south of the route once {zone:1448} is done: skip it."] = "{npc:9116}的后续任务{npc:222647}要去{area:2358}找{npc:3848}交，打完{zone:1448}后它在路线南边不顺路：跳过。",
    ["{npc:9272}, {npc:9271}, {npc:9270} and {npc:9618} have quests among mobs of 51-55: leave them for the later Un'Goro visit, at about 54."] = "{npc:9272}、{npc:9271}、{npc:9270}和{npc:9618}的任务区域怪物都是51-55级：留到约54级再来安戈洛环形山时再做。",
    ["{npc:9298} camps beside the hot springs at the western end of the road."] = "{npc:9298}在大路西头的温泉旁扎营。",
    ["{npc:9298}, back west at the hot springs"] = "{npc:9298}，往西回到温泉那里",
    ["{npc:9299}, at the graveyard just east of {area:976}, later in this guide"] = "{npc:9299}，在{area:976}正东方的墓地，本指南稍后会去",
    ["{npc:9459}' next errand is in {area:1584}: leave it."] = "{npc:9459}的下一个任务在{area:1584}：别接。",
    ["{npc:9528} is in the ruins just down the road from the Sanctuary: he takes the six Corrupted Soul Shards (from both trips into {area:1770}) on the spot."] = "{npc:9528}就在翡翠圣地顺路下去的废墟里：他当场收走六块被污染的灵魂碎片（两次进入{area:1770}收集的）。",
    ["{npc:9616}' next task fills his jars in Un'Goro, behind the route now: skip it."] = "{npc:9616}的后续任务要回安戈洛环形山装满他的瓶子，现在走回头路了：跳过。",
    ["{npc:9619}'s corner has no flight master: ride north to {area:541} and fly to {area:976}."] = "{npc:9619}那个角落没有飞行管理员：往北骑回{area:541}，飞往{area:976}。",
    ["{npc:9684}'s lair lies in the jungle north of {npc:9619}, below the eastern cliffs: use {item:11568} there.\nCareful: {npc:9684} is level 56, a level or two over you here: start at full health, and clear the raptors around the lair first."] = "{npc:9684}的巢穴在{npc:9619}北边的丛林里、东侧悬崖下方：在那里使用{item:11568}。\n小心：{npc:9684}是56级，比你现在高一两级：满血开打，先把巢穴周围的迅猛龙清干净。",
    ["{npc:9861} and {npc:9860} guard {npc:9517} in {area:1770}'s deepest chamber, just past {npc:9518}.\nCareful: The three bosses fight as a group. Kill the nearby mobs first so you don't pull extra enemies."] = "{npc:9861}和{npc:9860}在{area:1770}最深处的房间里守卫着{npc:9517}，就在过了{npc:9518}的地方。\n小心：这三个首领会一起进战。先清掉周围的小怪，以免引到多余的敌人。",
    ["{npc:9861}, {npc:9860} and {npc:9517} (57) wait at the back of {area:1770}, the cave in {area:1763}'s north. Clear the tunnel as you go.\nCareful: The three bosses fight as a group. Kill the nearby mobs first so you don't pull extra enemies."] = "{npc:9861}、{npc:9860}和{npc:9517}（57 级）在{area:1770}深处等着，那是{area:1763}北边的洞穴。边走边清隧道。\n小心：三个首领会一起战斗。先杀掉附近的怪，以免拉到额外的敌人。",
    ["{npc:9997}, beside the flight master: {npc:9999} is found at the end of this loop"] = "{npc:9997}，在飞行管理员旁边：{npc:9999}在这一圈的终点",
    ["{object:1561}, beside him"] = "{object:1561}，就在他旁边",
    ["{object:177787}, beside the chest: its two keys drop only while you have the quest"] = "{object:177787}，在箱子旁：接了任务才会掉落它的两把钥匙",
    ["{object:177787}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't take it"] = "{object:177787}，如果第一次来{zone:1443}时还没接",
    ["{object:19868} lies all over the flats. Scorpid Reavers and Salt Flats Scavengers roam the north half, Sparkleshell Tortoises (30-31) the middle of the flats: hunt them for the shells. Careful: Sparkleshell Snappers (34-35) wander the whole flats, and the Saltstone Gazers (34-35) and Scorpid Terrors (33-34) hold the far south: leave them and keep to the north half.\nCareful: {npc:5935} (37, rare) roams the south-east of the flats, around 83-88,71-84: leave it be."] = "{object:19868}遍布平原各处。恐蝎劫掠者和盐湖食腐鹫在北半边游荡，盐壳龟（30-31级）在平原中部活动：打它们收集龟壳。小心：盐壳钳嘴龟（34-35级）满平原乱逛，最南边盘踞着盐石凝视者（34-35级）和恐蝎（33-34级）：别惹它们，尽量待在北半边。\n小心：{npc:5935}（37级，稀有）在平原东南部（大约 83-88, 71-84）游荡：别去惹它。",
    ["{object:20691}, inside the house"] = "{object:20691}，在房子里",
    ["{object:21042}: for Captain Vimes, on the way back through Theramore"] = "{object:21042}：回程经过塞拉摩时交给维米斯队长",
    ["{object:656786}: {quest:96998}, for {npc:244511} in {area:16848}; keep it"] = "{object:656786}：{quest:96998}，交给{area:16848}的{npc:244511}；先保留",
    ["{quest:1002} stands on the hill above the falls. He offers {object:17185} next: its bears are far south, for your next {zone:1439} visit."] = "{quest:1002}立在瀑布上方的山坡上。它接下来会给{object:17185}任务：要打的熊在很南边，留到下次再来{zone:1439}时再做。",
    ["{quest:1111}: for {npc:3945} in {area:35}, where the boat lands"] = "{quest:1111}：交给{area:35}下船处的{npc:3945}",
    ["{quest:1111}: {quest:1039}, from {npc:8026} in {zone:1457}"] = "{quest:1111}：{quest:1039}，在{zone:1457}的{npc:8026}处接取",
    ["{quest:1123} is in {zone:1450}, later in this guide."] = "{quest:1123}在{zone:1450}，本指南后面会去。",
    ["{quest:1123}'s house stands in {area:2361}, a short walk from {npc:11802}: hand her the letter from {zone:1457} on the way to the flight master."] = "{quest:1123}的房子在{area:2361}，离{npc:11802}不远：去飞行管理员的路上把来自{zone:1457}的信交给她。",
    ["{quest:177}: the ogres of Vul'Gol, on your {zone:1431} return"] = "{quest:177}：沃古尔的食人魔，等回{zone:1431}时再打",
    ["{quest:192} is still open: the Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk the jungle north of the mine, towards the Mosh'Ogg hills. They use Sneak, so they show only when you are close: pull them one at a time, and leave the Elder Shadowmaw Panthers (42-43) alone."] = "{quest:192}还没完成：影喉黑豹（37-38 级）在矿洞北边往莫什奥格山方向的丛林里潜行。它们会潜行，离得近才看得到：一次拉一个，别碰老年影喉黑豹（42-43 级）。",
    ["{quest:195} is still open: the Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt the jungle between {object:3202} and Nesingwary's camp, on your way north."] = "{quest:195}还没完成：鞭尾迅猛龙（35-36 级）在{object:3202}和奈辛瓦里营地之间的丛林里狩猎，在你往北走的路上。",
    ["{quest:270}, from {npc:1212} in {zone:1453}: {npc:1217} stands in the {area:2104}, south of the keep. His {quest:321} lies in the wreck just south of town, by {item:279915}."] = "{quest:270}，在{zone:1453}的{npc:1212}处接取：{npc:1217}站在要塞南边的{area:2104}。他的{quest:321}就在镇子正南边的沉船里，靠近{item:279915}。",
    ["{quest:277} is still short of its nine {item:2611}: the Mosshide Fenrunners and Trappers (22-24) along the river north-west of the Angerfang camp, south-west of {area:309}, drop them. Almost every one carries some.\nCareful: Maddened Rotclaws (25-26) roam the {area:1025} around {npc:1244}; Mosshide Brutes, Mystics and Alphas (24-27) hold the hills north-west of the Fenrunners' camp."] = "{quest:277}还缺九块{item:2611}：怒牙营地西北方、{area:309}西南方河边的藓皮沼泽行者和藓皮捕兽者（22-24级）会掉落，几乎每只身上都有。\n小心：疯狂的腐爪（25-26级）在{npc:1244}周围的{area:1025}游荡；藓皮蛮兵、藓皮秘法师和藓皮突击队员（24-27级）盘踞在沼泽行者营地西北方的山丘上。",
    ["{quest:288}, if the {zone:1440} guide's Menethil stop didn't do it: {npc:1239} wants a {item:2594} from {npc:1464}, both in the inn."] = "{quest:288}，如果{zone:1440}指南停靠米奈希尔时没做：{npc:1239}要一壶从{npc:1464}那里买的{item:2594}，两人都在旅店里。",
    ["{quest:293}, from {npc:1217} in Menethil: {npc:1284} stands in the Cathedral of Light."] = "{quest:293}，在米奈希尔的{npc:1217}处接取：{npc:1284}站在光明大教堂里。",
    ["{quest:3062}: {npc:8075} (level 50, elite) roosts above the Northspring harpies this loop ends at. Grouping up is advised: skip it if you are alone."] = "{quest:3062}：{npc:8075}（50 级，精英）栖息在这一圈终点的北泉鹰身人上方。建议组队：单人就跳过。",
    ["{quest:3378}: the page"] = "{quest:3378}：书页",
    ["{quest:3444} stands on the hill just south-west of the flight master."] = "{quest:3444}立在飞行管理员西南不远处的山坡上。",
    ["{quest:3909} comes from {npc:7775} in {zone:1444}, later in this guide. {npc:9298}'s next errand, Strange Sources, is at the mouth of {area:2256} among level 59-60 elites: it waits for the last guide's {zone:1452} loop."] = "{quest:3909}来自{zone:1444}的{npc:7775}，在本指南后面。{npc:9298}的下一个任务「奇怪的来源」在{area:2256}入口，周围是 59-60 级精英：留到最后一个指南的{zone:1452}一圈再做。",
    ["{quest:4084}'s {item:11172} and {item:11173} come from {area:1767} on this guide's ride north; {npc:9116} takes them at the end of the guide, back here."] = "{quest:4084}的{item:11172}和{item:11173}来自本指南往北骑时的{area:1767}；{npc:9116}在指南最后、回到这里时收下。",
    ["{quest:4301}: his north-east cave is on your way back here from {area:541}"] = "{quest:4301}：它东北的洞穴在你从{area:541}回到这里的路上",
    ["{quest:4494} needs level 50: {npc:7010}, in the Drag, gives it from then on. Under 50, it waits: if you reach 50 in {zone:1447}, this guide brings you back for it from {area:1237}; else the {zone:1447} guide at 55 offers it again."] = "{quest:4494}需要 50 级：之后在暗巷的{npc:7010}处可以接。不到 50 级的话先等着：如果你在{zone:1447}升到 50 级，本指南会从{area:1237}把你带回来接；否则 55 级的{zone:1447}指南会再次提供。",
    ["{quest:4882} goes on to {npc:5770} in {zone:1456}, off this route: leave it."] = "{quest:4882}接下来要找{zone:1456}的{npc:5770}，不在这条路线上：别接。",
    ["{quest:4882}, from the {item:12558}"] = "{quest:4882}，来自{item:12558}",
    ["{quest:5085}: {npc:9298}, on this guide's {zone:1452} loop: keep it"] = "{quest:5085}：交给{npc:9298}，本指南走{zone:1452}环线时会去：先留着",
    ["{quest:5121}, in the cave"] = "{quest:5121}，在洞里",
    ["{quest:5152}, back in the {zone:1422}: keep it"] = "{quest:5152}，要回{zone:1422}交：先留着",
    ["{quest:5242} is a group quest at this level: {npc:9861} (52), {npc:9860} (54) and {npc:9517} (57) fight together at the back of {area:1770}. Grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip it if you are alone."] = "{quest:5242}在这个等级属于组队任务：{npc:9861}（52级）、{npc:9860}（54级）和{npc:9517}（57级）会在{area:1770}最里面一起进战。建议组队，找人一起打；一个人就跳过。",
    ["{quest:5781} is a group quest: {npc:11886} (57, elite) and his adds in the {area:2261}."] = "{quest:5781}是组队任务：在{area:2261}面对{npc:11886}（57级，精英）和他的小怪。",
    ["{quest:5845}'s symbol lies in the lake south of the {area:2277}: your group fetches it before the ride back to {area:3197}."] = "{quest:5845}的徽记在{area:2277}南边的湖里：回{area:3197}前让队伍顺便去拿。",
    ["{quest:58}'s Plague Spreaders, from your last {zone:1431} visit: Commander Althea is in the town hall."] = "{quest:58}的瘟疫食尸鬼，上次来{zone:1431}时接的：指挥官阿尔泰娅在市政厅里。",
    ["{quest:6184} at {area:3197}, on the flight back"] = "{area:3197}的{quest:6184}，飞回去时顺便交",
