    ["{quest:67}: west from {npc:311}'s camp over the border into {zone:1436} and on to {area:20}, where the {object:3643} stands among the Defias (15-18). Then hearth back to {area:42}."] = "{quest:67}：从{npc:311}的营地往西跨过边界进入{zone:1436}，前往{area:20}，{object:3643}就在迪菲亚成员（15-18级）中间。拿完炉石回{area:42}。",
