    ["{quest:96130}, a lone wolf, prowls the plains west of the village. Prairie Stalkers and Flatland Cougars roam the plains north and west of it.\nCareful: {npc:3056} (12, a rare white wolf) roams the plains too: leave it be."] = "独狼{quest:96130}在村子西边的平原上徘徊。草原捕食者和平原狮在村子北边和西边的平原上游荡。\n小心：{npc:3056}（12级，稀有白狼）也在平原上出没：别去惹它。",
