    ["{quest:983} stands on the beach just south of the docks: once his crawler legs are in, he asks for Thresher Eyes. The Darkshore Threshers (12-14) swim in the shallows off the docks and up the shore to {area:452}; {quest:1001}, who takes the eyes, stands north of {quest:954} at the end of the first loop."] = "{quest:983}立在码头正南边的海滩上：交完蟹腿后，它会让你收集蛇颈龙的眼球。黑海岸蛇颈龙（12-14级）在码头外的浅海以及沿海岸一直到{area:452}一带游动；收眼球的{quest:1001}位于{quest:954}北边，就在第一趟环线的终点。",
