    ["{zone:1447} is a short flight from {zone:1454}: its quests are 51-55, at your level now."] = "{zone:1447}离{zone:1454}飞过去很近：那里的任务是 51-55 级，现在正适合你。",
    ["{zone:1448} is next: fly by way of {area:1237}, where {npc:8587} takes {npc:8659}'s payment, then on to {area:431}."] = "下一站是{zone:1448}：途经{area:1237}飞过去，在那里把{npc:8659}的报酬交给{npc:8587}，然后继续飞往{area:431}。",
    ["{zone:1448}'s southern hand-ins are next: ride back east to {area:2255}'s flight master, fly to {area:431} (by way of {area:1237}) and ride north into {zone:1448}, so the forest is ridden once, south to north."] = "接下来是{zone:1448}南部的交任务：往东骑回{area:2255}的飞行管理员，飞到{area:431}（途经{area:1237}），然后往北骑进{zone:1448}，这样森林只要从南到北骑一遍。",
    ["{zone:1451}, then Un'Goro and {zone:1446}."] = "{zone:1451}，然后是安戈洛和{zone:1446}。",
